<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LEV" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Leviuüa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Leviuüa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Leviuüa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Leviuüa</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow Mosi chekhai, now arui khin dow 1,440-1,410 <char style="w">BC</char> takra kowi chekhai. Mami bowih dow Mosi ruiah mih tanga klüng mih bowih kowi kowh sum lawmbawr mih chekhai. Mami bowih dow amülüngma hown chimsai lawnguan kowi kowh ruiah mih chekhai. Mami bowih dow Israel chenchapuüa hai uamowuüa vüi kawngmu rirow bowih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kawngmu rirow kowi kowh pawi chang krang, takua talawm krang, phuchua krang, tara chet krang, tachim tasai krang mami bowih kowi arui uowi. Now uamowuüa kowh lup chang krang paw mami bowih kowi arui uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Aia maru-uüa hown Thurai mih naia taklawp taiuala kownkow chimsaira nowm nowm lakke chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Thurai dow chimsaima chekhai. Taklowp taklangra te kowi Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi CHAKRAMANG tawi uowi reng rakowi Israeluüa mih chimsaima nauowila kownkow mami bowih kowi kowh rirow CHAKRAMANG peah mih chekhai. Aia dow asür alawkma mih kowi sui chekhai. Asür alawkma pami dow Thurai mik kowi chimsai dowi mih chekhai. Asür alawkma mih kowi dow kawngmu ri kowi uowi iawng sia sauah kown takla. Mami bowih kowi kowh lang pankri mih lawnguan dow chimsaira chekhai. Mami bowih hailawm Mosi ruiah mih tanga klüng mih bowih kowi dow ari arow bowih pahai Hebraiuüa tek pe khai.</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Chimsai: Chimsai pami dow Thurai mik kowi asür alawi uowi dowi mih chekhai. Maru, tawncher hai uanh mih Thurai mik kowi chimsaima mih dow angak uowi dowi, aprek uowi dowi hai mün ma uowi dowi mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Phuchuara: Phuchuara pami dow hua hown ün, lawngha hown ün thawpah mih uanap tikra krowng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Uamow: Uamow pami dow alai kowh Israeluüa chowng khe kawngmu rirow kowi kowh lup chang mih chekhai. Thurai pur kowi tawng ngai chow achang takla mih uamowuüa chang reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Uisawng: Uisawng pami dow la towng kowh masiuüa rirow chekhai. Masiuüa kowh dow malauüa khowk now la towng siri uanh hownia vi hawk reng. Naiawng uisawng uowi mih khin khe alai kowh Israel rirow kowi dow asürlawkma pahai dowkah reng.</para>
  <para style="ili">Uanap: Uanap pami dow Thurai kowi natüngla ringkawra kownkow pe mih uanh kowi tekah mih chekhai. Uanap dow maiow maiow uowi: Tikah mih uanap, taking tasangra uanap, kawmdi uanap, hüngah mih uanap, khamah mih uanap, chakkham uanap hai angak lawt lük müa uanap ün chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Achaing achaing mih phuchua rirow 1:1-7:38</para>
  <para style="io1">Arawn hai achapauüa kowi peah uamowra now nümnapah mih 8:1-10:20</para>
  <para style="io1">Tachim tasai mih hai tasür talawk mih lawnguan kowi kowh rirow 11:1-15:33</para>
  <para style="io1">Angak lawt lük ni 16:1-34</para>
  <para style="io1">Phuchua chang lawnguan kowi akeng mih rirow 17:1-16</para>
  <para style="io1">Chowlowkkow chowm krang uowi krang lawnguan kowi kowh rirow 18:1-22:33</para>
  <para style="io1">CHAKRAMANG pe mih achaing achaing mih pawi 23:1-44</para>
  <para style="io1">Maibu towngh hai chimsaima mih kawm mingkhet lawnguan, now CHAKRAMANG ming rük naklak mih kowh ripra lawnguan 24:1-23</para>
  <para style="io1">Tanai ning hai plan kata uanh iawk kown mih rirow 25:1-55</para>
  <para style="io1">Lai chün sung prasira hai lai üa sung piatira 26:1-46</para>
  <para style="io1">Takhamta mih hai hamüt bak kowi pabak pek rirow 27:1-34</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LEV 1" />
  <para style="ms">Uanap rirow</para>
  <para style="s">Tikah mih uanap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="LEV 1:1-2" />Akat khe <char style="w">taklowp taklangra te</char> lak hownia Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG hawah khai. Now Israeluüa kowi natek pe kownkow tek pe mih, “Enni pungmadawng kowi CHAKRAMANG kowi ap uanh kown nau mih che uowi khai hanow uang pawla tawncher büa diah. Chia chepaw, ruapur chepaw, rua chepaw uang pawla büa diah.<verse eid="LEV 1:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 1:3" />“Lowra maru tikah mih <char style="w">uanap</char> che chia hown chang kown nau khai hanow nami chia dow ala naown kown takla, now aser auowk paw naia uowi kown nadowi. Aia luk kowi ang CHAKRAMANG nasak-ihla kownkow nami chiala dow taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e aia nauang pawla kown. <verse eid="LEV 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 1:4" />Now tikah mih uanap nachangla kownkow uang pawla chiala mih maru mih nami chiala lu kowi aia kowh rut natangah kown. Nahanow aia kowh <char style="w">angak</char> nalawtta pe kownkow nami uanap mih CHAKRAMANG napaw pe kown. <verse eid="LEV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 1:5" />Now nami chiala dow taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e CHAKRAMANG pur kowi aia nangenah kown. Now uamowuüa dow nami chiala vi napawla hanow taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e kowh phuchuara<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Phuchuara </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow hua hown ün, lawngha hown ün thawpah mih uanap tik rah krowng chekhai.</char></note> kowi tavir lut nakrawi thetah kown. <verse eid="LEV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 1:6" />Nami tikah mih uanap chang müa chiala dow aia nakleu pe apik hanow naleah kown. <verse eid="LEV 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 1:7" />Now uamowuüa mih <char style="w">phuchuara</char> luk kowi nachang pe maih hanow nabawk pe sawp kown. <verse eid="LEV 1:7" /><verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="LEV 1:8-9" />Nami kung kowi dow phuchuara luk kowi kowh lün pluplup mih sawp luk kowi nami chiala kowh alu, akhawk, akawlakchak, asau hai aleia nanawmah kown. Tawkche akhawk hai akawlakchak maten dow narik sauah kown takla. Naiawng hai chiala papum nga mih phuchuara kowi <char style="w">uamow</char> natikta bowk kown. Nami dow chakkham uanap chekhai. Nami uanap nam hown dow CHAKRAMANG awmrawm reng chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 1:8-9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 1:10" />“Ruapur hown chepaw, rua hown chepaw tikah mih uanap che enni chang kown nau khai hanow nami dow ala naown kown takla, now aser auowk paw naia uowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 1:11" />Tawncher maten dow phuchuara tawngphak prakowi napawla now CHAKRAMANG pur kowi aia nangenah kown. Nami tawncher vi dow uamowuüa napawla now phuchuara kowi tavir lut nakrawi thetah kown. <verse eid="LEV 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 1:12" />Tawncher maten dow aia naleah hanow uamowuüa kowi nauang peah kown. Now asau hai alu hown aleia dow phuchuara luk kowi kowh lün pluplup mih sawp luk kowi uamow nanawmah kown. <verse eid="LEV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 1:13" />Akhawk hai akawlakchak maten dow uang ap miia nasauah hanow uamowuüa kowi nauang peah kown, now naiawngün hailawm tawncher papum mih nga dow phuchuara kowi uamowuüa natikta bowk kown. Nami dow chakkham uanap chekhai. Nami uanap nam hown dow CHAKRAMANG awmrawm reng chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 1:14" />“CHAKRAMANG vüi tikah mih uanap che uakling hown enni chang kown nau khai hanow kaurawng uatur chepaw, kimtawn uatur chepaw enni nauang pawla kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 1:15" />Naiawngün uatur dow uamow nahawt pawah hanow phuchuara kowi napawla kown. Nami uatur kowi dow naraita pe angawng hanow phuchuara ret kowi nachüng pe avi kown. Nami kung kowi dow nami uatur mih phuchuara kowi nanawmta bowk kown. <verse eid="LEV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 1:16" />Nami uatur daw hai apawi maten dow phuchuara satlawt pra kowh plawi kuakra kowi uamow nacham kuakah kown. <verse eid="LEV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 1:17" />Nami uatur dow alap pre buk kowi nadowkah hanow tapra kuak mowr tarai dowi krowngchow nathükah kown. Nami kung kowi dow nami uakling mih phuchuara luk kowi kowh lün pluplup mih maih kowi uamow nanawmah kown. Nami dow chakkham uanap chekhai. Nami uanap nam hown dow CHAKRAMANG awmrawm reng chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LEV 2" />
  <para style="s">Kawmdi uanap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 2:1" />“CHAKRAMANG vüi kawmdi uanap che enni uang ap kown nau khai hanow kawmdi aiungma mih nauang ap kown takla. Nami kawmdi luk kowi dow enni naklai pe kanrawn sau kown, now anam iungma mih maikhük towk müa <char style="w">than</char> paw nami luk kowi enni natowla pe kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 2:2" />Nami kawmdi dow uamowuüa tut-e enni nauang pawla kown, now nami kawmdi uanap hownia naap-ah kown mih krowngchow uamow napawah achawm hanow phuchuara kowi kowh maih kowi nanawmah kown. Nami dow CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi apta khowk pami amat müa chekhai. Nami dow chakkham uanap chekhai. Nami uanap nam hown dow CHAKRAMANG awmrawm reng chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 2:3" />Nami kawmdi uanap kowi kowh ta lat mih srui dow uamowuüa kowh vüi bak naown kown. Naiawngün ta lat mih dow CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi ap-ah mih chekhai rakowi chimsaima chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 2:4" />“Kawmdi uanap che taping kowi kowh awpah mih kawm hown enni nauang ap kown nau khai hanow kawmdi lang iung mih hown kowh thawpah mih kawm naown kown takla. Nami kawm dow kanrawn sau hown kowh lawkah mih lah, plik pe sau mih lah enni nauang pawla kown. Tawkche naiawngün kawm kowi mih enni nathela pe <char style="w">tuah</char> kown nadowi.<verse eid="LEV 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 2:5" />“Kawmdi uanap che apherklapma mih angai müa hown enni heuah mih chekhai hanow kawmdi lang iung mih kowi kowh lawk pe kanrawn sau mih kawm naown kown takla. Nami kawm kowi paw enni nathela pe tuah kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 2:6" />Nami kung kowi dow naiawngün kawm mih enni nasekah hanow naklai pe kanrawn sau kown takla; nami paw kawmdi uanap chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 2:7" />“Kawmdi uanap che puh hown kowh ngaiah mih kawm hown enni nauang ap kown nau khai hanow kawmdi lang iung mih kowi lawk pe kanrawn sau mih hown kowh thawpah mih kawm naown kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 2:8" />CHAKRAMANG vüi uang pawla mih naiawngün kawmdi uanap maten dow uamowuüa rut kowi enni nauang peah kown, now naiawngün dow phuchuara kowi uamow nakowpawla kown. <verse eid="LEV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 2:9" />Now kawmdi uanap maten hownia uamow napawah achawm hanow phuchuara kowi kowh maih kowi nanawmah kown. Nami dow CHAKRAMANG vüi apta khowk pami amat müa chekhai. Nami dow chakkham uanap chekhai. Nami uanap nam hown dow CHAKRAMANG awmrawm reng chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 2:10" />Nami kawmdi uanap kowi kowh ta lat mih srui dow uamowuüa kowh vüi bak naown kown. Naiawngün ta lat mih dow CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi ap-ah mih chekhai rakowi achimsaima chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 2:11" />“CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi kowh uang pawla mih kawmdi uanap maten kowi enni nathela pe tuah kown nadowi. CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi kowh chakkham uanap kowi tuah lah, kuai tui lah enni nathe kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 2:12" />Nachenganchepaw enni uang ap uih müng khe dow tuah hai kuai tui mih CHAKRAMANG pur kowi enni nauang ia pawla kown. Tawkche tuah hai kuai tui dow phuchuara kowi kowh maih kowi katpaw enni natikla kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 2:13" />Now kawmdi uanap kowi kowh enni uang pawla mih uanh maten kowi dow enni nathela pe awisa reng kown takla. Nahanow enni Israeluüa hown Thurai kowh chowngchowng saksakma mih<char style="w">sangbowk laitawm</char> dow enni naka tuak kown towbowt. Enni kowh kawmdi uanap kowi dow awisa thek enni naia tamata kown nadowi. Enni kowh uanap maten kowi enni nathela awisa ngengche kown takla.<verse eid="LEV 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 2:14" />“CHAKRAMANG vüi uih-ien pantawn kowi kowh uih müng enni uang ap khe dow arumma enni natungah now nahaiah kown takla. Now nami ahaiia dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e enni nauang pawla kown. <verse eid="LEV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 2:15" />Nami luk kowi dow enni naklai pe kanrawn sau kown, now anam iungma mih maikhük towk müa than paw enni natowla kown takla. Nami dow kawmdi uanap chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 2:16" />Now kawmdi uanap maten hownia uamow napawah achawm hanow phuchuara kowi kowh maih kowi nanawmah kown. Nami dow CHAKRAMANG vüi apta khowk pami amat müa chekhai. Nami dow chakkham uanap chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LEV 3" />
  <para style="s1">Taking tasangra uanap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 3:1" />CHAKRAMANG plan tek mih, “Lowra maru CHAKRAMANG hown taking tasangra nauowila kownkow taking tasangra uanap che chia hown chang kown nau khai hanow nami chia mih ala lah, ama lah aser auowk naia uowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 3:2" />Nachangla <char style="w">phuchua</char> kownkow uang pawla chia mih maru dow nami chia lu kowi aia kowh rut natangah kown. Nami chia dow taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e aia nangenah kown. Nami chia vi dow uamowuüa napawla hanow phuchuara kowi tavir lut nakrawi thetah kown. <verse eid="LEV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 3:3" />Nami taking tasangra uanap chang müa ngar kowi kowh kawlak sau maten dow CHAKRAMANG vüi chakkham uanap nachangla kownkow uamowuüa kowi napeah kown. Naiawngün dow riaklah sau, akeng mih sau, <verse eid="LEV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 3:4" />asau hailawm akia pre buk hai plawng ram lang iuk mih chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 3:5" />Naiawngün dow phuchuara kowi kowh lün pluplup mih sawp luk kowi uamowuüa nakownawmah kown. Nami dow chakkham uanap chekhai. Nami uanap nam hown dow CHAKRAMANG awmrawm reng chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 3:6" />“Lowra maru CHAKRAMANG hown taking tasangra nauowila kownkow taking tasangra uanap che ruapur hown chepaw, rua hown chepaw chang kown nau khai hanow nami ruapur hai rua mih ala lah, ama lah aser auowk naia uowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 3:7" />Uanap chang müa kowi ruapur chah che uang pawla khai hanow uang chang phuchua mih maru nami ruapur chah kowi taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nakowpawla kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 3:8" />Now uang pawla ruapur chah mih maru mih nami ruapur chah lu kowi aia kowh rut natangah kown. Nami ruapur chah dow taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e aia nangenah kown. Now nami ruapur chah vi dow uamowuüa napawla hanow phuchuara kowi tavir lut nakrawi thetah kown. <verse eid="LEV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 3:9" />Nami taking tasangra uanap chang müa ngar kowi kowh kawlak sau maten dow CHAKRAMANG vüi nachangla chakkham uanap kownkow uamowuüa kowi napeah kown. Naiawngün dow amai tut, riaklah sau, akeng mih sau, <verse eid="LEV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 3:10" />akia pre buk hai akia kowi kowh tabawm mih sau hai plawng ram lang iuk mih chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 3:11" />Naiawngün dow phuchuaah mih chakkham iawng hai phuchuara luk kowi uamow lowk ia mih natikah kown. Nami dow CHAKRAMANG vüi chakkham uanap chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 3:12" />“Nachangla phuchua kownkow rua che uang pawla khai hanow nami rua dow taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nakowpawla kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 3:13" />Now uang pawla rua mih maru dow nami rua lu kowi aia kowh rut mih natangah kown. Nami rua dow taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e aia nangenah kown. Now nami rua vi dow uamowuüa napawah hanow phuchuara kowi tavir lut nakrawi thetah kown. <verse eid="LEV 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 3:14" />Nami taking tasangra uanap chang müa ngar kowi kowh kawlak sau maten dow CHAKRAMANG vüi nachangla chakkham uanap kownkow uamowuüa kowi napeah kown. Naiawngün dow riaklah sau, akeng mih sau, <verse eid="LEV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 3:15" />akia pre buk hai akia kowi kowh tabawm mih sau hai plawng ram lang iuk mih chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 3:16" />Naiawngün dow phuchuaah mih chakkham uanap iawng hai phuchuara luk kowi uamowuüa natikah kown. Nami dow chakkham uanap chekhai. Nami uanap nam hown dow CHAKRAMANG awmrawm reng chekhai. Phuchuala mih tawncher sau maten dow CHAKRAMANG vüi bak chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 3:17" />Asau hai avi dow enni naiung cha kown nadowi. Nami dow lowra kowi enni cham uowi chepaw chowngchowng saksakma pat enni vüi ari arow naown kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LEV 4" />
  <para style="ms">Tawita mata mih angak lawt lük müa uanap rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="LEV 4:1-2" />Maiawngün laiklow Israeluüa kowi nakowtek pe kownkow Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Lowra maru CHAKRAMANG <char style="w">ana pek</char> kowi kowh hangah mih sia dow tawita mata khai hanow nami maru mih maiawng nachang kown takla.<verse eid="LEV 4:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uamow lang kri mih vüi angak lawt lük müa uanap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 4:3" />“Uamow lang kri mih che changta <char style="w">angak</char> khai hanow maru-uüa luk kowi <char style="w">aprek</char> nauang kla kown. Naiawng rakowi uamow lang kri mih dow aia kowh angak lawt lük müa uanap nachangla kownkow CHAKRAMANG tut-e aser auowk uowi dowi mih chiala powrchow nauang pawla papum kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 4:4" />Nami chiala powrchow dow taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e CHAKRAMANG pur kowi uamow lang kri mih nakowpawla kown. Aia mih nami chiala lu kowi aia kowh rut natangah kown. Nami chiala dow taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e CHAKRAMANG pur kowi aia nangenah kown. <verse eid="LEV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 4:5" />Now nami chiala powrchow vi dow uamow lang kri mih napawah sangrum hanow taklowp taklangra te lak kowi kowh chimsaima mih arah kowi nakowpawla kown. <verse eid="LEV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 4:6" />Nami vi kowi dow aia kowh rutchawk nachimah hanow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi arah chimsaima mih kowi kowh krala mih uaniang pur kowi ranit kat aia nathetah kown. <verse eid="LEV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 4:7" />Now nami chiala powrchow vi plan pawah sangrum hanow taklowp taklangra te lak kowi CHAKRAMANG pur kowi kowh anam iungma mih maikhük towk müa phuchuara kowi kowh anang kowi uamow nakrawi plikah kown. Nami kung kowi dow ta lat mih vi mih taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e kowh tikah mih uanap chang müa phuchuara daw kowi uamow nakhükta kown.<verse eid="LEV 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 4:8" />“Nami kung kowi dow angak lawt lük müa uanap nachangla kownkow uang pawla mih chiala powrchow kowh sau napawta pe bowk kown. Naiawngün dow riaklah sau, akeng mih sau, <verse eid="LEV 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 4:9" />asau hailawm akia pre buk mih hai plawng ram lang iuk mih chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 4:10" />Taking tasangra uanap kowi kowh sunah mih chia kowi pawta pe asau iawng nami angak lawt lük müa uanap kowi kowh chiala powrchow kowi paw napaw pe asau kown. Naiawngün sau dow tikah mih uanap chang müa phuchuara luk kowi uamow nanawmah kown. <verse eid="LEV 4:10" /><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="LEV 4:11-12" />Nachenganchepaw nami chiala powrchow kowh apik, anga, alu, aklowng, akih hailawm aria ün dow <char style="w">tangbung khup rah</char> uat kowi cham pawla hanow lang kraah mih plawi kuakra kowi kowh lün pluplup mih sawp luk kowi nanawmah kown.<verse eid="LEV 4:11-12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel pachenma vüi angak lawt lük müa uanap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 4:13" />“Israel pachenma che CHAKRAMANG ana pek kowi kowh hangah mih sia tawita mata khai hanow nami dow amatni tuk dowi chepaw amatni luk kowi aprek nauowi kown. <verse eid="LEV 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 4:14" />Amatni changta angak mih amatni tatuk mih khin khe dow angak lawt lük müa uanap nachangla kownkow taklowp taklangra te pur kowi nauang pawla chiala apum kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 4:15" />Nami chiala lu kowi dow Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa CHAKRAMANG pur kowi amatni kowh rut natangah kown. Now nami chiala dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nangenah büah kown. <verse eid="LEV 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 4:16" />Nami chiala vi dow uamow lang kri mih napawah sangrum hanow taklowp taklangra te kowi nakowpawla kown. <verse eid="LEV 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 4:17" />Nami vi kowi dow aia kowh rutchawk nachimah hanow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi arah chimsaima mih kowi kowh krala mih uaniang pur kowi ranit kat aia nathetah kown. <verse eid="LEV 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 4:18" />Now nami chiala vi plan pawah sangrum hanow taklowp taklangra te lak kowi CHAKRAMANG pur kowi kowh anam iungma mih maikhük towk müa phuchuara kowi kowh anang kowi uamow nakrawi plikah kown. Ta lat mih vi dow taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e kowh tikah mih uanap chang müa phuchuara daw kowi uamow nakhükta kown. <verse eid="LEV 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 4:19" />Nami chiala sau dow napawta pe bowk hanow phuchuara luk kowi uamow nanawmah kown. <verse eid="LEV 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 4:20" />Angak lawt lük müa uanap kowi kowh chiala kowi changla phuchua iawng nami chiala kowi paw uamow nachangla phuchua kown. Nahanow Israeluüa kowi mih Thurai nalawtah kown towbowt. <verse eid="LEV 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 4:21" />Nami kung kowi dow nami chiala kowi mih <char style="w">tangbung</char> khup rah uat kowi uamow nacham pawla kown, now angak lawt lük müa uanap kowi kowh chiala kowi tikah iawng nami chiala kowi paw uamow natikah kown. Nami dow Israel pachenma kowh angak lawt lük müa uanap chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aluchow vüi angak lawt lük müa uanap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 4:22" />“Aluchow mih che CHAKRAMANG ana pek kowi kowh hangah mih sia kowi tawita mata khai hanow nami dow aia tuk dowi chepaw aia luk kowi aprek nauowi kown. <verse eid="LEV 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 4:23" />Aia changta angak mih aia tatuk mih khin khe angak lawt lük müa aser auowk uowi dowi mih ruala aia nauang pawla apum kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 4:24" />Nami ruala lu kowi mih aia kowh rut aia natangah kown. Nami ruala dow tikah mih uanap kowi kowh tawncher ngenra re-e CHAKRAMANG pur kowi aia nangenah kown. Nami dow angak lawt lük müa uanap chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 4:25" />Angak lawt lük müa uanap kowi kowh ruala vi kowi dow uamow mih aia kowh rutchawk nachimah hanow tikah mih uanap chang müa phuchuara kowi kowh anang kowi nakrawi plikah kown, now ta lat mih vi dow phuchuara daw kowi nakhükta kown. <verse eid="LEV 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 4:26" />Taking tasangra uanap kowi kowh tawncher sau tikah iawng nami ruala sau paw phuchuara luk kowi natikah kown. Nahanow nami aluchow kowi mih Thurai nalawtah kown towbowt.<verse eid="LEV 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iawngpa mih maru vüi angak lawt lük müa uanap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 4:27" />“Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi iawngpa mih maru che CHAKRAMANG ana pek kowi kowh hangah mih sia kowi tawita mata khai hanow nami dow aia tuk dowi chepaw aia luk kowi aprek nauowi kown. <verse eid="LEV 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 4:28" />Aia changta ngak mih aia tatuk mih khin khe angak lawt lük müa aser auowk uowi dowi mih ruama aia nauang pawla apum kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 4:29" />Nami maru mih angak lawt lük müa ruama lu kowi aia kowh rut natangah kown. Nami ruama dow tikah mih uanap kowi kowh tawncher ngenra re-e nangenah kown. <verse eid="LEV 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 4:30" />Nami ruama vi kowi dow uamow mih aia kowh rutchawk nachimah hanow tikah mih uanap chang müa phuchuara kowi kowh anang kowi nakrawi plikah kown, now ta lat mih vi dow phuchuara daw kowi aia nakhükta kown. <verse eid="LEV 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 4:31" />Taking tasangra uanap chang müa tawncher kowi kowh pawta pe asau iawng nami angak lawt lük müa uanap kowi kowh tawncher kowi paw uamow napawta pe asau kown. Naiawngün sau dow phuchuara luk kowi uamow nanawmah kown. Nami uanap nam hown dow CHAKRAMANG awmrawm reng chekhai. Nahanow aia kowi mih Thurai nalawtah kown towbowt.<verse eid="LEV 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 4:32" />“Nachenganchepaw nami maru che angak lawt lük müa ruama takcha ruapur chah che uang pawla khai hanow nami ruapur chah mih aser auowk uowi dowi mih aiia naown kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 4:33" />Nami ruapur iia lu kowi mih aia kowh rut natangah kown. Nami ruapur iia dow tikah mih uanap kowi kowh tawncher ngenra re-e nangenah kown. <verse eid="LEV 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 4:34" />Nami angak lawt lük müa uanap kowi kowh ruapur iia vi kowi mih aia kowh rutchawk uamow nachimah hanow tikah mih uanap chang müa phuchuara kowi kowh anang kowi nakrawi plikah kown, now ta lat mih vi dow phuchuara daw kowi aia nakhükta kown. <verse eid="LEV 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 4:35" />Taking tasangra uanap kowi kowh ruapur kowi pawta pe asau iawng nami angak lawt lük müa uanap kowi kowh ruapur iia kowi paw uamow napawta pe asau kown. Naiawngün sau dow CHAKRAMANG vüi maih kowi kowh tikah mih uanh luk kowi natikah kown. Nahanow aia kowi mih Thurai nalawtah kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 4:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LEV 5" />
  <para style="s">Akeng mih angak lawt lük müa uanap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 5:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Lowra maru aiamat khi-ah mih lah, taah mih lah nami lawnguan kowi chet tara mih khin khe tawi thuak saksi kownkow ka khin chepaw naia kown. Nami khin khe tara chet miuüa pur kowi tawngpaw tawi tek dowi kowh chalow now nami maru luk kowi mih angak nauowi kown. Now nami angak rakowi aia mih naka <char style="w">ripra</char> kown.<verse eid="LEV 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 5:2" />“Lowra maru tuk dowi kowh asür alawkma mih chap kakta khai hanow aia mih natasür talawk kown. Kaurawng uaramchak uak lah, tawncher uak lah, krawng kowi kowh kam hai sowr mih asadua uak lah kakta khai hanow aia mih natasür talawk kown. Aia luk kowi mih aprek nauowi kown.<verse eid="LEV 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 5:3" />“Lowra maru tuk dowi kowh kow kowi kowh asür alawkma awr phaw mih kakta khai chepaw nami aia tatuk kung kowi dow aia luk kowi aprek nauowi kown.<verse eid="LEV 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 5:4" />“Lowra maru aiung lawnguan lah, angak lawnguan lah tuakah kaneu dowi kowi khamta sawi khai hanow nami maru mih aia tuk dowi chepaw aia tuk kung kowi aia luk kowi aprek nauowi kown.<verse eid="LEV 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 5:5" />“Lowra maru naiawngün angak changta kowh ka aprek khai hanow aia changta angak mih nataphuang kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 5:6" />Now aia kowh angak rakowi iawk müa iawng hai CHAKRAMANG vüi ruapur iia chepaw, rua iia chepaw nauang pawla apum kown takla. Nami hown aia kowh angak lawt müa uamow nachangla phuchua kown. Nahanow aia kowi mih Thurai nalawtah kown towbowt.<verse eid="LEV 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 5:7" />“Nami maru che aia kowh angak rakowi iawk müa iawng hai CHAKRAMANG vüi ruapur iia uang ia pawla dowi hanow kaurawng uatur chepaw, kimtawn uatur chepaw nauang pawla pre buk chi kown takla. Nami pre buk mih hownia lowk dow angak lawt lük müa uanap vüi, now alowk mih dow tikah mih uanap vüi chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 5:8" />Nami uatur mih uamow kowi nauang peah kown. Now uamow dow angak lawt lük müa uanap vüi uang pawla mih uatur hown narik chang phuchua kown. Nami uatur kowi mih alu tarai dowi krowngchow namer pe angawng kown. <verse eid="LEV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 5:9" />Nami uatur vi dow napawah sangrum hanow phuchuara tapat lut nakrawi thetah kown, now ta lat mih vi dow phuchuara daw kowi uamow nachüngah kown; nami dow angak lawt lük müa uanap chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 5:10" />Now alowk mih uatur hown paw rirow kowi uowi iawng tikah mih uanap nachangla kown. Nahanow nami maru kowi mih Thurai nalawtah kown towbowt.<verse eid="LEV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 5:11" />“Nami maru che kaurawng uatur chepaw, kimtawn uatur chepaw pre buk chi uang ia pawla dowi hanow angak lawt lük müa uanap vüi kawmdi aiungma mih aset hown 400 gram aia nauang pawla kown takla. Nami dow angak lawt lük müa uanap chekhai rakowi nami kawmdi kowi mih nathe pe sau kown nadowi, now than paw natowla pe kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 5:12" />Nami kawmdi mih uamow tut-e aia nakowpawla kown takla. Nami kawmdi hownia uamow napawah achawm hanow CHAKRAMANG vüi chakkham uanap chang müa phuchuara kowi nanawmah kown. Nami dow CHAKRAMANG vüi apta khowk pami amat müa chekhai. Nami dow angak lawt lük müa uanap chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 5:13" />Nami uanap hownia dow nami maru kowi Thurai nalawtah kown towbowt. Nami uanap kowi kowh ta lat mih kawmdi dow kawmdi uanap kowi kowh iawng uamow kowh kakbak naown kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aprek sung uanap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 5:14" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="LEV 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 5:15" />“Lowra maru chimsaima mih uanap CHAKRAMANG kowi peah kown mih tawita mata khai hanow aia luk kowi mih aprek nauowi kown. Now aia dow aprek iawng hai aser auowk uowi dowi mih ruapurla CHAKRAMANG tut-e nauang pawla apum kown takla. Naiawng nadowi now en khowmta pe asung khowt mih ruapurla aia naran apum kown takla. Asung dow taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh akhai müa hown khaiah mih tai khowt naown kown takla. Nami dow aprek sung uanap chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 5:16" />Nami maru dow chimsaima mih uanh luk kowi changta angak khai rakowi naiaw kown takla. Now nami ruapurla sung iawta klen kowi paw nami asung changah tanga bak kowi pabak mih uamow kowi napeah chüt kown takla tak. Now uamow mih aprek sung uanap iawng hai nami ruapurla hown nachang phuchua kown. Nahanow nami maru kowi mih Thurai nalawtah kown towbowt.<verse eid="LEV 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 5:17" />“Lowra maru CHAKRAMANG ana pek kowi kowh hangah mih sia tuk dowi kowh changta angak khai chepaw nami maru luk kowi mih aprek nauowi kown. Now aia mih naka ripra kown. <verse eid="LEV 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 5:18" />Nami maru mih nachangla aprek sung uanap kownkow en khowmta pe asung khowt mih ruapurla aser auowk uowi dowi mih uamow tut-e nauang pawla apum kown. Nahanow tawita mata mih angak dow Thurai nalawtah kown towbowt. <verse eid="LEV 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 5:19" />Nami dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e enni changta angak khe kowh aprek sung uanap chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 5:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LEV 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-5" style="v" sid="LEV 6:1-5" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG plan tek pe Mosi mih, “Maru kowh tangka pawisa khet lawnguan kowi chepaw, maru uang pawngah mih uanh lawnguan kowi chepaw, kür hown cham rupah mih uanh lawnguan kowi chepaw, maru kowi kuanah mih lawnguan kowi chepaw, maru cham mata mih uanh ka khe küa dai mih chepaw, dai lai hown kham sawi mih chepaw naiawngün dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angak chekhai. Naiawng rakowi cham kuah mih chepaw, cham kuanah mih chepaw, maru uang towah mih chepaw, maru mata kowh kaah mih chepaw, uanh rakowi dai lai hown kham sawi chepaw naiawngün dow uanh iah kowi naiawng chang mih maru achima naplanta pe kown takla. Nami klen kowi uanh sung changah tanga bak kowi pabak mih aia nachüt pela kown takla. Nami dow aprek sung uanap aia chang mih ni khe uanh iah kowi aia naplan peta kown. <verse eid="LEV 6:1-5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 6:6" />Nami klen kowi paw changta angak mih sung dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nachangla aprek sung uanap kown takla. Naiawng rakowi en khowm pe bowk pe asung khowt mih ruapurla uamow kowi aia nauang peah apum kown takla. Tawkche aser auowk uowi dowi mih ruapurla naown kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 6:7" />Now uamow mih CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nami ruapur naphuchuaah kown. Nahanow CHAKRAMANG mih aia kowi nalawtta kown towbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="LEV 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tikah mih uanap vüi akeng mih rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 6:8" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="LEV 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 6:9" />“Arawn hai achapauüa kowi tek pe diah. Mami dow tikah mih uanap rirow chekhai: Tikah mih uanap kowi kowh uanh dow uar prowt phuchuara kowi kowh maih luk kowi nauowi kown, now nami maih paw atungma hing changta hüah kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 6:10" />Now rau-e khe dow adipükchow mih la hown kowh kowrmow khupma hai kraksa dawngh kruama tikah mih uanap hownia kowh plawi nahenta kownkow uamow napawah hanow phuchuara ria kowi natowah kown. <verse eid="LEV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 6:11" />Nami kung kowi dow naiawngün tawnguat naklüpta hanow akeng mih tawnguat nakhup kown, now nami plawi dow tangbung khup rah uat kowi kowh lang kraah mih plawi kuakra kowi nacham pawla kown. <verse eid="LEV 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 6:12" />Phuchuara luk kowi mih nahing changta maih hüah kown takla; nami maih dow naia mitta kown nadowi. Nami phuchuara luk kowi dow rau towng uamowuüa nabawk pe sawp hanow nami sawp luk kowi mih tikah mih uanap natowah kaneu kown, now nami luk kowi dow taking tasangra uanap kowi kowh tawncher sau natikah kown. <verse eid="LEV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 6:13" />Phuchuara kowi kowh maih dow atungma nape lünah reng kown; nami maih dow naia mitta kown nadowi,” pape khai.<verse eid="LEV 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kawmdi uanap vüi akeng mih rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 6:14" />“Mami dow kawmdi uanap rirow chekhai. Kawmdi uanap kowi kowh uanh srui dow CHAKRAMANG vüi naapah kownkow phuchuara kowi uamowuüa nakowpawla kown. <verse eid="LEV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 6:15" />Uamow mih nami hownia kawmdi lang iung mih pachawm, sau hai kawmdi uanap luk kowi kowh towah mih anam iungma mih maikhük towk müa than maten napawta kown. Now nami kawmdi uanap hownia naap-ah kown mih krowngchow uamow napawah hanow phuchuara kowi kowh maih kowi nanawmah kown. Nami dow CHAKRAMANG vüi apta khowk pami amat müa chekhai. Nami dow chakkham uanap chekhai. Nami uanap nam hown dow CHAKRAMANG awmrawm reng chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 6:16" />Nami kawmdi uanap kowi kowh ta lat mih srui dow Arawn hai achapauüa kowh vüi bak naown kown. Nami kawmdi hown thawp kawm büah mih khin khe nathela pe tuah büah kown nadowi. Nami kawm dow chimsaima mih arah kowi nachaah büah kown takla. Naiawng rakowi taklowp taklangra te viadawng kowi nachaah büah kown. <verse eid="LEV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 6:17" />Nami kawm kowi dow tuah hown lawkah now naia awpah kown nadowi. Ang vüi chakkham uanap kowi kowh ta lat mih uanh dow uamowuüa kowi ang peta mih chowbowt. Angak lawt lük müa uanap hai aprek sung uanap iawng kawmdi uanap kowi kowh ta lat mih srui paw achimsaima chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 6:18" />Naiawngün dow Arawn <char style="w">krungchak</char> kowi kowh kachakuüa maten naiung cha kown. CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi kowh chakkham uanap hownia naiawngün dow chowngchowng saksakma pat amatni kowh vüi bak chekhai. Naiawngün kowi kowh kak mih srui dow ang vüi kowi kowh chimsaiah mih naown kown takla,” pape khai.<verse eid="LEV 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 6:19" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="LEV 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 6:20" />“Arawn kowi nümnapah mih ni khe Arawn hai achapauüa paw chang kawmdi uanap reng khe kowh iawng kawmdi lang iung mih aset hown 400 gram CHAKRAMANG vüi nauang pawla kown. Nami kawmdi hownia dawnglang mih dow rau-e khe kowh phuchua müa naown kown, now ta lat dawnglang mih dow sat kowi khe kowh phuchua müa naown kown. <verse eid="LEV 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 6:21" />Kawmdi uanap iawng nami kawmdi paw kanrawn sau hown nalawkah hanow apherklapma mih angai müa hown naheuah kown. Now nami kawm ngai ia dow asek asekma CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nakowpawla kown takla. Nami uanap nam hown dow CHAKRAMANG awmrawm reng chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 6:22" />Arawn kowng kung kowi achapauüa pungmadawng hownia uamow lang kri mih rah ta paw mih kowi nümnapah khe paw nami uanap nachang kown takla. Nami uanap dow CHAKRAMANG kowh kakbak chekhai; nami dow natikta bowk kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 6:23" />Uamow uang pawla mih kawmdi uanap dow natikta bowk kown takla; nami dow nachaah kown nadowi,” pape khai.<verse eid="LEV 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Angak lawt lük müa uanap vüi akeng mih rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 6:24" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="LEV 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 6:25" />“Arawn hai achapauüa kowi tek pe diah. Mami dow angak lawt lük müa uanap rirow chekhai: Angak lawt lük müa uanap kowi kowh ngar paw tikah mih uanap chang müa ngar ngen rah re-e CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nangenah kown takla. Nami uanap dow achimsaima chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 6:26" />Nami uanap kowi kowh lup chang mih uamow chowtaih nami chaknga mih nacha kown. Nami chaknga dow chimsaima mih arah kowi nachaah büah kown takla. Naiawng rakowi taklowp taklangra te viadawng kowi nachaah büah kown. <verse eid="LEV 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 6:27" />Nami chaknga kak mih srui dow ang vüi kowi kowh chimsaiah mih naown kown takla. Now tawncher vi che tawnguat kowi talük takak khai hanow nami tawnguat dow taklowp taklangra te viadawng chimsaima mih arah kowi nachuah kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 6:28" />Nami uanap kowi kowh chaknga che bawn puh hown engah khai hanow ki eng kung kowi nami bawn puh mih nateuta kown takla. Now kri puh hown che engah khai hanow ki eng kung kowi nami kri puh mih nasawk nasauah kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 6:29" />Nami chaknga dow uamow kimchak kowi kowh kachakuüa maten naiung cha kown. Nami uanap dow achimsaima chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 6:30" />Tawkche angak lawt lük müa uanap kowi kowh tawncher vi che nalüla alawt kownkow taklowp taklangra te lak kowi uang pawla khai hanow nami chaknga dow nachaah kown nadowi; nami chaknga dow natikta bowk kown takla.<verse eid="LEV 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LEV 7" />
  <para style="s">Aprek sung uanap vüi akeng mih rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 7:1" />“Mami dow piakta rirow khe kowh aprek sung uanap krang chekhai. Mami uanap dow achimsaima chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 7:2" />Aprek sung uanap kowi kowh tawncher paw tikah mih uanap kowi kowh tawncher ngen rah kowi nangenah kown takla, now avi dow phuchuara kowi tapat lut nakrawi thetah kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 7:3" />Nami tawncher kowi kowh asau maten dow nachangla phuchua müa bowk kown takla. Naiawngün dow amai tut, riaklah sau, <verse eid="LEV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 7:4" />asau hailawm akia pre buk mih hai plawng ram lang iuk mih chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 7:5" />Naiawngün dow CHAKRAMANG vüi chakkham uanap iawng hai phuchuara kowi natikah kown. Naiawngün sau dow aprek sung uanap chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 7:6" />Naiawngün sau tikta bowk kung kowi kowh ta lat mih chaknga dow uamow kimchak kowi kowh kachakuüa nget naiung cha kown. Tawkche taklowp taklangra te viadawng chimsaima mih kowi nachaah kown takla. Nami uanap dow achimsaima chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 7:7" />“Angak lawt lük müa uanap rirow iawng dow nami aprek sung uanap paw nachangah kown. Naiawngün uanap kowi kowh chaknga dow uang chang phuchua mih maru kowh angak nalawtta pe kownkow hawt chang lup mih uamow chowtaih naka kown. <verse eid="LEV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 7:8" />Tikah mih uanap kowi kowh hawt chang lup mih uamow dow nami uanap kowi kowh chak pik aiamat vüi naia paw kown. <verse eid="LEV 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 7:9" />Taping kowi kowh awpah mih kawm hown chepaw, puh hown kowh ngaiah mih kawm hown chepaw, apherklapma mih angai müa hown kowh heuah mih kawm hown chepaw kawmdi uanap kowi kowh kawm dow hawt chang lup mih uamow chowtaih naka kown. <verse eid="LEV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 7:10" />Tawkche lawk pe sau mih kawm lah, lawk pe sau dowi mih kawm lah, kawmdi uanap kowi kowh ap-ah mih uanh srui dow uamowuüa maten arisang nataretah kown.<verse eid="LEV 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taking tasangra uanap vüi akeng mih rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 7:11" />“Mami dow CHAKRAMANG hown taking tasangra nauowila kownkow taking tasangra uanap rirow chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 7:12" />Lowra maru CHAKRAMANG tut-e tek awmrawm lai kown nau khai hanow taking tasangra uanap nachang kown takla. Now taking tasangra uanap chang müa klen kowi paw the pe tuah dowi kowi sau hown kowh lawkah mih kawm, the pe tuah dowi kowi apalachow ngaiah mih kawm, kawmdi lang iung mih kowi kowh sau hown kaneuma lawkah mih kawm nauang ap kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 7:13" />Awmrawm lai tek müa kowi kowh nami taking tasangra uanap kowi dow the pe tuah mih kawm paw nauowi ne kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 7:14" />Uang chang phuchua mih maru dow CHAKRAMANG kowi ap-ah kown mih vüi naiawngün kawm hownia pachap kowi lowk chi nauang pawla kown takla. Naiawngün dow taking tasangra uanap kowi kowh tawncher vi thet miia uamow kowh kakbak naown kown. <verse eid="LEV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 7:15" />Awmrawm lai tek müa uanap kowi kowh ap-ah mih chaknga dow ap-ah mih ni kowi nachata kown takla; nami dow auai rau mowr natowah kown nadowi.<verse eid="LEV 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 7:16" />“Tawkche takhamta mih rakowi chepaw, kowmatia sak nau hown kowh chang mih chepaw taking tasangra uanap che chang khai hanow nami chaknga dow nami ni khe paw naia cha kown, now auai ni paw naiung cha kown taih. <verse eid="LEV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 7:17" />Tawkche sum ni mowr chepaw uowi reng tak kowh chalow now nami chaknga mih maih kowi natikta kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 7:18" />Sum ni khowk chepaw nami chaknga che cha reng tak hanow nami uanap dow CHAKRAMANG naawmrawm pe kown nadowi bowt; nami uanap dow aia vüi mrawkra nauowi kown nadowi bowt. Nami dow asür alawkma padow nadowkah bowt kown; nami chaknga cha mih maru dow naka ripra kown.<verse eid="LEV 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 7:19" />“Taking tasangra uanap kowi kowh chaknga kowi che asür alawkma mih chap talük takak khai hanow nami chaknga dow nachaah kown nadowi bowt; nami dow natikta kown takla. Tawkche tawngpaw talük takak dowi kowh chalow now tasür talawk dowi miuüa nami chaknga naiung cha kown. <verse eid="LEV 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 7:20" />Now lowra maru asür alawkma hai taking tasangra uanap kowi kowh ap-ah mih chaknga che chata khai hanow nami maru kowi dow aiamat chenchap hownia nabatta kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 7:21" />Now maru kowi lah, tawncher kowi lah, lowra mih asür alawkma mih chap kowi lah cham kakta khai hanow aia dow natasür talawk kown. Nami kung kowi paw CHAKRAMANG hown taking tasangra nauowila kownkow taking tasangra uanap kowi kowh ap-ah mih chaknga che tawi cha khai hanow nami maru kowi dow aiamat chenchap hownia nabatta kown takla,” pape khai.<verse eid="LEV 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22-23" style="v" sid="LEV 7:22-23" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Israeluüa kowi maiawng kowtek pe diah: Chia sau lah, rua sau lah, ruapur sau lah, tawng sau paw enni nacha kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 7:22-23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 7:24" />Tawncher kowng mih sau lah, kaurawng uaramchak makta mih tawncher sau lah enni naia chaah kown nadowi. Tawkche akeng mih lup chang müa vüi dow enni naia tawng kown taih. <verse eid="LEV 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 7:25" />CHAKRAMANG vüi chakkham uanap chang müa kowi kowh asun uang mih tawncher chap kowi kowh asau maten dow enni naiung cha kown nadowi. Naiawngün sau cha mih maru kowi dow aiamat chenchap hownia nabatta kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 7:26" />Lowra kowi enni cham uowi chepaw uakling uaber vi lah, tawncher vi lah, kaurawng uaramchak vi lah enni nacha kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 7:27" />Cha vi mih maru kowi dow aiamat chenchap hownia nabatta ngengche kown takla,” pape khai.<verse eid="LEV 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uamow kowh kakbak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28-29" style="v" sid="LEV 7:28-29" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG plan tek pe Mosi mih, “Israeluüa kowi maiawng kowtek pe diah: Lowra maru CHAKRAMANG hown taking tasangra nauowila kownkow taking tasangra uanap chang müa uang pawla mih tawncher hownia CHAKRAMANG kowi napeah ne kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 7:28-29" /><verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="LEV 7:30-31" />CHAKRAMANG vüi chakkham uanap chang müa sakowuh hai asau maten dow aiamat rut hown uamow kowi nauang peah kown. Sakowuh nga dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi uamow nakrowngah kown. Nami dow amülüngma mih uanap chekhai. Nami dow uamowuüa kowh vüi bak naown kown; tawkche asau tarapdow phuchuara kowi natikta kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 7:30-31" /><verse number="32-33" style="v" sid="LEV 7:32-33" />Taking tasangra uanap kowi kowh tawncher hawmlawm thung dow uamowuüa kowi napeah kown. Nami tawncher thung dow avi hai asau ap mih uamow kowh kakbak chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 7:32-33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 7:34" />Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi changla taking tasangra uanap mih hownia ang vüi kowi kowh krowngah mih sakowuh hai ang vüi kowi kowh ap-ah mih athung dow uamowuüa kowi ang peta khowk. Nami dow Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia chowngchowng saksakma amatni kowh vüi bak naown kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="LEV 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 7:35" />Arawn hai achapauüa kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowi naia chupiia kownkow ap pe uamow rah khai. CHAKRAMANG vüi chakkham uanap chang müa tawncher kowi kowh sakowuh hai athung dow amatni kowi nümnapah mih ni hownia amatni kowh vüi bak pahai khowm pe bowk pe khowk chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 7:36" />Nami vüi bak dow chowngchowng saksakma Arawn hai achapauüa kowi napeah kownkow amatni kowi nümnapah mih ni khe Israeluüa kowi CHAKRAMANG peta ana khowk.<verse eid="LEV 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 7:37" />Maiawngün bowkbowk dow tikah mih uanap, kawmdi uanap, angak lawt lük müa uanap, aprek sung uanap, ap pe arah mih pawi kowi kowh uanap hai taking tasangra uanap rirow chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 7:38" />Sinai hungh uowi mih <char style="w">süngrüp süngkangma</char> kowi uowi mih khin khe aia vüi nauang pawla uanap kownkow Israeluüa kowi CHAKRAMANG peah ana khai. Maiawngün rirow maten dow nami ni khe kowh Sinai hungh luk kowi Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG peah mih chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 7:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LEV 8" />
  <para style="ms">Uamowuüa kowh rirow</para>
  <para style="s">Arawn hai achapauüa kowi ap pe uamow rah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 8:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="LEV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 8:2" />“Arawn hai achapauüa kowi mami re-e uang pawla diah. Amatni kowi khup pe kown mih tawnguat, angak lawt lük müa uanap vüi chiala, <char style="w">nümnap</char> müa sau, ruapurla pre pum hai the pe tuah dowi mih kawm kharang paw uang pawla diah. <verse eid="LEV 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 8:3" />Israeluüa maten kowi paw taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e uang pe takua talawmah diah,” pape khai. <verse eid="LEV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 8:4" />Now CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng rowprowp lup maten mih Mosi chang khai bowt. Israeluüa maten paw taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e uang takua talawm khai bowt.<verse eid="LEV 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 8:5" />Nakhowk khe Israeluüa kowi Mosi tek pe mih, “Maiawngün nachang kownkow CHAKRAMANG pe ang ana khai,” pakhai. <verse eid="LEV 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 8:6" />Naiawng ki tek pe hanow Mosi mih Arawn hai achapauüa kowi tui hown pe tasauah khai. <verse eid="LEV 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 8:7" />Nami kung kowi dow alak pra kowh khupah kown mih kowrmow bawngthawng athawngma mih Arawn kowi Mosi khup pe khai, now kekawm paw sük pe khai. Nami luk kowi dow aruama mih kowrmow athawngma mih khup pe khai, now nami luk kowi dow ephawd kowrmow khup pe khai. Now ephawd kowrmow kowi kowh tachawp mih kekawm hown ephawd kowrmow dow sük pe khai. <verse eid="LEV 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 8:8" />Nami ephawd kowrmow luk kowi dow dan pe <char style="w">owngphowr</char> im hanow nami owngphowr im lak kowi dow Urim hai Thumim pape mih uanh tow pe khai. <verse eid="LEV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 8:9" />Nami kung kowi dow Arawn lu kowi sui pe napawng hanow “CHAKRAMANG VÜI BAK” pahai arui uowi mih kuh apherklepchow mih napawng luk kowi sük pe khai. Naiawng hai CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng rowprowp lup maten mih Mosi changah khai.<verse eid="LEV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 8:10" />Nami kung kowi dow taklowp taklangra te hai te lak kowi kowh uanh maten luk kowi Mosi krawi thet pe nümnap müa sau hanow CHAKRAMANG vüi chimsaiah khai. <verse eid="LEV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 8:11" />Nami sau dow aia kutplan pawah sangrum hanow phuchuara luk kowi ranit kat thetah khai. Nami sau hown aia dow phuchuara hai phuchuara kowi kowh tawngah mih puh bia aikam ün, achowm müa hailawm biatum mih CHAKRAMANG vüi chimsaiah khai. <verse eid="LEV 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 8:12" />Now nümnap müa sau aia kutplan pawah sangrum hanow Arawn lu kowi klai pe khai. Naiawng hai aia dow CHAKRAMANG vüi chimsaiah kownkow Arawn kowi nümnapah khai. <verse eid="LEV 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 8:13" />Nami kung kowi dow Arawn kowh chapauüa kowi uang pawla hanow aia khup pe kowrmow khai, now kawm pe kekawm hanow kruk pe lukruk khai. CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng lup maten mih Mosi changah khai.<verse eid="LEV 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 8:14" />Nami kung kowi dow angak lawt lük müa uanap vüi chiala mih Mosi uang pawla khai. Now nami chiala lu kowi dow Arawn hai achapauüa tang pe rut khai. <verse eid="LEV 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 8:15" />Nami kung kowi dow nami chiala mih Mosi ngenah khai. Now nachim nasaila phuchuara kownkow nami chiala vi mih aia pawah sangrum khai. Nami vi dow rutchawk hown maiah hanow phuchuara luk kowi kowh anang tali klüng mih kowi aia krawi plikah khai. Now ta lat mih vi dow phuchuara daw kowi aia khükah khai. Naiawng hai angak lawt lük müa uanap vüi phuchuara mih naia tawngah kownkow aia chimsaiah khai. <verse eid="LEV 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 8:16" />Nami kung kowi dow nami chiala riaklah sau maten, plawng ram lang iuk mih hai asau hailawm akia pre buk mih pawah now phuchuara luk kowi aia tikah khai. <verse eid="LEV 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 8:17" />Nachenganchepaw chiala pik hai anga hown akih ün dow amatni uowi rah hownia alak sangrum re-e cham pawla hanow cham tikta khai. Naiawng hai CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng rowprowp lup maten mih Mosi changah khai.<verse eid="LEV 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 8:18" />Nami kung kowi dow tikah mih uanap chang müa ruapurla uang pawla hanow nami ruapurla lu kowi mih Arawn hai achapauüa tang pe rut khai. <verse eid="LEV 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 8:19" />Nami ruapurla mih aia ngenah hanow avi dow phuchuara kowi tapat lut krawi patah khai. <verse eid="LEV 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 8:20" />Nami ruapurla dow leah hanow alu hai anga sek hown asau ün mih aia tikta khai. <verse eid="LEV 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 8:21" />Now akawlakchak hai akhawk ün dow tui hown aia sauah hanow nami ruapurla pabuk mih phuchuara kowi aia tikta khai. Nami dow chakkham uanap chekhai. Nami uanap nam hown dow CHAKRAMANG awmrawm reng chekhai. Naiawng hai CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng rowprowp lup maten mih Mosi changah khai.<verse eid="LEV 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 8:22" />Nami kung kowi dow ap pe arah mih pawi vüi kowi kowh alowk mih ruapurla Mosi uang pawla khai. Nami ruapurla lu kowi paw Arawn hai achapauüa mih tang pe rut khai. <verse eid="LEV 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 8:23" />Nami ruapurla paw Mosi ngenah hanow avi pawah sangrum khai. Now nami vi dow Arawn kowh hawmlawm pra kowh param iah hai hawmlawm pra kowh rutma hown hawmlawm pra kowh khawkma kowi Mosi plik pe khai.<verse eid="LEV 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 8:24" />Nami kung kowi dow Arawn kowh chapauüa kowi uang pawla hanow kowbüah kowi paw hawmlawm pra kowh param iah hai hawmlawm pra kowh rutma hown hawmlawm pra kowh khawkma kowi nami ruapurla vi Mosi plik pe khai. Nami kung kowi kowh ta lat mih vi maten dow phuchuara kowi tapat lut Mosi krawi thetah khai. <verse eid="LEV 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 8:25" />Now ruapurla sau, amai tut, riaklah sau, plawng ram lang iuk mih, asau hailawm akia pre buk mih hai hawmlawm thung mih aia pawah khai. <verse eid="LEV 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 8:26" />Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowi ap-ah mih the pe tuah dowi mih kawm kharang hownia apalachow ngaiah mih kawm hai lawk pe kanrawn sau mih hai lawk pe kanrawn sau dowi mih kawm pawah apah chi khai, now naiawngün kawm dow ruapurla sau hai ruapurla thung luk kowi Mosi kowtowah khai. <verse eid="LEV 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 8:27" />Naiawngün srui dow Arawn hai achapauüa rut kowi Mosi ap pe hanow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi Mosi pe krowngah khai. Nami dow amülüngma mih uanap chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 8:28" />Nami kung kowi dow naiawngün srui mih kowbüah rut hownia Mosi pawah hanow phuchuara luk kowi kowh tikah mih uanap luk kowi tikah khai. Nami dow Arawn hai achapauüa kowi ap pe arah mih pawi kowi kowh uanap chekhai. Nami dow CHAKRAMANG vüi chakkham uanap chekhai. Nami uanap nam hown dow CHAKRAMANG awmrawm reng chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 8:29" />Nami kung kowi dow ap pe arah mih pawi kowi kowh ruapurla sakowuh aiamat kakbak mih Mosi pawah hanow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi krowngah khai. Nami dow amülüngma mih uanap chekhai. Naiawng hai CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng rowprowp lup maten mih Mosi changah khai.<verse eid="LEV 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 8:30" />Nami kung kowi dow nümnap müa sau hai phuchuara kowi kowh vi mih Mosi pawah sangrum chi khai. Nami sau hai vi dow Arawn hai achapauüa luk kowi hown amatni kowh tawnguat kowi aia thet pe khai. Naiawng hai Arawn hown achapauüa hai amatni kowh tawnguat kowi dow CHAKRAMANG vüi Mosi chimsaiah khai.<verse eid="LEV 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 8:31" />Nami kung kowi dow Arawn hai achapauüa kowi Mosi tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG ana pek ang tek enni khowk iawng dow taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e nami chaknga mih engah büa diah, now ap pe arah mih pawi kowi kowh kawm hown nami re-e chaah büa diah. Nami chakkham dow enni kowh chakbak chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 8:32" />Now ki cha ki kham kung kowi kowh ta lat mih chaknga hai kawm dow enni natikta kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 8:33" />Nami ap pe arah mih pawi dow ranit ni mowr nauowi kown. Naiawng rakowi nami ranit ni chur dowi mowr dow taklowp taklangra te hownia enni nacham ia lawt kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 8:34" />Ani kowh changah mih dow CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng hai enni kowh angak nalawtta enni kownkow chang mih chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 8:35" />Enni nakowngla dowi kownkow ani hownia ranit ni mowr ni chut uar prowt chi taklowp taklangra te lak kowi enni nauowi kown takla, now CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng enni nachang kown takla. Maiawngün ana dow CHAKRAMANG pe ang mih chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="LEV 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 8:36" />Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah ana iawng rowprowp lup maten mih Arawn hai achapauüa chang khai bowt.<verse eid="LEV 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LEV 9" />
  <para style="s">Arawn hai achapauüa uown chang phuchua mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 9:1" />Ap pe arah mih pawi chur kung kowi raiat ni mih ni khe dow Arawn hai achapauüa hailawm Israel lawngtang aluchowuüa kowi Mosi hawah khai. <verse eid="LEV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 9:2" />Mosi tek pe Arawn mih, “En kowh angak lawt lük müa uanap chang müa uang pawla chiala chah apum diah, now tikah mih uanap chang müa paw uang pawla ruapurla apum diah. Nami chiala chah hai ruapurla dow aser auowk naia uowi kown nadowi. Nami dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e ap-ah diah. <verse eid="LEV 9:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="LEV 9:3-4" />Now Israeluüa kowi en natek pe kown mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG vüi changla angak lawt lük müa uanap kownkow nauang pawla rua apum kown takla. Now changla taking tasangra uanap kownkow chia hai ruapurla paw nauang pawla apum chi kown takla. Nami klen kowi nachangla tikah mih uanap kownkow chia chah hai ruapur chah paw nauang pawla apum chi kown takla. Nami chia chah hai ruapur chah dow aningchow mih naown kown takla, now aser auowk paw naia uowi kown nadowi. Naiawngün tawncher klen kowi lawk pe sau mih kawmdi uanap paw CHAKRAMANG tut-e uang ap büa diah. Naiawngün maten dow enni naap ngengche kown takla. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ani dow enni pur kowi CHAKRAMANG nauang tatüng kown chekhai,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 9:3-4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 9:5" />Now Israeluüa mih Mosi ana pek iawng naiawngün uanh maten taklowp taklangra te pur kowi uang pawla khai. Israeluüa mih akawm srui CHAKRAMANG pur kowi kowiowng khai. <verse eid="LEV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 9:6" />Nakhowk khe Mosi tek pe Israeluüa mih, “Enni pur kowi CHAKRAMANG kraingra nauang tatüngla kownkow naiawng nachang kown mih CHAKRAMANG pe enni ana khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 9:7" />Nami kung kowi Mosi tek pe Arawn mih, “Phuchuara kowi kowkowi diah. Now angak lawt lük müa uanap hai tikah mih uanap pawi kowchang diah. Nahanow en hai maru kawmuüa kowh angak mih Thurai nalawtta enni kown towbowt. Maru kawmuüa uang pe mih uanh hown paw naiawngün uanap pawi chang pe diah. Nahanow amatni kowi mih CHAKRAMANG nalawtah kown towbowt. Nami dow CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="LEV 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 9:8" />Now Arawn mih phuchuara kowi kowkowi hanow aiamat kowh angak lawt lük müa uanap kowi kowh chia chah kowngen khai bowt. <verse eid="LEV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 9:9" />Now achapauüa mih nami chia chah vi biatum hown pawla hanow Arawn kowi uang ap pe khai. Arawn mih nami vi kowi aia kowh rutchawk iu chimah hanow phuchuara luk kowi kowh anang maten kowi krawi plikah khai, now ta lat mih vi dow phuchuara daw kowi aia khükah khai. <verse eid="LEV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 9:10" />Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah ana iawng Arawn mih angak lawt lük müa uanap kowi kowh chia chah sau, akia pre buk hai plawng ram lang iuk mih phuchuara luk kowi tikah khai. <verse eid="LEV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 9:11" />Now anga hai apik dow tangbung uat kowi cham pawla hanow Arawn cham tikah khai.<verse eid="LEV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 9:12" />Now tikah mih uanap nachangla kownkow uang pawla mih ruapur dow Arawn ngenah khai. Now achapauüa mih nami vi pawla hanow Arawn kowi uang ap pe khai. Arawn dow nami vi mih phuchuara kowi tapat lut krawi patah khai. <verse eid="LEV 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 9:13" />Achapauüa dow tikah mih uanap kowi kowh ap-ah mih ruapur lu hai anga aleia maten Arawn rut kowi uang ap pe khai. Now naiawngün dow phuchuara luk kowi Arawn tikah khai. <verse eid="LEV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 9:14" />Ruapur kawlakchak hai akhawk dow sauah hanow phuchuara luk kowi kowh tikah mih uanap luk kowi aia tikah khai.<verse eid="LEV 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 9:15" />Nachangla angak lawt lük müa uanap kownkow Israeluüa uang pawla mih rua dow Arawn uang pawla khai. Nami rua dow maru kawmuüa kowh angak lawt müa kowi Arawn ngenah khai. Nami angak lawt lük müa uanap pawi dow rik chang khe kowh iawng changah khai. <verse eid="LEV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 9:16" />Nami kung kowi tikah mih uanap chang müa Israeluüa uang pawla mih chia chah hai ruapur chah dow CHAKRAMANG rirow iawng aia ap-ah khai. <verse eid="LEV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 9:17" />Now nachangla kawmdi uanap kownkow maru-uüa uang pawla mih uanh hownia chawmah achawm hanow rau-e kowh tikah mih uanap hown naiawngün dow phuchuara luk kowi Arawn tikah khai. <verse eid="LEV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 9:18" />Now nachangla taking tasangra uanap kownkow maru kawmuüa uang ap-ah mih chia hai ruapurla dow Arawn ngenah khai. Now achapauüa mih naiawngün vi pawla hanow Arawn rut kowi ap pe khai. Nami vi dow phuchuara kowi tapat lut Arawn krawi patah khai. <verse eid="LEV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 9:19" />Nami chia hai ruapurla kowh sau ün, amai tut hai riaklah sau ün, akia pre buk hai plawng ram lang iuk mih dow nami chia hai ruapurla sakowuh luk kowi krawi towah büah khai. <verse eid="LEV 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 9:20" />Naiawngün maten dow pawla hanow phuchuara luk kowi Arawn tikah khai. <verse eid="LEV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 9:21" />Tawkche nami chia hai ruapurla kowh sakowuh hown athung nga dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi Arawn krowngah khai; nami dow Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah mih ana iawng Arawn chang mih chekhai. Nami dow amülüngma mih uanap chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 9:22" />Angak lawt lük müa uanap, tikah mih uanap hai taking tasangra uanap ki chang kung kowi dow maru kawmuüa prakowi par pe rut hanow Arawn peah <char style="w">prasi</char> khai. Now phuchuara hownia aia mih uang iu dowm khai bowt. <verse eid="LEV 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 9:23" />Mosi hai Arawn iüah dow taklowp taklangra te kowi kowkup khai. Amatchi dow uang lawt hanow maru kawmuüa kowi peah prasi khai. Now CHAKRAMANG kraingra dow maru maten pur kowi uang tatüng khai bowt. <verse eid="LEV 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 9:24" />CHAKRAMANG dow uang chin pe maih hanow phuchuara luk kowi kowh tikah mih uanap hai sau maten mih uang kamta bowk khai. Naiawng phaw mih khi hanow maru kawmuüa dow awmrawm kowh how se krawng kowi tabawkah hanow CHAKRAMANG kowi chupah iiaah khai.<verse eid="LEV 9:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LEV 10" />
  <para style="s">Nadab hai Abihu iüah kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 10:1" />Arawn kowh chapa Nadab hai Abihu iüah dow amatchi kowh mairing pawk müa puh hown pawla mairing hanow nami luk kowi nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa than prui pe khai, now CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng nadowi hai nami maikhük CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi awr ap iüah khai. <verse eid="LEV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 10:2" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG mih uang chin pe maih hanow amatchi kowi uang kamta khai, nahanow amatchi dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi kowng khai. <verse eid="LEV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 10:3" />Nakhowk khe Mosi tek pe Arawn mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek mih maiawng, ‘Ang chimsaima pami ang tut-e kowh uang mih uamow maten nachün kown takla; nahanow maru maten pur kowi ang kowh kraingra mih ang natüngah kown. Now amatni dow naring nakaw ang kown,’ pakhai,” pape khai. Nami laiklow ta hanow Arawn mih tawngpaw tek dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 10:4" />Misael hai Elzafan iüah kowi Mosi hawah now tek pe mih, “Mami re-e uang iüa diah; taklowp taklangra te viadawng hownia enchi kowh tainau chapa uak kawtla now tangbung khup rah uat kowi cham pawla iüa diah,” pakhai. Misael hai Elzafan iüah dow Arawn kowh pahi Uziel kowh chapa chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 10:5" />Mosi tek pe iawng Nadab hai Abihu iüah kowh uak dow tawnguat kowi dowkla now tangbung khup rah uat kowi cham pawla iüah khai. Nakhowk khe paw Nadab hai Abihu iüah buk kowi dow uamow tawnguat uowi reng tak chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 10:6" />Nakhowk khe Arawn hai achapa Eleazar hai Ithamar büah kowi Mosi tek pe mih, “Tawng iawng mih aprüa aiia paw enni uamowuüa naia tüng kown nadowi; sam paw enni naiiata nak kown nadowi, now tawnguat paw enni nathek kown nadowi. Naiawng che enni chang hanow enni nakowng kown, now Israel pachenma luk kowi paw CHAKRAMANG nakunmarau kown. Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa maten dow maih hown kowh CHAKRAMANG kamta mih maru vüi naia uowi uiting uangtak kown. <verse eid="LEV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 10:7" />Enni uamowuüa kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowi naia chupiia kownkow lang krata enni khowk. Naiawng rakowi enni mih taklowp taklangra te plawt hownia cham ia lawt kown nadowi. Enni che cham lawt hanow enni nakowng kown,” pakhai. Now amatni dow Mosi tek iawng chün khai.<verse eid="LEV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 10:8" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Arawn mih, <verse eid="LEV 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 10:9" />“Taklowp taklangra te kowi enni uang kup mih khin khe grep tui lah, arak lah enni uang ia khamla kown nadowi; enni che kham hanow enni nakowng kown. Nami dow enni krungchakuüa vüi chowngchowng saksakma mih rirow chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 10:10" />Chimsaima mih hai iawngpa mih lawnguan, now asür alawkma mih hai sürlawk dowi mih lawnguan kowi enni nakraah kaneu kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 10:11" />Nami klen kowi Israeluüa vüi Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG peah mih rirow maten paw amatni kowi enni natüng nasangah kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 10:12" />Akung kowi Arawn hai achapa Eleazar hai Ithamar büah kowi Mosi tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG vüi chakkham uanap hownia kawmdi uanap kowi kowh ta lat mih srui chimsaima mih arah kowi nachaah büah kown takla. Naiawng rakowi taklowp taklangra te viadawng kowi chaah büa diah. Tawkche thawp kawm mih khin khe enni nathela pe tuah kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 10:13" />Nami dow arah chimsaima mih kowi chowtaih enni nachaah kown. CHAKRAMANG vüi maih kowi kowh tikah mih kawmdi uanap hownia kowh ta lat mih dow en hai en chapauüa kowh vüi bak chekhai. Nami ana dow CHAKRAMANG hownia ang kaah mih chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 10:14" />Tawkche CHAKRAMANG hown taking tasangra nauowila kownkow taking tasangra uanap kowi kowh Israeluüa uang ap-ah mih uanh hownia krowngah mih sakowuh hai athung dow en hai en chauüa kowi ang peta khowk. Naiawngün dow enni naiung cha kown. Tawkche tasür talawk dowi mih arah kowi enni nachaah kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 10:15" />Chakkham uanap chang müa uang pawla sau mih khin khe CHAKRAMANG pur kowi athung hai sakowuh dow krowngah kown takla. Nami dow amülüngma mih uanap chekhai. Nami thung hai sakowuh dow CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng en hai en chauüa kowh chowngchowng saksakma vüi bak chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 10:16" />Now changla angak lawt lük müa uanap mih rua dow Mosi krawi chet hanow nami dow tikta tüng khowk pami tuk khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow Arawn kowh chapa Eleazar hai Ithamar iüah luk kowi lainowmma kunmarau khai. Aia tek pe mih, <verse eid="LEV 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 10:17" />“Tawngplawng kowchow angak lawt lük müa uanap kowi kowh chaknga taklowp taklangra te viadawng chimsaima kowi enchi chata dowi? Nami uanap dow achimsaima chekhai. Israeluüa kowh angak CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nachim nasaita pe hanow amatni kowh ripra hownia nalawngah kownkow nami uanh pe enchi mih chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 10:18" />Nami rua vi dow arah <char style="w">chimsaima</char> mih taklowp taklangra te lak kowi enni uang pawla dowi bowt chekhai; naiawng rakowi ang ana pek iawng nami chaknga mih arah chimsaima mih kowi enni nachata kown takla chowdiah,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 10:19" />Arawn tek pe Mosi mih, “Ani mih CHAKRAMANG pur kowi angak lawt lük müa uanap hai tikah mih uanap pawi ki chang kung kowi ang kowh akeng mih chapa pre ia luk kowi tawng chow own mih sam tuak madiah! Naiawng phaw chepaw nami chaknga ang cha e dow CHAKRAMANG naawmrawm kown bow?” pakhai. <verse eid="LEV 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 10:20" />Nami laiklow ta hanow Mosi sak-ih khai.<verse eid="LEV 10:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LEV 11" />
  <para style="ms">Sürlawk dowi mih hai sürlawkma mih</para>
  <para style="s">Sürlawk dowi mih hai sürlawkma mih asadua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-3" style="v" sid="LEV 11:1-3" />Nami kung kowi Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Israeluüa kowi kowtek pe diah: Krawng luk kowi kowh asak uowi mih chap maten kowi tai penchow mih hai akeh talak mih chap chowtaih enni naiung cha kown. <verse eid="LEV 11:1-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 11:4" />Tawkche tai penchow chepaw akeh talak dowi mih chap uowi, now akeh talak chepaw tai penchow dowi mih chap uowi, naiawngün dow enni naiung cha kown nadowi. <char style="w">Ut</char> dow tai penchow chepaw akeh talak dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi nami dow enni vüi asür alawkma naown kown. <verse eid="LEV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 11:5" />Ngaiung rik paw tai penchow chowdiah. Tawkche akeh talak dowi rakowi nami paw enni vüi asür alawkma naown kown. <verse eid="LEV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 11:6" />Ngaiung kaw paw tai penchow chowdiah. Tawkche akeh talak dowi rakowi nami paw enni vüi asür alawkma naown kown. <verse eid="LEV 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 11:7" />Pak kowh dow akeh talak chowdiah. Tawkche tai penchow dowi rakowi nami paw enni vüi asür alawkma chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 11:8" />Naiawngün asür alawkma mih chap kowh nga dow enni nacha kown nadowi, now auak paw enni nakak kown nadowi. Naiawngün dow enni vüi asür alawkma chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 11:9" />“Sata hai aw kowi kowh asak uowi mih chap maten kowi paw angap hai alip uowi mih chap chowtaih enni naiung cha kown. <verse eid="LEV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 11:10" />Tawkche angap hai alip uowi dowi mih chap maten dow enni naiung cha kown nadowi. Naiawngün dow suiiai kaniaima pahai enni nadowkah kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 11:11" />Naiawngün dow suiiai kaniaima chekhai rakowi enni nachaah kown nadowi, now auak ngam padow suiiai kaniaima rakowi enni naia kak kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 11:12" />Tui kowi kowh uowi mih chap kowi angap hai alip uowi dowi mih maten dow suiiai kaniaima pahai enni nadowkah kown takla.<verse eid="LEV 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-19" style="v" sid="LEV 11:13-19" />“Uakling uaber chap kowi paw suiiai kaniaima pahai enni nadowkah kown mih uowi ne. Naiawngün dow uamu chap maten, bungku chap maten, <char style="w">langta</char> chap maten, tingtut chap maten, uaak chap maten, tuipai chap maten, <char style="w">ut uakling</char> hai mailap chap maten chekhai. Naiawngün nga dow enni nacha kown nadowi.<verse eid="LEV 11:13-19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 11:20" />“Khawk huma mih chap kowi kowh iow mih<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Khawk huma mih chap kowi kowh iow mih </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow lowngpang, et, plawng, ving hai changpauma ün kowi kowh tekah mih chekhai.</char></note> chap maten dow suiiai kaniaima pahai enni nadowkah kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 11:21" />Nachenganchepaw tachar khawk uowi kowh krawng kowi nowng chet mih chap dow enni naiung cha ne kown taih. <verse eid="LEV 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 11:22" />Naiawngün dow plawng chap maten hai tawngther chap maten chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 11:23" />Tawkche akhawk huma chepaw iow mih chap maten dow suiiai kaniaima pahai enni nadowkah kown takla.<verse eid="LEV 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24-28" style="v" sid="LEV 11:24-28" />“Now akeh talak mih chap kowi akeh chemma nadowi mih hai tai penchow dowi mih chap dow enni vüi asür alawkma chekhai. Akhawk tali chüng mih chap kowi kowh khawkpha hown mang mih chap maten paw enni vüi asür alawkma chekhai. Naiawngün uak kowi kak mih maru dow sat kup dowi mowr asür alawkma nauowi kown. Now naiawngün uak kowi krowng mih maru dow aia kowh dawnguan nachuta kown takla, now sat kup dowi mowr asür alawkma hai nauowi kown.<verse eid="LEV 11:24-28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 11:29" />“Now krawng kowi kowh uowi mih asowmchow mih asadua pungmadawng kowi paw sirsik, utmow, mriua, <verse eid="LEV 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 11:30" />tawkke, chang, tam, tuisrambowngmow, naklai hai nakang ün enni vüi asür alawkma chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 11:31" />Naiawngün dow asak uowi mih pungmadawng kowi chili chalachow mih chap kowi kowh asür alawkma mih chap chekhai. Naiawngün uak kowi kak mih maru dow sat kup dowi mowr asür alawkma hai nauowi kown. <verse eid="LEV 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 11:32" />Naiawngün uak che lowra mih uanh luk kowi cham dowh khai hanow nami uanh dow asür alawkma naown kown. Phen chepaw, uan chepaw, chak pik chepaw, akeng mih uanh chepaw naiawngün uak takak khowk mih uanh dow tui kowi natirah kown takla. Naiawngün uanh dow sat kup dowi mowr asür alawkma hai nauowi kown, nami kung kowi chiang chimsaima naown kown. <verse eid="LEV 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 11:33" />Naiawngün uak che bawn kawng lak kowi dowh khai hanow nami bawn kawng lak kowi kowh uanh srui dow asür alawkma naown kown. Nami bawn kawng paw nateuta kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 11:34" />Nami bawn kawng kowi kowh tui paw lowra mih chakkham luk kowi cham kak khai hanow nami chakkham paw asür alawkma naown kown. Nami bawn kawng kowi che khamah mih chap uowi khai hanow nami paw asür alawkma naown kown. <verse eid="LEV 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 11:35" />Naiawngün uak dow lowra uanh kowi dowh khai hanow nami uanh dow asür alawkma naown kown. Nami dow kawm heu müa akhawngrawngma mih taping hai taping kowi dowh chepaw nami taping mih napiakta kown takla. Naiawngün taping dow asür alawkma pahai enni nadowkah kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 11:36" />Nachenganchepaw naiawngün uak che tui tum kowi chepaw, tuikuam kowi chepaw kowdowh khai hanow naiawngün tui tum hai tuikuam dow tasür talawk kown nadowi tham. Tawkche naiawngün uak kowi kowh kak mih maru dow asür alawkma naown kown. <verse eid="LEV 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 11:37" />Now nasawtah kownkow towta hüah mih kan nuk hap liu kowi che naiawngün uak kowdowh khai hanow naiawngün kan nuk hap liu dow natasür talawk kown nadowi tham. <verse eid="LEV 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 11:38" />Nachenganchepaw tui kowi tirta hüah mih kan nuk hap liu kowi che naiawngün uak kowdowh khai hanow naiawngün kan nuk hap liu dow asür alawkma naown kown.<verse eid="LEV 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 11:39" />“Now enni iung chaah mih asadua chap paw auak dow enni nakak kown nadowi. Naiawngün uak kowi kak mih maru dow sat kowi dowi mowr asür alawkma hai nauowi kown. <verse eid="LEV 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 11:40" />Naiawngün kowng nga chata khai chepaw cha mih maru mih aia kowh dawnguan nachuta kown takla, now sat kup dowi mowr asür alawkma nauowi kown. Naiawngün uak kowi cham henta kownkow kowkrowng mih maru dow aia kowh dawnguan nachuta kown takla, now sat kup dowi mowr asür alawkma nauowi kown.<verse eid="LEV 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 11:41" />“Krawng luk kowi kowh chili chalachow mih asadua chap maten dow suiiai kaniaima pahai enni nadowkah kown takla. Naiawngün dow enni nacha kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 11:42" />Krawng luk kowi kowh chili chalachow mih chap maten dow mu hown sowr mih chap chepaw, akhawk tali chüng hown mang mih chap chepaw, akhawk huma hown kam mih chap chepaw enni nacha kown nadowi. Naiawngün chap maten dow suiiai kaniaima chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 11:43" />Naiawngün chap hown dow enni matia kowi hangkow sürlawkah büa diah. <verse eid="LEV 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 11:44" />Ang dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai chekhai. Ang dow chimsaima chekhai. Naiawng rakowi ang vüi enni matia kowi enni nalang takra kown, now chimsaima enni nauowi kown takla. Krawng luk kowi chili chalachow mih asadua chap hown enni matia kowi hangkow pe tasür talawkah büa diah. <verse eid="LEV 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 11:45" />Ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai; enni kowh Thurai nachowng kownkow Aigupta pren hownia ang uang lawtla enni mih chekhai. Ang dow chimsaima chekhai. Naiawng rakowi enni paw nachimsai kown takla.<verse eid="LEV 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 11:46" />“Mami dow ang kowh rirow chekhai. Mami rirow dow asadua maten hai tui kowi kowh uowi mih chap maten vüi chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 11:47" />Tawng mih chow sürlawk dowi mih, now tawng mih chow sürlawkma mih enni natuk kown takla. Now tawng mih chaknga chow enni iung cha mih, tawng mih chow iung cha dowi mih paw enni natuk kown takla,” pape khai.<verse eid="LEV 11:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LEV 12" />
  <para style="s">Pen kung kowi kowh rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 12:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="LEV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 12:2" />“Israeluüa kowi kowtek pe diah: Masiuüa uowi kim khe che kachakuüa chah chekhai hanow nami masiuüa mih ranit ni mowr asür alawkma nauowi kown. Uisawng uowi khe kowh iawng dow aia mih ranit ni mowr asür alawkma naown kown. <verse eid="LEV 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 12:3" />Now raiat ni mih ni khe dow achapa kowi nahiah pe <char style="w">khampha uanpik</char> kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 12:4" />Nami kung kowi paw nami masiuüa mih aia kowh vi hawk mih rakowi asür alawkma 33 ni mowr nauowi tak kown. Nami 33 ni mowr dow asür alawkma tak rakowi aia mih chimsaima mih uanh naia kak kown nadowi tak, now taklowp taklangra te riaret kowi paw naia kowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 12:5" />Nachenganchepaw masiuüa uowi kim khe che masiuüa chah chekhai hanow nami masiuüa mih pre sapta mowr asür alawkma hai nauowi kown. Nami pre sapta kung kowi paw nami masiuüa mih aia kowh vi hawk mih rakowi asür alawkma 66 ni mowr nauowi tak kown.<verse eid="LEV 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 12:6" />“Kachakuüa chah chepaw, masiuüa chah chepaw asür alawkma uowi mih ni chur kung kowi uowi kim mih masiuüa mih tawncher hown nachang phuchua kown takla. Aia dow taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e uamow tut-e tikah mih uanap chang müa paningchow mih ruapur chah lowk, now angak lawt müa kowi kowh uanap chang müa kimtawn uatur chepaw, kaurawng uatur chepaw nakowpawla lowk kown. <verse eid="LEV 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 12:7" />Naiawngün dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e uamow naphuchuaah now nami masiuüa kowh sürlawkma mih dow nahenta pe kown. Nami kung kowi dow nami masiuüa mih aia kowh vi hawk mih rakowi tasür talawk mih hownia asürlawkma nauowi kown nadowi bowt. Mami dow masiuüa vüi kimuowi kung kowi kowh rirow chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 12:8" />Now nachangla phuchua kownkow aia che uang ia pawla ruapur chah dowi hanow kimtawn uatur chepaw, kaurawng uatur chepaw nauang pawla pre buk kown takla. Nami pre buk mih kowi dow tikah mih uanap chang müa lowk, now alowk mih dow angak lawt müa kowi kowh uanap chang müa naown kown. Naiawng hai aia kowh sürlawkma mih dow uamow nakhuta pe kown, now aia mih asürlawkma nauowi kown nadowi bowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="LEV 12:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LEV 13" />
  <para style="s">Pik kowi rawka phaw mih kowi kowh rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 13:1" />Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, <verse eid="LEV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 13:2" />“Lowra maru kowh pik bau khai chepaw, bawr phaw khai chepaw, pik rawka ngak phaw khai chepaw nami maru kowi dow uamowuüa tut-e nakowpawla kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 13:3" />Now uamowuüa mih nami maru kowh pik rawka phaw mih re-e namü pe kown. Now nami rawka re-e kowh pik pawi ün akawma phaw hai pik lak-e paw nami ma lang büp khai hanow nami dow pik rawka ngak pami enni natukah kown takla. Naiawngün rawka mü pe kung kowi nami maru mih asürlawkma chekhai pami uamow naphuangah kown. <verse eid="LEV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 13:4" />Tawkchedow aia pik kowi kowh rawka phaw mih re-e kowh ma akawma phaw khai chepaw nami che pik lak-e lang büp dowi hai ma pawkra re-e kowh pik pawi ün akawma phaw dowi hanow nami maru kowi mih ranit ni mowr akeng mih maru-uüa hownia uamow nacham lang pe uowiah kown. <verse eid="LEV 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 13:5" />Now ranit ni mih ni khe dow nami maru kowi uamow naplan müah iawk kown. Nami rawka che pik kowi pawk paw krawi pawk dowi bowt hai klowi paw taklowi dowi bowt hanow nami maru kowi mih uamow nacham lang pe uowiah ranit ni iawk kown. <verse eid="LEV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 13:6" />Now ranit ni mih ni khe nami maru kowi uamow naplan müah iawk kown. Nakhowk khe che aia kowh rawka mih pik kowi pawk paw krawi pawk dowi bowt hai lep paw lep khai bowt hanow nami maru mih sürlawk dowi bowt pami uamow naphuangah kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami dow bawr chowtaih. Now nami maru mih aia kowh khupdip tawngklai nachuta kown takla, nahanow aia dow sürlawkma naown kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="LEV 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 13:7" />“Tawkchedow nami maru kowi sürlawkma nadowk pami uamow phuangta kung kowi paw nami bawr che aia pik kowi krawi pawk khai hanow nami maru kowi mih uamow tut-e nauang plan pawla iawk kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 13:8" />Now nami maru kowi mih uamow naplan müah iawk kown. Nami bawr che pik kowi krawi pawk khai hanow nami maru kowi mih asürlawkma pami uamow naphuangah kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami dow pik rawka ngak chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 13:9" />“Lowra maru kowh pik rawka ngak phaw khai hanow nami maru kowi dow uamow tut-e nauang pawla kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 13:10" />Now uamow mih nami maru kowi namüah kown. Now nami maru kowh pik kowi che bau akawma phaw khai, bau rah re-e kowh pik pawi ün paw akawma phaw khai, now nami bau kowi paw ma sing uowi khai hanow <verse eid="LEV 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 13:11" />nami dow pik rawka ngak prim pami natukah kown takla. Now aia kowi dow asürlawkma pami uamow naphuangah kown. Aia kowi dow ranit ni mowr amük takla dowi bowt; akeng mih maru-uüa hownia nalang pe uowita hüah kown takla. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow asürlawk taiama chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 13:12" />Nachenganchepaw nami pik rawka ngak che pabuk pakowma pawk mih aia khi khai hanow <verse eid="LEV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 13:13" />nami maru kowi dow uamow namüah kown. Now nami maru kowh pik rawka pabuk pakowma kowi krawi tasak bowk khowk rakowi iung mih chowbowt pami uamow natukah kown. Nami maru kowh pik dow pabuk pakowma kowi akawma phaw khai bowt rakowi asürlawkma nadowk pahai uamow naphuangah kown. <verse eid="LEV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 13:14" />Nachenganchepaw aia kow kowi che ma sing uang ta phaw khai hanow aia dow asürlawkma naown kown. <verse eid="LEV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 13:15" />Now nami ma sing mü pe hanow nami maru kowi dow asürlawkma pami uamow naphuangah kown. Nami ma sing dow sürlawkma chekhai; aia dow pik rawka ngak phaw mih chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 13:16" />Now nami ma sing che lep kowh akawma uang phaw khai hanow nami maru mih uamow tut-e nakowkowi iawk kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 13:17" />Now uamow mih nami maru kowi naplan müah iawk kown. Now aia kow kowi kowh rawka che lep kowh akawma uang phaw khai hanow nami maru kowi mih sürlawk dowk pami uamow naphuangah kown. Now nami maru dow sürlawkma nadowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="LEV 13:18-19" />“Lowra maru buk kowi che pawibau phaw kowh iung khowk chepaw, nami pawibau re-e akawma chepaw, ring-kawchow chepaw uang phaw khai hanow aia mih uamow kowi nakowtüng pe kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 13:18-19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 13:20" />Now aia kowi mih uamow namüah kown. Nami pawibau lep lawi che pik lak-e lang büp khai, now nami re-e kowh pik pawi ün akawma phaw khai hanow aia dow asürlawkma pami uamow naphuangah kown. Nami pik rawka ngak dow pawibau hownia kowh awr phaw mih chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 13:21" />Nachenganchepaw nami pawibau re-e kowh pik pawi ün akawma nadowk, pik lak-e paw büp dowk, now lep paw lep khowk mih uamow khi hanow aia kowi dow akeng mih maru-uüa hownia ranit ni mowr nacham plan pe uowiah iawk kown. <verse eid="LEV 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 13:22" />Now nami pawibau che pik kowi krawi plan pawk khai hanow nami maru dow asürlawkma pami uamow naphuangah kown. Nami dow rawka ngak chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 13:23" />Nachenganchepaw nami pawibau lep lawi che taklowi paw taklowi dowi, now pawk paw krawi pawk dowi bowt hanow nami dow pawibau lep lawi chowtaih pami natukah kown takla. Now nami maru dow sürlawkma nadowi bowt pami uamow naphuangah kown.<verse eid="LEV 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 13:24" />“Lowra maru maih kowi kamta pik khai hanow nami kam mih re-e kowh ma sing kowi che ring-kawchow chepaw, akawchow chepaw phaw khai hanow <verse eid="LEV 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 13:25" />nami kam mih rah dow uamow namüah kown. Now nami kam mih re-e kowh pik pawi che akawma phaw khai, now kam mih re-e kowh ma paw pik lak-e che lang büp khai hanow nami dow kam rah re-e kowh pik rawka ngak awr phaw mih chekhai pami natukah kown takla. Now nami maru dow asürlawkma pami uamow naphuangah kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami dow pik rawka ngak chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 13:26" />Nachenganchepaw uamow müah kowh nami kam mih rah re-e kowh pik pawi ün akawma phaw dowi, nami kam mih ma paw pik lak-e lang büp dowi, now kam mih ma paw uang lep khowk hanow nami maru kowi dow ranit ni mowr akeng mih maru-uüa hownia uamow nacham lang pe uowiah kown. <verse eid="LEV 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 13:27" />Now ranit ni mih ni khe aia kowi mih uamow naplan müah iawk kown. Nami khin khe nami kam mih ma che krawi pawk khai hanow nami maru dow asürlawkma pami uamow naphuangah kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami dow pik rawka ngak chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 13:28" />Nachenganchepaw nami kam mih ma che klowi paw taklowi dowi, pik kowi pawk paw krawi pawk dowi bowt, now kam mih ma paw uang lep khowk hanow nami dow kam kowh bau mih chowtaih pami natukah kown takla. Now nami maru kowi dow sürlawkma nadowi bowt pami uamow naphuangah kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami dow kam mih ma lawi chowtaih.<verse eid="LEV 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 13:29" />“Lowra mih maru lu kowi chepaw, kow kowi chepaw ma phaw khai hanow <verse eid="LEV 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 13:30" />nami maru kowi dow uamow namüah kown. Now nami ma che pik lak-e lang büp khai, nami ma phaw rah re-e kowh sam hai mawmpawi ün asinchow uang phaw khai, now apowm paw asüachow uang phaw khai hanow nami maru dow asürlawkma pami uamow naphuangah kown. Nami dow lu hai kow kowi kowh rak mih pik rawka ngak chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 13:31" />Now uamow müah kowh nami ma pik lak-e lang büp dowi bowt chepaw nami ma phaw rah re-e kowh sam hai mawmpawi che num dowi tak hanow nami kowi dow akeng mih maru-uüa hownia ranit ni mowr uamow nacham lang pe uowiah kown. <verse eid="LEV 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 13:32" />Now ranit ni mih ni khe dow nami ma mih uamow naplan müah iawk kown. Nakhowk khe nami rak mih ma che pawk paw krawi pawk dowi, nami ma phaw rah re-e kowh sam hai mawmpawi ün asüachow paw phaw dowi, now nami ma dow pik lak-e paw lang büp dowi hanow <verse eid="LEV 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 13:33" />nami maru kowh sam hai pawi dow nakhaita kown takla. Nachenganchepaw ma phaw rah re-e kowh sam hai pawi dow naia khai kown nadowi. Now nami maru kowi dow akeng mih maru-uüa hownia ranit ni mowr uamow nacham plan pe uowiah iawk kown. <verse eid="LEV 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 13:34" />Now ranit ni mih ni khe nami maru kowh rak mih rawka mih uamow naplan mü pe iawk kown. Now nami rawka che pik kowi krawi pawk dowi, now nami rawka che pik lak-e paw lang büp dowi hanow nami maru dow sürlawkma nadowi bowt pami uamow naphuangah kown. Now nami maru mih aia kowh khupdip tawngklai nachuta kown takla, now aia dow sürlawkma naown kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="LEV 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 13:35" />“Now aia dow sürlawkma nadowi bowt pami phuangta kung kowi paw nami rak mih rawka che krawi pawk khai hanow <verse eid="LEV 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 13:36" />nami maru kowi mih uamow naplan müah iawk kown. Nami rak mih rawka che krawi plan pawk khai hanow nami ma re-e kowh sam hai pawi mih asüama phaw chünchü mih amük kla dowi bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami maru dow asürlawk taiama chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 13:37" />Nachenganchepaw uamow müah kowh nami rak mih rawka che klowi paw taklowi dowi, now nami ma phaw mih rah re-e kowh sam hai pawi paw anumma uang awm khowk hanow nami ma dow iung khowk pami natukah kown takla. Nahanow aia dow sürlawkma nadowi bowt pami uamow naphuangah kown.<verse eid="LEV 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 13:38" />“Lowra mih maru masiuüa lah, kachakuüa lah pik kowi che akaw akawma uang phaw khai hanow <verse eid="LEV 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 13:39" />nami maru kowi dow uamow namüah kown. Now nami akawma mih che lawiliama uang phaw khai hanow nami dow bawr chowtaih pami natukah kown takla. Nami dow napiakla pat mih rawka nadowi chekhai. Aia dow sürlawkma nadowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 13:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 13:40" />“Lowra maru kowh che sam tachawi kowh lu takling khai chepaw nami maru dow asürlawkma naown kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 13:41" />Lowra maru kowh che kau sam tachawi kowh kau takia khai chepaw nami maru dow asürlawkma naown kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 13:42" />Nachenganchepaw nami lu klingma mih kowi lah, kau kiama mih kowi lah ring-kawchow phaw khai hanow nami dow pik rawka ngak phaw mih chekhai pami natukah kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 13:43" />Nami maru kowi dow uamow namüah kown. Now nami maru kowh lu klingma mih kowi lah, kau kiama mih kowi lah pik rawka ngak rawka iawng ring-kawchow uang phaw mih rah re-e bau khai hanow <verse eid="LEV 13:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 13:44" />nami maru kowh dow pik rawka ngak phaw mih chowbowt pami natukah kown takla, now aia dow asürlawkma chekhai. Aia lu kowi pik rawka ngak phaw rakowi nami maru dow asürlawkma pami uamow naphuangah kown.<verse eid="LEV 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 13:45" />“Naiawng pik rawka ngak phaw mih maru dow tawnguat sekma mih nakhup kown takla. Now aia dow sam paw naia rüt kown nadowi; prunthuma naiiata hüah kown takla. Nami klen kowi aia mih pumta nawr hanow hek se, ‘Ang dow sürlawkma, ang dow sürlawkma,’ pah paw natek kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 13:46" />Nami maru dow aia buk kowi pik rawka ngak uowi mowr asürlawkma naown kown. Naiawng rakowi aia malowkchow kowi tangbung khup rah uat kowi nacham lang pe uowiah kown takla.<verse eid="LEV 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tawnguat hai uanh mawd khe kowh rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47-48" style="v" sid="LEV 13:47-48" />“Lowra mih tawnguat hai chak pik hown kowh thawpah mih uanh dow ia mawd chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 13:47-48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 13:49" />Tawnguat hai chak pik hown kowh thawpah mih uanh kowi che asingchow mih lawi lah, aringchow mih lawi lah phaw khai hanow nami dow mawd mih chekhai pami natukah kown takla. Nami uanh dow uamow kowi natüng pe kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 13:50" />Now nami uanh mih uamow namüah kown. Nami uanh dow akeng mih uanh hownia ranit ni mowr uamow nacham lang pe towah kown. <verse eid="LEV 13:50" /><verse number="51-52" style="v" sid="LEV 13:51-52" />Now ranit ni mih ni khe dow nami uanh mih uamow naplan müah iawk kown. Nakhowk khe tawnguat kowi lah, chak pik hown kowh thawpah mih uanh kowi lah — asingchow mih lawi chepaw, aringchow mih lawi chepaw phaw mih che uang phia ngamlam hanow nami dow mawd mih chowbowt pami natukah kown takla. Nami uanh dow asürlawkma chekhai rakowi natikta kown takla.<verse eid="LEV 13:51-52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 13:53" />“Nachenganchepaw uamow müah kowh asingchow chepaw, aringchow chepaw phaw mih uang phia dowi bowt hanow <verse eid="LEV 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 13:54" />nami uanh mih nachuah hai nasauah kown mih uamow napeah ana kown. Nami kung kowi dow nami uanh mih akeng mih uanh hownia ranit ni mowr uamow nacham lang pe towah iawk kown. <verse eid="LEV 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 13:55" />Nami kung kowi dow nami uanh mih uamow naplan müah iawk kown. Nami mawd mih uang phia dowi bowt chepaw auown khe kowh iawng asingchow hai aringchow reng tak hanow nami uanh dow asürlawkma pami natukah kown takla. Uanh lak kowi chepaw, uanh kum kowi chepaw naiawng mawd mih dow natikta kown takla.<verse eid="LEV 13:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LEV 13:56" />“Now nami uanh chuta hai sauta kung kowi paw mawd mih re-e lawiliama phaw mih uamow khi hanow nami lawiliama mih rah dow nasekta kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LEV 13:57" />Nachenganchepaw tawnguat lah, chak pik hown kowh thawpah mih uanh lah asingchow chepaw, aringchow chepaw plan phaw khai hanow nami dow uang phia ngamlam mih chowbowt pami natukah kown takla. Nami mawd mih uanh dow natikta kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LEV 13:58" />Nami uanh dow chuta hai sauta kung kowi mawd mih powt khowk chepaw naplan pe chuta hai sauta iawk kown takla, nahanow nami uanh dow sürlawkma naown kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 13:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LEV 13:59" />Naiawngün dow tawnguat lah, chak pik hown kowh thawpah mih uanh lah mawd khe kowh rirow chekhai. Nami rirow iawng uanh sürlawk dowi mih hai sürlawkma mih dow uamow naphuangah kown takla.<verse eid="LEV 13:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LEV 14" />
  <para style="s">Pik rawka ngak hownia tachim tasai rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 14:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="LEV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 14:2" />“Mami dow pik rawka ngak phaw mih maru tachim tasai müa rirow chekhai. Pik rawka ngak phaw mih maru che aia kowh rawka iung khowk powm iawng now uamow tut-e nakowpawla kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 14:3" />Now nami maru kowi mih tangbung khup rah uat kowi uamow nakowmüah kown. Nami maru kowh che pik rawka ngak iung khai bowt hanow <verse eid="LEV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 14:4" />nami maru vüi sürlawkma nadowi mih uakling sing pre buk, sidar singh klowk lowk, aringma mih la iang adung, now lawngthow singh kre pakre uamow nauang pe pawla kown. <verse eid="LEV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 14:5" />Now nami uakling pre buk mih hownia nangenah lowk kown mih uamow napeah ana kown. Nami dow bawn kawng kowi kowh towah mih hawriang tui luk kowi nangenah kown. <verse eid="LEV 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 14:6" />Nami hawriang tui luk kowi kowh ngenah mih uakling vi kowi dow alowk mih uakling sing, sidar singh klowk, aringma mih la iang hai lawngthow kre mih uamow nachimah kown. <verse eid="LEV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 14:7" />Now pik rawka ngak hownia chimsaiah kown mih maru kowi nami vi uamow nathet pe ranit kat kown. Now nami maru dow sürlawkma nadowi bowt pami uamow naphuangah kown, now alowk mih uakling sing dow uamow nalawtta kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 14:8" />Now nami sürlawk dowi bowt mih maru mih aia kowh khupdip tawngklai nachuta prowng kown, now aia kowh pik pawi hai sam ün khaita hanow nalu kown takla. Nahanow aia dow sürlawkma naown kown nadowi bowt, now aia dow tangbung khup rah kowi uang ia uang kown towbowt. Tawkchedow aiamat tangbung lak kowi ranit ni mowr mih uang ia kup kown nadowi tak. <verse eid="LEV 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 14:9" />Now ranit ni mih ni khe dow aia kowh sam ün, mawmpawi ün, mikkhu pawi ün hai pik pawi ün naplan khaita kown takla. Now aia kowh khupdip tawngklai paw naplan chuta iawk kown, now lu paw naplan lu iawk kown takla. Nahanow aia dow asürlawkma naown kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="LEV 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 14:10" />“Now raiat ni mih ni khe dow nami maru mih ruapur chah pre pum hai aningchow mih ruapur iia papum nauang pawla kown takla. Naiawngün dow aser auowk naia uowi kown nadowi. Now kawmdi uanap chang müa lawk pe kanrawn sau mih kawmdi lang iung mih paw tali set hown 200 gram, now kanrawn sau paw apua ngia aia nauang pawla kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 14:11" />Nami maru kowi kowh chimsaiah mih uamow mih nami maru kowi taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nauang pawla kown. Now naap-ah kownkow nami maru uang pawla mih uanh paw CHAKRAMANG pur kowi uamow nauang pawla kown takla.<verse eid="LEV 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 14:12" />“Now ruapur chah pre pum mih hownia papum mih ruapur chah dow uamow nachangla aprek sung uanap kown. Nami ruapur chah hai apua hown ditchow mih kanrawn sau dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi uamow nakrowngah kown. Nami dow amülüngma mih uanap chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 14:13" />Nami ruapur chah dow angak lawt lük müa uanap hai tikah mih uanap chang khe kowh arah chimsaima mih kowi kowh tawncher ngenra re-e nangenah kown takla. Nami aprek sung uanap kowi kowh chaknga paw angak lawt lük müa uanap kowi kowh chaknga iawng uamow kakbak chekhai. Nami uanap dow achimsaima chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 14:14" />Now nami aprek sung uanap kowi kowh tawncher vi mih uamow napawah sangrum kown. Nami vi dow sürlawkma nadowi bowt kown mih maru kowh hawmlawm pra kowh param iah kowi, hawmlawm pra kowh rutma kowi hai hawmlawm pra kowh khawkma kowi uamow namai pe kown. <verse eid="LEV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 14:15" />Now uamow mih kanrawn sau napawah apua hown ditchow hanow aia lakuai pra kowh rutpha kowi naklaiah kown. <verse eid="LEV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 14:16" />Now aia mih lakuai pra rutpha kowi kowh kanrawn sau kowi hawmlawm pra kowh rutchawk hown iu chimah hanow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi ranit kat nathetah kown. <verse eid="LEV 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 14:17" />Now aia rutpha kowi kowh ta lat mih kanrawn sau dow aia napawah sangrum kown. Nami kanrawn sau dow sürlawkma nadowi bowt kown mih maru kowh hawmlawm pra kowh param iah kowi, hawmlawm pra kowh rutma kowi hai hawmlawm pra kowh khawkma kowi naplik pe kown. Nami sau paw tawncher vi plikra kowi nakrawi plikah kown. <verse eid="LEV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 14:18" />Now rutpha kowi kowh ta lat mih sau dow sürlawkma nadowi bowt kown mih maru lu kowi uamow naphawk pe kown. Naiawng hai CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nami maru kowh sürlawi dow uamow nakhuta pe kown.<verse eid="LEV 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 14:19" />“Nami kung kowi dow sürlawkma nadowi bowt kown mih maru kowi nachimsaiah kownkow angak lawt lük müa uanap uamow naap pe kown. Now tikah mih uanap kowi kowh tawncher mih uamow nangenah kown. <verse eid="LEV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 14:20" />Now uamow mih phuchuara luk kowi tikah mih uanap hai kawmdi uanap naap kown. Naiawng hai nami maru kowi dow uamow nachimsaiah kown, nahanow nami maru mih nachimsai kown towbowt.<verse eid="LEV 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngarai miuüa kowh tachim tasai rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 14:21" />“Nachenganchepaw pik rawka iung mih maru che ngaraima chekhai hanow aia kowh angak lawt lük müa uanap chang müa uamow tut-e nauang pawla ruapur chah papum chow kown. Nami maru kowi nachimsaiah kownkow uamow mih nami ruapur chah nakrowngah kown. Now kawmdi uanap chang müa paw kanrawn sau hown kowh lawkah mih kawmdi lang iung mih aset hown 400 gram hai kanrawn sau apua hown ditchow aia nauang pawla kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 14:22" />Aia uang ia pawla mih hownia kimtawn uatur chepaw, kaurawng uatur chepaw nauang pawla pre buk chi kown takla. Nami pre buk mih hownia lowk dow angak lawt lük müa uanap nachangla kown, now alowk mih dow tikah mih uanap nachangla kown. <verse eid="LEV 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 14:23" />Naiawngün dow aia tachim tasai müa raiat ni mih ni khe taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e CHAKRAMANG pur kowi uamow tut-e nami maru nauang pawla kown. <verse eid="LEV 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 14:24" />Now aprek sung uanap chang müa ruapur chah hai kanrawn sau apua hown ditchow mih uamow napawah kown, now naiawngün dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi aia nakrowngah kown. Nami dow amülüngma mih uanap chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 14:25" />“Aprek sung uanap kowi kowh tawncher dow nangenah hanow avi mih uamow napawah sangrum kown. Nami vi dow sürlawkma nadowi bowt kown mih maru kowh hawmlawm pra kowh param iah kowi, hawmlawm pra kowh rutma kowi hai hawmlawm pra kowh khawkma kowi uamow namai pe kown. <verse eid="LEV 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 14:26" />Now aia mih kanrawn sau napawah sangrum hanow aia lakuai pra kowh rutpha kowi naklaiah kown. <verse eid="LEV 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 14:27" />Now aia dow lakuai pra rutpha kowi kowh kanrawn sau kowi hawmlawm pra kowh rutchawk hown iu chimah hanow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi ranit kat nathetah kown. <verse eid="LEV 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 14:28" />Now uamow mih aia rutpha kowi kowh ta lat mih kanrawn sau napawah sangrum kown, now nami sau mih sürlawkma nadowi bowt kown mih maru kowi naplik pe kown; aia dow tawncher vi plikra kowi nakrawi plik pe kown. Aia dow nami maru hawmlawm pra kowh param iah kowi, hawmlawm pra kowh rutma kowi hai hawmlawm pra kowh khawkma kowi naplik pe kown. <verse eid="LEV 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 14:29" />Now rutpha kowi kowh ta lat mih sau dow sürlawkma nadowi bowt kown mih maru lu kowi uamow naphawk pe kown. Naiawng hai CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nami maru kowh sürlawk dow uamow nakhuta pe kown.<verse eid="LEV 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="LEV 14:30-31" />“Now nami maru uang ia pawla mih hownia kaurawng uatur chepaw, kimtawn uatur chepaw uamow napawah pre buk kown. Nami pre buk mih hownia lowk dow angak lawt lük müa uanap nachangla kown, now alowk mih dow tikah mih uanap nachangla kown. Naiawngün dow kawmdi uanap hown aia naap-ah kown. Naiawng hai CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nami maru kowi mih uamow nachimsaiah kown.<verse eid="LEV 14:30-31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 14:32" />“Nami dow ngarai miuüa kowh tachim tasai müa uanap rirow chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kim mawd khe kowh rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 14:33" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi hai Arawn iüah mih, <verse eid="LEV 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 14:34" />“Kanan pren mih nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow ang nape powng enni kown. Nami pren kowi enni kowuowi mih khin khe enni kowh kim kowi che mawd khe kowh iawng ang pe phawah khai hanow <verse eid="LEV 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 14:35" />nami kim iah mih uamow tut-e nakowkowi kown. Aia tek pe uamow kown mih, ‘Ang kim kowi mawd mih iawng uang phaw khai,’ napa kown. <verse eid="LEV 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 14:36" />Nahanow kowmü mawd kownkow kim kowi uamow kowkup dowi rawn kim kowi kowh uanh uowi mih maten nalawtta kown mih aia napeah ana kown. Naiawng che kim iah chang hanow kim kowi kowh uanh mih nasürlawk kown nadowi bowt. Nami kung kowi dow uamow nakowkup hanow nami kim nakowmü kown. <verse eid="LEV 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 14:37" />Now kimbang mawd mih che asingma chepaw, aringma chepaw kimbang kowi büp ngamlam mih aia khi hanow <verse eid="LEV 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 14:38" />nami kim hownia uang lawt now nami kim mih ranit ni mowr uamow nape büngta kown. <verse eid="LEV 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 14:39" />Now ranit ni mih ni khe dow uamow naplan uangah hanow nami kim nauang plan müah iawk kown. Nami mawd mih che kimbang kowi krawi chai ngamlam khai hanow <verse eid="LEV 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 14:40" />pingla kim mih hua kowi kowh mawd mih hua mih marow uat kowi kowh sürlawkma mih arah kowi nacham kuakta kownkow uamow napeah ana kown. <verse eid="LEV 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 14:41" />Now kim iah mih kim lak kowi kowh kimbang maten nakhaita bowk kown, nahanow nami khaiia dow marow uat kowi sürlawkma mih arah kowi nacham kuakta kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 14:42" />Now mawd mih re-e kowh pawta pe hua mih re-e hua sar plan tow pe hanow bawnnai hown aia naplan miaah iawk kown takla.<verse eid="LEV 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 14:43" />“Now kimbang kowi kowh hua klaita pe kowh miata kung kowi paw nami mawd mih che plan phaw khai hanow <verse eid="LEV 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 14:44" />uamow kowplan kowiah now nami kim naplan müah iawk kown. Now mawd khe kowh iawng mih krawi chai ngamlam khai hanow nami dow mawd mih chekhai pami natukah kown takla. Nami kim dow asürlawkma chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 14:45" />Nami kim dow kim iah napiakta kown takla. Changla kim mih hua ün, miala kim mih bawnnai ün hai singh ün napiakta bowk hanow marow uat kowi kowh asürlawkma mih arah kowi aia nacham kuakta kown takla.<verse eid="LEV 14:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 14:46" />“Now ranit ni mowr büngta hüah mih khin khe nami kim kowi kowkup khai mih maru dow nami ni sat kup dowi mowr asürlawkma nauowi kown. <verse eid="LEV 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 14:47" />Nami kim kowi kowcha kowkham mih uowi khai chepaw, kowmüi mih uowi khai chepaw nami maru dow aia kowh khupdip tawngklai nachuta kown takla.<verse eid="LEV 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 14:48" />“Nachenganchepaw nami kim ki miata kung kowi uamow plan müah iawk khe nami mawd mih che kimbang kowi uowi dowi bowt hanow nami kim dow sürlawkma nadowi bowt pami uamow naphuangah kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami kim kowi kowh mawd dow mit khai bowt. <verse eid="LEV 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 14:49" />Now nami kim chimsaila kownkow uakling sing pre buk, sidar singh klowk lowk, aringma mih la iang adung hai lawngthow singh kre pakre uamow napawah kown. <verse eid="LEV 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 14:50" />Nami uakling dow bawn kawng kowi kowh towah mih hawriang tui luk kowi uamow nangenah lowk kown. <verse eid="LEV 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 14:51" />Nami hawriang tui luk kowi kowh ngenah mih uakling vi kowi dow alowk mih uakling sing, sidar singh klowk, aringma mih la iang hai lawngthow kre mih uamow nachimah kown, now nami vi dow kim kowi aia nakrawi thetah ranit kat kown. <verse eid="LEV 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 14:52" />Naiawng hai nami kim dow uamow nachimsaiah kown. <verse eid="LEV 14:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 14:53" />Now nami uakling sing dow marow uat kowi nacham pawla hanow kaurawng kowi uamow nacham lawtah kown. Naiawng hai nami kim kowi kowh asürlawkma mih dow uamow nachimsaiah kown. Nahanow nami kim mih nachimsai kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 14:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54-56" style="v" sid="LEV 14:54-56" />Maiawngün dow pik rawka ngak, rak mih rawka, pik bau rawka, bawr rawka, pik kowi akawma mih rawka, kim kowi hai uanh kowi mawd khe kowh rirow chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 14:54-56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LEV 14:57" />Naiawngün rawka hownia dow maru lah, uanh lah tawng khe chow sürlawk dowi kown mih hai tawng khe chow sürlawk kown mih mami rirow kowi uowi bowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 14:57">Mami dow pik rawka ngak hai mawd mih lawnguan kowi kowh rirow chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 14:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LEV 15" />
  <para style="s">Kachakuüa tasür talawk khe kowh tachim tasai rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 15:1" />Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, <verse eid="LEV 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 15:2" />“Israeluüa kowi kowtek pe diah: Rawka uowi rakowi kachakuüa kowh khampha uanh hownia aiawnglowma towk naklak mih tui dow asür alawkma chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 15:3" />Naiawng mih tui dow hing towkta hüah chepaw, towk akat now rim khai chepaw naiawng mih tui towk mih kachakuüa mih asür alawkma naown kown. <verse eid="LEV 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 15:4" />Naiawng asür alawkma uowi reng tak khe nami kachakuüa krawi mawkah mih mawk rah hai krawi chowmah mih chowm rah maten natawi tasür talawk kown. <verse eid="LEV 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 15:5" />Naiawng asür alawkma mih maru mawkah mih mawk rah kowi kak mih maru dow aia kowh tawnguat nachuta hanow nalu kown takla, now aia mih sat kup dowi mowr asür alawkma nauowi kown. <verse eid="LEV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 15:6" />Naiawng asür alawkma mih maru chowmah mih chowm rah kowi chowm mih maru dow aia kowh tawnguat nachuta hanow nalu kown takla. Aia dow sat kup dowi mowr asür alawkma nauowi kown. <verse eid="LEV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 15:7" />Khampha uanh hownia aiawnglowma tui awr towk mih maru kowi kakta mih maru paw aia kowh tawnguat nachuta hanow nalu kown takla, now aia mih sat kup dowi mowr asür alawkma nauowi kown. <verse eid="LEV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 15:8" />Now kow hownia aiawnglowma tui awr towk mih maru che sürlawkma nadowi mih maru kowi thawkta khai hanow nami sürlawkma nadowi mih maru paw aia kowh tawnguat nachuta hanow nalu kown takla, now aia mih sat kup dowi mowr asür alawkma nauowi kown. <verse eid="LEV 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 15:9" />Naiawng aiawnglowma tui awr towk mih maru cham kowi khari mih khin paw nauowi kown. Nami khin khe kowh aia chowmah mih tawncher luk kowi kowh dauah mih uan paw natasür talawk kown. <verse eid="LEV 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 15:10" />Nami maru chowmah mih chowm rah kowi kak mih maru dow aia kowh tawnguat nachuta hanow nalu kown takla, now aia mih sat kup dowi mowr asür alawkma nauowi kown. <verse eid="LEV 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 15:11" />Naiawng mih maru che sia rut dowi matchang cham kakta maru khai hanow aia kakah mih maru paw nachuta tawnguat hanow nalu kown takla, now aia mih sat kup dowi mowr asür alawkma nauowi kown. <verse eid="LEV 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 15:12" />Naiawng mih maru che bawn bia kowi kakta khai hanow nami bawn bia dow nateuta kown takla. Now singh hown kowh bia kowi che kakta khai hanow nami bia dow tui hown klangiungma nasawk sauta kown.<verse eid="LEV 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 15:13" />“Now naiawng khampha uanh hownia tui awr towk mih iung khe dow aia mih natasür natalawkla dowi bowt kownkow ranit ni mowr nachawngah kown takla. Ranit ni chih khe mih aia kowh tawnguat nachuta hanow hawriang tui hown nalu kown takla, nahanow aia mih asürlawkma nauowi kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="LEV 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 15:14" />Now raiat ni mih ni khe dow kimtawn uatur chepaw, kaurawng uatur chepaw napawla pre buk hanow taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nauang kown takla. Nami uatur pre buk mih dow uamow rut kowi naap pe kown. <verse eid="LEV 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 15:15" />Nami uatur pre buk mih hown dow angak lawt lük müa uanap vüi lowk, now tikah mih uanap vüi lowk uamow naap-ah kown. Naiawng hai aiawnglowma khampha uanh hownia tui awr towk mih maru kowh tasür talawk mih dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi uamow nakhuta pe kown.<verse eid="LEV 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 15:16" />“Lowra kachakuüa kowh che khampha uanh tui chawn khai hanow khampha uanh tui chawn mih kachakuüa mih nalu kown takla, now aia mih sat kup dowi mowr asür alawkma nauowi kown. <verse eid="LEV 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 15:17" />Khampha uanh tui che dawnguan kowi chepaw, chak pik hown kowh uanh kowi chepaw talük takak khai hanow naiawngün dow nachuta kown takla, now naiawngün uanh mih sat kup dowi mowr asürlawkma nauowi kown. <verse eid="LEV 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 15:18" />Now masiuüa hown kachakuüa taphua taiua kung kowi paw amatchi pre ia nalu kown takla, now amatchi mih sat kup dowi mowr asür alawkma nauowi iüah kown.<verse eid="LEV 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uisawng uowi khe kowh tasür talawk dowi kown mih rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 15:19" />“Masiuüa kowh dow la towng <char style="w">uisawng</char> uowi reng chekhai. Naiawng uisawng uowi mih masiuüa dow aia kowh vi hawk mih rakowi ranit ni mowr asür alawkma nauowi kown. Naiawng uowi thüm khe nami masiuüa kowi kak mih maru mih sat kup dowi mowr asür alawkma nauowi kown. <verse eid="LEV 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 15:20" />Naiawng uisawng uowi thüm khe nami masiuüa krawi mawkah mih mawk rah hai krawi chowmah mih chowm rah srui natawi tasür talawk kown. <verse eid="LEV 15:20" /><verse number="21-23" style="v" sid="LEV 15:21-23" />Nami tasür talawk khowk mih mawk rah kowi chepaw, chowm rah kowi chepaw kak mih maru paw aia kowh tawnguat nachuta hanow nalu kown takla, now aia mih sat kup dowi mowr asür alawkma nauowi kown. <verse eid="LEV 15:21-23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 15:24" />Naiawng uisawng uowi thüm mih masiuüa hown kachakuüa che taphua taiua hai masiuüa kowh vi che aia kow kowi talük takak khai hanow nami kachakuüa paw ranit ni mowr asür alawkma nauowi kown. Nami ranit ni takra kowi aia cham krawi mawkla mih mawk rah paw natawi tasür talawk kown.<verse eid="LEV 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 15:25" />“Now masiuüa kowh che la towng kowh rirow uowi mih klen kowi paw hawk vi khai hanow nami vi hawk mih prowng dowi mowr rirow uowi khe kowh iawng asür alawkma nauowi kown. <verse eid="LEV 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 15:26" />Naiawng vi hawk khe paw nami masiuüa mawkah mih mawk rah hai chowmah mih chowm rah mih rirow uowi khe kowh iawng natawi tasür talawk kown. <verse eid="LEV 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 15:27" />Nami masiuüa mawkah mih mawk rah hai chowmah mih chowm rah kowi kak mih maru paw asür alawkma naown kown. Naiawngün kowi kakta mih maru dow aia kowh tawnguat nachuta hanow nalu kown takla, now aia mih sat kup dowi mowr asür alawkma nauowi kown. <verse eid="LEV 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 15:28" />Naiawng vi hawk mih prowng kung kowi paw prowng mih ni hownia klowkah now ranit ni mowr asür alawkma nauowi kown, now nami kung kowi dow sürlawkma naown kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="LEV 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 15:29" />Now raiat ni mih ni khe aia mih kimtawn uatur chepaw, kaurawng uatur chepaw napawla pre buk hanow taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e uamow tut-e nakowkowi kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 15:30" />Nami uatur pre buk mih hown angak lawt lük müa uanap vüi lowk, now tikah mih uanap vüi lowk uamow naap-ah kown. Naiawng hai aia kowh vi hawk mih hownia tasür talawk mih dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi uamow nakhuta pe kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 15:31" />Nami kung kowi Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi ang kowh taklowp taklangra te uowi. Naiawng rakowi taklowp taklangra te kowi sürlawkta hanow nakowngla büah dowi kownkow asür alawkma mih chap maten hownia Israeluüa kowi pe tahenah iüa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32-33" style="v" sid="LEV 15:32-33" />Mami rirow dow kachakuüa kowh khampha uanh hownia aiawnglowma tui awr towk khe kowh vüi, uisawng uowi khe kowh vüi, masiuüa hai kachakuüa taphua taiua khe kowh vüi, asür alawkma mih masiuüa hown taphua taiua khe kowh vüi ün chekhai. Naiawngün hown tasür talawk khai hanow mami rirow iawng nachangah kown mih chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 15:32-33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LEV 16" />
  <para style="ms">Angak lawt lük ni</para>
  <para style="s">Uamowuüa kowh tawnguat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 16:1" />Ana pek iawng nadowi hai CHAKRAMANG pur kowi awr ap maikhük rakowi Arawn kowh chapa pre ia kowng kung kowi Mosi hown CHAKRAMANG uang taklang khai. <verse eid="LEV 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 16:2" />Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Taklowp taklangra te lak kowi kowh Lang Chimsai Mih Towklak kowi <char style="w">sangbowk laitawm tawkpla</char> uowi. Nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla küm luk kowi uangnim iawng ang uang tatüng reng. Naiawng rakowi en taimow Arawn mih aia nau mih khin khe hauang pacham kup lah. Aia che uang kup naklak khai hanow aia mih nakowng kown chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 16:3" />“Lang Chimsai mih towklak kowi Arawn kowkup kown nau now chiala apum hai ruapurla apum narik kamrütta hüah kown takla. Chiala dow angak lawt lük müa uanap vüi, now ruapurla dow tikah mih uanap chang müa vüi aia nasunah kown. <verse eid="LEV 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 16:4" />Nami kung kowi dow aia mih narik lu tui kown takla. Ki lu tui kung kowi dow adipükchow mih la hown kowh kowrmow nakhup kown, now adipükchow mih la hown kowh kraksa dawngh nakruala kown. Nami klen kowi adipükchow mih la hown kowh kekawm paw nakawmla hanow adipükchow mih la hown kowh napawng nasuila kown. Naiawngün dow chimsaima mih tawnguat chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 16:5" />Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia ruala pre pum hai ruapurla apum Arawn kowi nauang pawla pe kown. Nami ruala pre pum mih dow angak lawt lük müa uanap vüi nasunah kown, now ruapurla apum mih dow tikah mih uanap chang müa nasunah kown.<verse eid="LEV 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akeng mih uanap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 16:6" />“Aiamat kowh angak hai aia krungchakuüa kowh angak nalawtla kownkow angak lawt lük müa uanap vüi kowi kowh chiala Arawn mih naap kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 16:7" />Nami kung kowi dow angak lawt lük müa ruala pre pum mih taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e CHAKRAMANG pur kowi aia nakowpawla kown. <verse eid="LEV 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 16:8" />Nami ruala pre pum mih dow alawt müa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Alawt müa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami akeng Baible kowi dow Azazel pami arah kowi nalawtah kown pahai arui uowi.</char></note> apum, now CHAKRAMANG vüi nasunah kown mih apum chekhai. Naiawng rakowi tawng mih chow alawt müa hai tawng mih chow CHAKRAMANG vüi pami natukla kownkow nakuak pe plang kown. <verse eid="LEV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 16:9" />Kuak pe plang khe kowh CHAKRAMANG vüi tatawng mih ruala dow napawah hanow angak lawt lük müa uanap Arawn nachangla kown. <verse eid="LEV 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 16:10" />Now kuak pe plang khe kowh alawt müa tatawng mih ruala dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi asing nakowpawla kown takla. Nami kung kowi dow maru kawmuüa kowh angak nacham kurla kownkow nami ruala kowi süngrüp süngkangma kowi nacham saah kown.<verse eid="LEV 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 16:11" />“Aiamat kowh angak hai aia krungchakuüa kowh angak nalawtla kownkow angak lawt lük müa uanap vüi uang pawla mih chiala dow Arawn nangenah kown. <verse eid="LEV 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 16:12" />Now CHAKRAMANG pur kowi kowh phuchuara hownia mairing pawk müa puh hown tek mup mowr mairing mih napawah kown, now anam iungma mih maikhük towk müa than di adidüpchow mih paw napawla pre chawm kown. Naiawngün pawla now taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh Lang Chimsai mih towklak kowi Arawn nakowkup kown. <verse eid="LEV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 16:13" />Now CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nami towklak kowi aia pawla mih mairing luk kowi aia nathe pe than di kown. Nahanow nami maikhük hown sangbowk laitawm tawkpla küm mih nakhi-ah kown nadowi bowt, now aia paw nakowng kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="LEV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 16:14" />Nami kung kowi dow Arawn mih nami chiala vi rutchawk hown iu krawah now sangbowk laitawm tawkpla küm pur prakowi nathetah ranit kat kown.<verse eid="LEV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 16:15" />“Nami kung kowi dow maru kawmuüa kowh angak lawt lük müa ruala mih Arawn nangenah kown. Nami ruala vi paw napawla sangrum hanow taklowp taklangra te lak kowi kowh Lang Chimsai mih towklak kowi chiala vi hown kowh changah iawng nakowchang kown; sangbowk laitawm tawkpla küm luk kowi hai pur prakowi mih nami ruala vi paw nakrawi thetah kown. <verse eid="LEV 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 16:16" />Taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh Lang Chimsai mih towklak dow naiawng hai Arawn nachim nasaiah kown. Nami klen kowi taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh akeng mih arah maten paw Israeluüa kowh angak hai asür alawkma mih dawng kowi uowi mih chekhai rakowi naiawng aia nakhuta kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 16:17" />Now aiamat kowh angak hai aia krungchak kowh angak hown Israel chen pachenma kowh angak nalawtla kownkow taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh Lang Chimsai mih towklak kowi Arawn nakowchang lup kown. Nami towklak hownia Arawn uang lawt dowi mowr dow taklowp taklangra te kowi miapaw naia uowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 16:18" />Now taklowp taklangra te hownia uang lawt hanow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi kowh phuchuara sürlawkma mih Arawn nakhuta pe kown. Aia dow chiala hai ruala vi napawah hanow phuchuara kowi kowh nang tali klüng mih kowi nakrawi plikah kown. <verse eid="LEV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 16:19" />Nami kung kowi dow nami vi mih rutchawk hown napawah hanow phuchuara kowi ranit kat nakrawi thetah kown. Naiawng hai Israeluüa kowh angak rakowi tasür talawk mih phuchuara dow aia nachimsaiah kown.<verse eid="LEV 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nalawtah kown mih ruala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 16:20" />“Lang Chimsai mih Arah hown taklowp taklangra te hai phuchuara ki chimsaita kung kowi dow nalawtah kown mih ruala Arawn nauang pawla kown. <verse eid="LEV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 16:21" />Aia kowh rut pre pra trui nami ruala lu kowi aia natangah kown. Now Israeluüa kowh angak maten, aprek maten hai tawita mata mih maten nataphuang hanow naiawngün mih nami ruala luk kowi natangta bowk kown. Nami kung kowi dow nacham lawt rua kownkow khowmah bowkah mih maru kowi nami ruala aia naap pe kown, now süngrüp süngkangma kowi aia nacham pe saah kown. <verse eid="LEV 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 16:22" />Nami maru dow nami ruala kowi süngrüp süngkangma kowi nacham lawtah kown. Now nami ruala mih süngrüp süngkangma kowi Israeluüa kowh angak maten nacham kurla kown.<verse eid="LEV 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 16:23" />“Nami kung kowi dow taklowp taklangra te lak kowi Arawn nakup iawk kown. Now nakowi mih Lang Chimsai mih towklak kowi kup khe kowh aia khupla mih adipükchow mih la hown kowh tawnguat maten naklüpla hanow natowla kown. <verse eid="LEV 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 16:24" />Nami kung kowi dow nami hownia uang lawt hanow taklowp taklangra te viadawng kowi nalu tui kown, now uamowuüa khupah reng mih tawnguat aia nakhup bowt kown. Nami kung kowi dow aiamat vüi lowk, maru kawmuüa vüi lowk tikah mih uanap naap kown. Naiawng hai aiamat kowh angak hai maru kawmuüa kowh angak mih nalawtta kownkow aia nachang kown. <verse eid="LEV 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 16:25" />Now angak lawt lük müa uanap kowi kowh ap-ah mih tawncher sau dow phuchuara luk kowi aia natikta kown takla.<verse eid="LEV 16:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 16:26" />“Süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh cham lawt rua mih maru dow uang mang hown krowksang nachuta dawnguan hanow nalu kown takla. Nami dowi rawn dow amatni kowh tangbung khup rah kowi naia kup kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 16:27" />Now angak lawt lük müa uanap kowi kowh ap-ah mih chiala vi hai ruala vi mih Lang Chimsai mih towklak kowi kupla khai rakowi nami chiala nga hai ruala nga dow nacham tikta kown takla, now apik hai akih paw natikta kown takla. Naiawngün dow amatni uowi rah tangbung khup rah uat kowi nacham tikah kown. <verse eid="LEV 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 16:28" />Naiawngün cham tik mih maru dow uang plan hown krowksang nachuta dawnguan hanow nalu kown takla. Nami dowi rawn dow amatni kowh tangbung khup rah kowi naia kup kown nadowi.<verse eid="LEV 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chowngchowng saksakma vüi pawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 16:29" />“Now paning kowi pani chi khang pe hawm khükhü chang lup dowi kowi enni nakham ngare kown takla. Naiawng enni nauowi kown mih dow ning towng ranit la kowi kowh lacher hamüt ni khe chekhai. Nami dow chowngchowng saksakma enni vüi ari arow naown kown. Nami rirow dow enni Israeluüa hai enni tut-e kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchap paw nachün ngengche kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 16:30" />Nami ni khe dow enni kowh angak nalawtta enni kownkow angak lawt lük müa uanap enni nachang kown takla. Nahanow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi sürlawkma enni naown kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="LEV 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 16:31" />Nami ni dow enni vüi Tanai Ni chekhai. Nami ni dow khang pe hawm khükhü chang lup dowi kowi enni nakham ngare kown. Nami dow chowngchowng saksakma enni vüi ari arow chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 16:31" /><verse number="32-33" style="v" sid="LEV 16:32-33" />Naiawng mih uanap pawi kowi kowh lup chang mih dow uamow lang kri mih nachang kown takla. Uamow lang kri mih dow naiawng mih lup chang khe adipükchow mih la hown kowh tawnguat nakhupla kown. Lang Chimsai mih Towk lak, taklowp taklangra te, phuchuara, uamowuüa hai Israeluüa maten kowi nachim nasaiah kown. Now pur pra khe dow a-pa kowh uamow lang kri mih rah ta paw mih maru naiawng mih lup nata chang kown takla.<verse eid="LEV 16:32-33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 16:34" />“Israeluüa kowh angak maten nalawtta kownkow naiawng mih angak lawt lük müa pawi mih ning towng pakat chi enni nasun kown takla. Nami dow chowngchowng saksakma enni vüi ari arow chekhai,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 16:34">Now CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng lup maten mih Mosi chang khai bowt.<verse eid="LEV 16:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LEV 17" />
  <para style="s">Vi dow buk nga kowh sing müa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 17:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="LEV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 17:2" />“Mami ang kowh ana pek mih Arawn hai achapauüa hown Israeluüa maten kowi kowtek pe diah. En tek pe kown mih, <verse eid="LEV 17:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="LEV 17:3-4" />‘Chia chepaw, rua chepaw, ruapur chepaw — Israeluüa che ngen kown nau khai hanow taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e CHAKRAMANG kowi ap-ah now nangenah kown takla,’ pape diah. Naiawng chang dowi kowi amatni uowi rah te lak kowi chepaw, te uat kowi chepaw ngen hanow naiawng chang mih maru kowi dow sai maru sak mih aprek natang pe kown. Naiawng chang mih maru kowi dow aiamat chenchap hownia nabatta kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 17:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 17:5" />Israeluüa mih taklowp taklangra te hown alakma kowi cham ngen tawncher dowi bowt kowi CHAKRAMANG tut-e nauang pawla bowt kownkow mami ana ang pe enni mih chekhai. Amatni mih taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e uamowuüa tut-e nauang pawla hanow CHAKRAMANG hown taking tasangra nauowila kownkow taking tasangra uanap iawng nauang ap bowt kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 17:6" />Nami tawncher vi dow taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e kowh phuchuara kowi uamow nakrawi thetah kown takla, now nami tawncher sau kam nam hown dow CHAKRAMANG naawmrawmla kownkow phuchuara kowi natikah kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 17:7" />Kawmat hownia now CHAKRAMANG kaah sakowm dowi iawng uowi hai rua powm iawng mih arup kowi ngen pe tawncher hanow naphuchua büah kown nadowi bowt. Arup kowi phuchua mih dow chang iang mih chekhai. Mami rirow dow chowngchowng saksakma enni nachünah kown takla.<verse eid="LEV 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="LEV 17:8-9" />“CHAKRAMANG vüi tikah mih uanap chepaw, akeng mih uanap chepaw, enni nachang kown now taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e enni uang pawla kown takla. Akeng kowi che cham pawla hanow naiawng chang mih maru kowi dow aiamat chenchap hownia enni nabatta kown takla. Mami rirow dow enni Israeluüa hai enni tut-e kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa vüi katsang naown kown.<verse eid="LEV 17:8-9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 17:10" />“Enni Israeluüa lah, enni tut-e kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchap lah cha vi mih maru che uowi khai hanow nami maru kowi ang namüah kown nadowi, now aia kowi dow aiamat chenchap hownia ang nabatta kown. <verse eid="LEV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 17:11" />Buk nga kowh sing müa dow vi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi enni vüi angak lawt lük müa nachangla kownkow vi dow phuchuara kowi ang pe khük enni mih chekhai. Vi dow sing müa chekhai rakowi angak kowi ia sia sau chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 17:12" />Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa lah, Israeluüa tut-e kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa lah enni naiung cha vi kown nadowi.<verse eid="LEV 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 17:13" />“Israeluüa lah, Israeluüa tut-e kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa lah iung chaah mih asadua chap nachaah kownkow enni uang pawla chepaw enni nangenah kown takla, now avi dow enni nachüngta bowk hanow bawn hown enni naphumah kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 17:14" />Asak uowi mih chap maten sing mih dow vi hown chekhai. Naiawng rakowi nacha vi dowi kown mih hai cha vi mih maru kowi aiamat chenchap hownia nabatta kown mih Israeluüa kowi ang tek pe mih chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="LEV 17:15-16" />“Aiawnglowma kowng mih chepaw, kaurawng uaramchak makah kowh kowng mih chepaw, asadua kowng nga dow enni naiung cha kown nadowi. Cha mih maru dow nachuta tawnguat hanow nalu kown takla, now aia mih sat kup dowi mowr asür alawkma nauowi kown. Nami kung kowi dow aia mih sürlawkma naown kown nadowi bowt. Nachenganchepaw aia che chuta tawnguat dowi hai lu dowi hanow aia kowh angak sung mih aia naka ripra kown. Nami rirow dow enni Israeluüa hai enni tut-e kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa vüi katsang naown kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 17:15-16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LEV 18" />
  <para style="s">Taphua taiua lawnguan kowi kowh rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="LEV 18:1-2" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Israeluüa kowi kowtek pe diah: Ang dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 18:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 18:3" />Naiawng rakowi enni uowila akat mih Aigupta pren kowi kowh maru-uüa chang iawng enni nachang kown nadowi, now ang napawla enni kown mih Kanan pren kowi kowh maru-uüa chang iawng paw enni nachang kown nadowi. Naiawngün maru-uüa kowh chowm krang uowi krang iawng enni nauowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 18:4" />Enni dow ang kowh ari aiang iawng chowtaih nauowi kown; ang pe enni mih ari arow chowtaih enni nachünah kaneu kown. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 18:5" />Ang kowh ari arow hai ari aiang chün mih dow naka singra kown. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 18:6" />“Kowmatia hown pabuk panga chak miuüa hown enni nataphua taiua kown nadowi. Mami dow ang kowh ana pek chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 18:7" />“Enni pungmadawng kowi amia iawng mih paw kowmatia u hown nataphua taiua kown nadowi. Kowmatia u hown taphua taiua mih dow kowmatia pa kowi peah rukrai mih chekhai. Kowmatia u hown dow nataphua taiua kown nadowi.<verse eid="LEV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 18:8" />“U-uai hown paw enni nataphua taiua kown nadowi. U-uai hown taphua taiua mih paw kowmatia pa kowi peah rukrai mih chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 18:9" />“Kowmatia tuamow sin hai tuamow tawng mih hown paw enni nataphua taiua kown nadowi. Pa-uai kowh chama chepaw, u-uai kowh chama chepaw, pakimsang dia mih chepaw, kim langma dia mih chepaw — tuamow hown dow enni nataphua taiua kown nadowi.<verse eid="LEV 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 18:10" />“Kowmatia chu-uüa hown paw enni nataphua taiua kown nadowi. Kowmatia chapa kowh chama chepaw, kowmatia chama kowh chama chepaw — kowmatia chu hown taphua taiua mih dow kowmatia kowi tape rukrai mih chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 18:11" />“U-uai kowh chama paw tuamow tawng chekhai rakowi u-uai kowh chama hown paw enni nataphua taiua kown nadowi.<verse eid="LEV 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 18:12" />“Kowmatia nawkaw hown paw enni nataphua taiua kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nawkaw dow kowmatia pa hown pabuk panga chak chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 18:13" />“Urammow hai pama hown paw enni nataphua taiua kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow urammow hai pama dow kowmatia u hown pabuk panga chak chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 18:14" />“Kowmatia pahi pama masi hown paw enni nataphua taiua kown nadowi. Kowbüah dow kowmatia pama hai urammow chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 18:15" />“Kowmatia iaumow hown paw enni nataphua taiua kown nadowi. Aia dow kowmatia chapa kowh masi chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 18:16" />Kowmatia taimow masi hown chepaw, kowmatia naumow masi hown chepaw enni naia taphua taiua kown nadowi. Kowbüah hown taphua taiua mih dow kowmatia taimow hai kowmatia naumow kowi peah rukrai mih chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 18:17" />“Kowmatia phuaah iuaah khowk mih masiuüa kowh chama hown chepaw, achu — chama kowh chama, chapa kowh chama — hown chepaw enni nataphua taiua kown nadowi. Kowbüah dow en phua iuaah khowk mih masiuüa hown pabuk panga chak chekhai. Naiawngünuüa hown taphua taiua mih dow suiiai kaniaima mih lup chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 18:18" />“Kowmatia masi sing uowi reng tak khe kowmatia masi naumow hown enni natachawng kown nadowi.<verse eid="LEV 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 18:19" />“Now uisawng uowi khe kowh asür alawkma mih khin khe tawng iawng mih masiuüa hown paw enni nataphua taiua kown nadowi.<verse eid="LEV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 18:20" />“Maru masi hown paw hang cham taphua taiua büa diah. Maru masi hown cham taphua taiua mih dow enni matia kowi enni sürlawkah mih chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 18:21" />“Now Molek pami arup kowi naphuchuala kownkow enni kowh chauüa kowi maih kowi enni naia nawmah kown nadowi. Naiawng enni chang mih dow ang kowh ming chimsaima mih enni piak ang mih chekhai. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 18:22" />“Masiuüa hown taphua taiua khe kowh iawng kachakuüa lala enni nataphua taiua kown nadowi. Kachakuüa lala taphua taiua mih dow suiiai kaniaima mih lup chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 18:23" />“Masiuüa chepaw, kachakuüa chepaw — tawncher hown taphua taiua hanow enni naia tasür talawk kown nadowi. Tawncher hown taphua taiua mih dow suiiai kaniaima mih lup chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24-25" style="v" sid="LEV 18:24-25" />“Enni pur kowi kowh ang naprütah kown mih prenchakuüa dow naiawng mih lup ngak chap maten chang hai kowmatia kowi sürlawkah büah khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowh pren khowm padow tasür talawk khai bowt. Amatni kowi ang ripah mih hai amatni kowi pren nuata mih dow naiawng chang ngak büah rakowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi enni dow naiawng mih lup ngak chang hai kowmatia kowi enni nasürlawkah kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 18:24-25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 18:26" />Enni dow ang kowh ari arow hai ang kowh ari aiang nachün kown takla. Enni matia hai enni tut-e kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa dow naiawng mih suiiai kaniaima mih lup nachang kown nadowi.<verse eid="LEV 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 18:27" />“Enni kowuowiah kown mih pren kowi kowh hawt iawng uowi miuüa dow naiawng mih lup ngak maten chang rakowi amatni kowh pren sürlawkta nak khai. <verse eid="LEV 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 18:28" />Enni paw naiawng che pren kowi sürlawkah khai hanow hawt rik uowi mih chenchapuüa kowi iawng dow enni kowi paw pren nahükta enni kown.<verse eid="LEV 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 18:29" />“Naiawng suiiai kaniaima mih lup chang mih maru kowi dow aiamat chenchap hownia nabatta kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 18:30" />Enni nakowuowiah kown mih pren kowi enni kowting khe nakowi kowh hawt rik uowi mih chenchapuüa kowh suiiai kaniaima mih uowi krang enni natawi iua kown nadowi. Naiawng mih lup ngak chap maten hown enni matia kowi enni nasür nalawkah kown nadowi. Enni dow ang kowh ana pek enni nachün kown takla. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LEV 19" />
  <para style="s1">Akeng mih rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="LEV 19:1-2" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Mami laiklow Israeluüa maten kowi kowtek pe diah: Ang dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai chekhai. Ang dow chimsaima rakowi enni paw chimsaima nauowi kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 19:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 19:3" />Enni kowh u-pa kowi enni naring nakawah kown takla. Ang kowh Tanai Ni mih enni nasunah reng kown takla. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 19:4" />Ang kowi towta now akeng thuraiuüa kowi enni nachup kown nadowi. Enni nachupah kownkow <char style="w">arup aren</char> paw enni nathawp kown nadowi. Ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai.<verse eid="LEV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 19:5" />“CHAKRAMANG hown taking tasangra nauowila kownkow taking tasangra uanap enni ap khe CHAKRAMANG nasak-ihla kownkow ari kowi uowi iawng enni naap-ah kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 19:5" /><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="LEV 19:6-7" />Enni ap-ah mih ngar dow enni ap-ah mih ni hai auai ni mowr kowi enni nachata bowk kown takla. Nami chaknga che sum ni mowr ta lat khai tak hanow nami dow asür alawkma khowk chekhai. Naiawng rakowi nami ta lat mih dow enni natikta bowk kown takla. Sum ni mowr nami chaknga cha rengreng hanow nami uanap dow CHAKRAMANG napaw enni kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="LEV 19:6-7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 19:8" />Sum ni mowr cha rengreng mih maru dow ang kowh uanh chimsaima mih kowi sürlawk mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi nami maru dow aia kowh angak rakowi naka aprek kown. Aia kowi dow aiamat chenchap hownia nabatta kown takla.<verse eid="LEV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 19:9" />“Üa kowi hai laih kowi enni kua luprak khe aria aret kowi kowh luprak dow enni nakuala kown nadowi, now ta dowh mih paw enni nakrawi plan lüm kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="LEV 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 19:10" />Grep krum hownia ki klekta grep uih akat khowk hanow enni nakrawi ia plan klek iawk kown nadowk, now grep uih dowh mih paw enni nakrawi lümla kown nadowi. Naiawngün dow ngarai miuüa hai akeng chenchapuüa vüi enni nata towla kown takla. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 19:11" />“Enni naia ku kown nadowi, now amia kowi paw enni naia kuan kown nadowi. Enni naia tek dai lai kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 19:12" />Ang ming hown enni naia kham dai lai sawi kown nadowi. Ang ming hown kham dai lai sawi mih dow ang kowh ming chimsaima mih piak mih chekhai. Ang dow enni kowh CHAKRAMANG chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 19:13" />“Kowmatia klowkchakuüa kowi enni naia kuan kown nadowi, kowmatia klowkchakuüa kowh uanh paw kür hown enni napaw kown nadowi. Sukkri kha dow ngaah mih ni khe napeta kown takla; auai rau mowr natowah kown nadowi.<verse eid="LEV 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 19:14" />“Param pangma miuüa kowi enni nape <char style="w">piati</char> kown nadowi, now mik duma miuüa kowi paw nape tatheuah kownkow tiama kowi tawng chap paw enni natow pe kown nadowi; CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi ringkawma hown enni nakramah kown takla. Ang dow enni kowh CHAKRAMANG chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 19:15" />“Tara nowm nadowi iawng enni nachet tara kown nadowi. Tara chetra kowi maru iuk maru sowm enni namüah kown nadowi; aiuk asowm bowkbowk kowi anowmma enni nachet pe tara kown. <verse eid="LEV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 19:16" />Mia iawng mih lawnguan kowi paw enni nakrawi küa dai kown nadowi. Maru kowh chownglawng napiakla dowi kownkow enni nathuak saksi kown takla; rarimma enni nauowi kown nadowi. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 19:17" />“Maru kowi suiah mih saktuak sak kowi enni natow kown nadowi. Maru kowh lup tawi mih aprek enni natawi kala dowi kownkow lup tawi mih enni natüng pe ngengche kown takla.<verse eid="LEV 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 19:18" />“Enni natapaw lu klai kown nadowi. Mia iawng mih hown paw enni natatow irsi kown nadowi. Maru maten kowi kowmatia tasakrau iawng enni nasakrauah kown takla. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 19:19" />“Ang kowh rirow enni nachün kown takla. Pachapsang nadowi mih tawncher kowi enni nape tapawah hau kown nadowi. Lowkchow mih laih kowi aliu pre chap enni nasawt kown nadowi. Pre chap mih la hown kowh kawngah mih uan paw enni nakhup kown nadowi.<verse eid="LEV 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 19:20" />“Ahua kham uowi mih narma, kim iah lawtah dowi tak mih, now klan paw klanah dowi tak mih narma hown miapaw naia taphua taiua kown nadowi. Taphua taiua khai chepaw nami narma kowi hai aia kowi kowh phua iuaah mih kachakuüa kowi enni naia kowngta kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami narma kowi mih klanah dowi tak chekhai. Nachenganchepaw nami kachakuüa mih narma kowh kim iah kowi napeah aiawk kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 19:21" />Nami klen kowi aia kowh aprek sung uanap CHAKRAMANG vüi aia nachang kown. Aia dow taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e nauang pawla ruapurla papum kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 19:22" />Nami ruapurla hown CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nami kachakuüa kowh aprek sung uanap uamow nachang pe kown. Nahanow nami kachakuüa kowh angak mih nalawtta pe kown towbowt.<verse eid="LEV 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 19:23" />“Enni nakowuowiah kown mih Kanan pren kowi enni kowting kung kowi uih-ien pantawn singh enni nakowchowk kown. Nachenganchepaw uown uih mih ning hownia sum ning mowr mih uih-ak dow asür alawkma chowreng tak pahai enni nadowkah kown takla. Nami sum ning mowr dow naiawngün uih enni nacha kown nadowi tak. <verse eid="LEV 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 19:24" />Now tali ning mih ning khe dow naiawngün singh kowi kowh uih maten CHAKRAMANG rowsi müa kowi CHAKRAMANG vüi enni naap-ah kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 19:25" />Nachenganchepaw tanga ning mih ning hownia dow nami singh uih enni naiung cha kown towbowt. Naiawng che enni chang hanow enni kowh uih-ien pantawn ahuma nauih kown. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 19:26" />“Tawng iawng mih chaknga paw hawkta pe avi dowi matchang enni nacha kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:26">“Hawra mük hai mantan paw enni natawngkeng kown nadowi.<verse eid="LEV 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27-28" style="v" sid="LEV 19:27-28" />“Kowng miuüa vüi <char style="w">uowila uiting uangtak</char> khe ngeupa sam enni naia kep kown nadowi, now mawmpawi paw enni naia khai kown nadowi. Nami klen kowi enni matia buk kowi enni natata tangen kown nadowi. Now tawng iawng mih arup paw buk kowi enni nasawt kown nadowi. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 19:27-28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 19:29" />“Kowmatia chama kowi enni nape changah <char style="w">chawkkrawma</char> lup kown nadowi. Naiawng chang mih dow kowmatia chama kowi peah rukrai mih chekhai. Naiawng che enni chang hanow pren kowi chawkkrawma naprung kown, now angak paw naprung kown chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 19:30" />“Ang kowh Tanai Ni kowi enni nakhangah reng kown takla, now ang kowh taklowp taklangra te kowi paw enni naring nakawah reng kown takla. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 19:31" />“Enni nacham paw <char style="w">prengia</char> kownkow süngnam hai lümla ngak hown taklawp taiua mih maru tut-e enni nakowkowi kown nadowi. Naiawng mih maru tut-e cham kowi hanow enni natasür talawk kown chekhai. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 19:32" />“Enni pur kowi lawngtang matanguüa uang khe enni nahawt iowng kown. Naiawng hai lawngtang matanguüa kowi enni naring nakawah kown takla. Enni kowh Thurai kowi ringkawma hown enni nakramah kown. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 19:33" />“Enni pren kowi kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa kowi enni nachang nowng kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 19:34" />Prenlang maru-uüa kowi paw kowmatia chenchapuüa kowi iawng enni namüla kown. Prenlang maru-uüa kowi paw kowmatia tasakrau iawng enni nasakrauah kown takla. Aigupta prenchakuüa tut-e enni paw prenlang maru iawng hai enni uowila akat mih enni natuakla reng kown takla. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 19:35" />“Chet tara mih khin khe achi anawmma enni nachetah kown. Chang kun khe paw atown aklang khai müa hown khai uanh khe lah, adik ahowp khai müa hown khai uanh khe lah achima enni nakhaiah kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 19:36" />Enni kowh set hai akeng mih uanh khai müa ün athikma enni nachangah kown. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai chekhai. Aigupta pren hownia kowh uang lawtla enni mih dow ang chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 19:37" />Ang kowh ari arow maten hai ang kowh ari aiang maten enni nachünah kaneu kown takla. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 19:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LEV 20" />
  <para style="s">Phuchua chah miuüa kowh ripra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="LEV 20:1-2" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Israeluüa kowi maiawng kowtek pe diah: Enni Israeluüa lah, enni pungmadawng kowi kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa lah amia iawng mih paw Molek pami arup kowi kowmatia kowh chauüa hown enni naphuchua kown nadowi. Phuchua mih maru kowi dow enni nakowngta kown takla. Aia kowi dow maru maten huaklu hown kowng pat nakuakah kown. <verse eid="LEV 20:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 20:3" />Molek pami arup kowi kowmatia chah hown phuchua mih maru dow ang kowh ming chimsaima mih hai ang kowh arah chimsaima mih sürlawk ang mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi nami maru kowi dow ang nakingküaah kown, now aia kowi dow aiamat chenchap hownia ang nabatta kown. <verse eid="LEV 20:3" /><verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="LEV 20:4-5" />Molek pami arup kowi maru kowphuchua chah mih khin khe prenchakuüa khi khowk chepaw khi dowi iawng uowi khai, now kowng paw kowngta dowi hanow nami maru hai aia kimchakuüa kowi dow ang nakingküaah kown. Akeng mih maru-uüa paw kaah sakowm dowi iawng Molek pami arup kowi tawi phuchua khai hanow naiawngünuüa kowi paw Israel chenchap hownia ang nabatta kown.<verse eid="LEV 20:4-5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 20:6" />“Ang kaah sakowm dowi iawng süngnam hai lümla ngak hown taklawp taiua mih maru tut-e cham paw prengia mih maru kowi dow ang nakingküaah kown, now aia kowi dow aiamat chenchap hownia ang nabatta kown. <verse eid="LEV 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 20:7" />Naiawng rakowi ang vüi kowi lang takra büah hanow chimsaima uowiah büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 20:8" />Ang kowh rirow mih sak kowi towah büa diah, now nami dow chünah büa diah. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai; ang vüi kowi kowh chimsai enni mih dow ang chowtaih.<verse eid="LEV 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 20:9" />“U-pa kowi pe piati mih maru kowi dow nakowngta ngengche kown takla. U-pa kowi pe piati rakowi aia kowng mih dow aiamat rakowi chowtaih.<verse eid="LEV 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taphua taiua mih angak ripra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 20:10" />“Masi uowi mih maru che akeng mih maru kowh masi hown chang iang khai hanow amatchi pre ia trui kowi nakowngta ngengche kown takla.<verse eid="LEV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 20:11" />“U-uai hown taphua taiua mih maru dow a-pa kowi pe rukrai mih chekhai. Naiawng chang mih maru che uowi khai hanow nami maru hai a-u uai kowi dow nakowngta ngengche kown takla. Amatchi kowng mih dow amatchi rakowi chowtaih.<verse eid="LEV 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 20:12" />“Iaumow hown taphua taiua mih maru che uowi khai hanow nami maru hai aiaumow kowi dow nakowngta kown takla. Naiawng amatchi chang mih dow suiiai kaniaima mih lup chekhai. Amatchi kowng mih dow amatchi rakowi chowtaih.<verse eid="LEV 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 20:13" />“Masiuüa hown taphua taiua khe kowh iawng kachakuüa lala taphua taiua mih dow suiiai kaniaima mih lup chekhai. Naiawng chang mih kachakuüa kowi dow pre ia trui kowi nakowngta ngengche kown takla. Amatchi kowng mih dow amatchi rakowi chowtaih.<verse eid="LEV 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 20:14" />“Achama hailawm a-u kowi chawng mih dow suiiai kaniaima mih lup chekhai. Naiawng rakowi naiawng mih lup enni pungmadawng kowi naphawla dowi bowt kownkow naiawng chang miuüa kowi dow amatni sum ia trui kowi maih kowi nanawmah kown takla.<verse eid="LEV 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="LEV 20:15-16" />“Masiuüa chepaw, kachakuüa chepaw tawncher hown taphua taiua mih che uowi khai hanow tawncher hailawm nami maru kowi nakowngta ngengche kown takla. Amatni kowng mih dow amatni rakowi chowtaih.<verse eid="LEV 20:15-16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 20:17" />“Apa uai kowh chama hown chepaw, a-u uai kowh chama hown chepaw, tuamow sin hown chepaw natachawng kown nadowi; tuamow hown taphua taiua mih dow uowiah parukrai mih lup chekhai. Naiawng mih maru kowi dow amatni chenchapuüa pur hownia nalawtta kown takla. Naiawng atuamow kowi peah rukrai khai rakowi aia dow naka ripra kown.<verse eid="LEV 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 20:18" />“Uisawng uowi khe kowh taphua taiua mih maru kowi dow amatchi pre ia trui kowi chenchap hownia nabatta kown takla. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatchi dow uisawng uowi khe kowh tachim tasai rirow chün iüah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 20:19" />“Nawkaw hown lah, pama hown lah mia iawng mih hown paw enni naia taphua taiua kown nadowi. Naiawng che taphua taiua khai hanow tasin taken mih masiuüa kowi enni peah rukrai mih chekhai. Naiawng chang mih rakowi amatchi dow naka ripra kown.<verse eid="LEV 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 20:20" />“Urammow hown chepaw, pama hown chepaw taphua taiua khai hanow nami dow pahi hai pama kowi peah rukrai mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi nami kachakuüa hai masiuüa dow amatchi kowh aprek amatchi nakur kown. Amatchi dow kala chah dowi kowi nakowng kown<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Amatchi dow kala chah dowi kowi nakowng kown </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow Amatchi kowh chah mih amatchi kowh krungchak pahai maru nadowk pe kown nadowi; amatchi dow kala krungchak dowi kowi nakowng kown pami chekhai.</char></note>.<verse eid="LEV 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 20:21" />“Atainau sing uowi reng tak khe atainau kowh masi kowi chawngta pe mih dow suiiai kaniaima mih lup chekhai. Naiawng chang mih maru dow atainau kowi peah rukrai mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatchi dow kala chah dowi kowi nakowng kown.<verse eid="LEV 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 20:22" />“Ang kowh ana pek hai ang kowh rirow maten chünah büa diah. Nami che enni chün khai hanow enni nakowuowiah kownkow ang nakowpawla enni kown mih pren mih nahükta enni kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 20:23" />Enni nakowuowiah kown mih prenchakuüa kowh chowm krang uowi krang enni natawi iua kown nadowi. Naiawngün maru-uüa kowh chowm krang uowi krang dow suiiai kaniaima rakowi lainowmma ang suiah chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 20:24" />Naiawngün maru-uüa uowiah mih pren dow ang nape powng enni kown padow ang kham enni khai. Nakowi dow iawn tui, kuai tui hai tawng chap paw akhawr uowi dowi. Nami pren dow dawngthawnguan iawng hai ang nape enni kown mih ang tek enni khai. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai chekhai. Akeng chenchap hownia kowh lang klo enni mih dow ang chowtaih. <verse eid="LEV 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 20:25" />Naiawng rakowi tawncher hai uakling uaber pungmadawng kowi kowh tawng mih chow sürlawkma mih, sürlawk dowi mih enni nalang kraah kown takla. Tawncher lah, uakling uaber lah, krawng luk kowi kam hai sowr mih chili chalachow mih asadua chap lah asürlawk mih chap maten dow ang lang krata enni khowk. Naiawngün chakra hownia dow enni natasür talawk kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 20:26" />Ang CHAKRAMANG achimsaima rakowi enni paw achimsaima nauowi kown takla. Ang matia kowh maru nachangla enni kownkow akeng chenchap hownia ang lang klo enni mih chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 20:27" />“Kachakuüa lah, masiuüa lah süngnam hai lümla ngak hown taklawp taiua mih maru maten kowi dow nakowngta kown takla. Naiawngünuüa kowi dow huaklu hown kowng pat nakuakah kown. Amatni kowng mih aprek dow amatni nakur kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 20:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LEV 21" />
  <para style="s">Uamow vüi kowi kowh rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 21:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Mami laiklow uamowuüa kowi kowtek pe diah: Amatni tasin taken miuüa kowng uak tawi kakra hownia amatni mih naia tasür talawk kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 21:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="LEV 21:2-3" />Nachenganchepaw amatni kowh u-pa, chauüa, tainau-uüa hai cham mang dowi tak mih tuamowuüa kowng rakowi dow naia tasür talawk büah kown taih. <verse eid="LEV 21:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 21:4" />Tawkche kowmatia masi kowh tasin taken miuüa kowng rakowi dow natawi ia tasür talawk büah kown nadowi.<verse eid="LEV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 21:5" />“Natüngla uiting uangtak kownkow uamowuüa dow sam hai mawmpawi nakhai kown nadowi, now buk kowi paw nata nasawt büah kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 21:6" />Uamowuüa dow Thurai vüi kowi chimsaima nauowi ngengche kown takla. Amatni dow Thurai ming chimsaima mih naia piak kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow CHAKRAMANG vüi chakkham uanap chang mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow CHAKRAMANG vüi chimsaima nauowi kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 21:7" />Amatni dow chawkkrawma kowi chepaw, ming nang piak mih masiuüa kowi chepaw, now ahua khuata mih masiuüa kowi chepaw nachawng büah kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow amatni kowh CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi chimsaiah mih maru chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 21:8" />Aw Israeluüa, uamowuüa kowi dow Thurai vüi kowi kowh chimsaiah mih maru iawng enni namüah kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow enni kowh Thurai vüi ap enni chakkham reng mih chekhai. Amatni kowi dow chimsaima mih maru pahai enni namüah kown takla. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang CHAKRAMANG dow chimsaima chekhai, now enni kowi paw ang matia vüi ang lang kra enni khai. <verse eid="LEV 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 21:9" />Uamowuüa kowh chama che chang chawkkrawma lup kowh tasür talawk khai hanow aia dow a-pa kowi peah rukrai mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi nami masiuüa kowi dow maih kowi nanawmah kown takla.<verse eid="LEV 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uamow lang kri mih vüi kowi kowh rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 21:10" />“Uamow lang kri mih dow uowila uiting uangtak khe naiia sam kown nadowi, now khupdip tawngklai paw naia sek kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowi dow nümnap müa sau phawk pe hanow uamowuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh lang kri mih arah peah mih chekhai. Aia dow uamow lang kri mih kowh tawnguat nakhup kown mih alow ka mih maru chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 21:11" />Aia dow uak uowi rah re-e cham ia kowi kown nadowi. Kowmatia u-pa uak khowm padow tawi kakra hownia aia mih naia tasür talawk kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 21:12" />Aia dow Taklowp taklangra te chimsaima mih hownia cham lawt hanow uak uowi rah kowi nacham ia kowi kown nadowi. Aia che cham lawt hanow Taklowp taklangra te chimsaima mih aia nasürlawkta chepaw naia. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowi dow phawk pe nümnap müa sau hanow ang matia vüi ang lang kraah mih chekhai. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 21:13" />Aia dow kachakuüa hown katpaw taphua taiua dowi tak mih malauüa kowi chowtaih naia chawng kown. <verse eid="LEV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 21:14" />Aia dow mamaimow kowi chepaw, ahua khuata mih masiuüa kowi chepaw, chang chawkkrawma lup kowh tasür talawk mih masiuüa kowi chepaw nachawng kown nadowi. Aia dow amatni Levi chenchap kowi kowh katpaw taphua taiua dowi tak mih malauüa kowi chowtaih nachawng kown. <verse eid="LEV 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 21:15" />Naiawng nadowi now aia kowh chauüa natasür talawk kown chekhai. Uamow lang kri mih kowi dow ang matia vüi ang lang kraah mih chekhai. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uaingselepama mih Leviuüa kowh rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 21:16" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="LEV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 21:17" />“Arawn kowi maiawng kowtek pe diah: En krungchakuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh <char style="w">uaingselepama</char> mih maten dow Thurai vüi naap chakkham kownkow phuchuara re-e nauang ia uang kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 21:17" /><verse number="18-20" style="v" sid="LEV 21:18-20" />Uaingselepama mih maru dow naia chang uamow lup kown nadowi. Naiawngünuüa dow Mik duma mih, klowng khawn tabai mih, nakawng pema mih, rut khawk iuk sowmma mih, bawng pang klowkma mih, kawm kuima mih, atüalüa chow mih, mik piakma mih, pik rawka uowi mih, prak rawka uowi mih hai tualama mih ün chekhai. Naiawngün uaingselepama miuüa dow phuchuara re-e naia uang kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 21:18-20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 21:21" />Arawn kowh krungchakuüa pungmadawng kowi uaingselepama mih maru dow CHAKRAMANG vüi chakkham uanap naia chang kown nadowi. Naiawngün maru dow uaingselepama rakowi CHAKRAMANG vüi phuchuara kowi nauang ia ap chakkham kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 21:22" />Nachenganchepaw Thurai vüi kowi kowh phuchuaah mih chimsaima mih hai lang chim lang sai mih chakkham maten dow naiawng mih maru-uüa paw natawi ia cha kown taih. <verse eid="LEV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 21:23" />Tawkchedow naiawngün maru-uüa mih uaingselepama chekhai rakowi chimsaima mih arah kowi hai phuchuara kowi naia uang kown nadowi. Naiawng che chang hanow ang kowh arah chimsaima mih nasürlawkta kown chekhai. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai. Uamowuüa kowi dow ang matia vüi ang lang kraah mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 21:24" />Naiawngün laiklow dow Arawn hai achapauüa hown Israeluüa maten kowi Mosi kowkowiah now kowtek pe khai bowt.<verse eid="LEV 21:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LEV 22" />
  <para style="ms">Uanap chimsai rirow</para>
  <para style="s">Uamowuüa tachim tasai rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 22:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="LEV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 22:2" />“Arawn hai achapauüa kowi mami laiklow kowtek pe diah: Ang vüi kowi kowh Israeluüa uang ap-ah mih chimsaima mih uanh srui naring nakawah büah kown takla. Nadowi now ang kowh ming chimsaima mih napiakta ang büah kown chekhai. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 22:3" />Asürlawkma uowi khe ang vüi kowi kowh ap-ah mih chimsaima mih uanh re-e Arawn krungchakuüa pungmadawng hownia miapaw hang pacham uang lah; uang mih dow uamow lup naia chang kown nadowi bowt. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 22:3" /><verse number="4-6" style="v" sid="LEV 22:4-6" />Kow kowi pik rawka ngak uowi chepaw, khampha uanh tui towk chepaw Arawn krungchakuüa dow natasür talawk kown. Nami klen kowi cham kak uak mih maru kowi kakta chepaw, khampha uanh tui towk mih maru kowi kakta chepaw, asürlawkma mih chili chalachow mih asadua kowi kakta chepaw, asürlawkma mih maru kowi kakta chepaw — asür alawkma mih chap maten kakta khai hanow amatni dow natasür talawk kown. Naiawngün hownia kowh tasür talawk mih maru dow nalu tui kown takla, now sat kup dowi mowr asür alawkma nauowi kown. Chimsai dowi mowr dow CHAKRAMANG vüi ap-ah mih chimsaima mih uanh naiung cha büah kown nadowi tak. <verse eid="LEV 22:4-6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 22:7" />Now sat kup kung kowi chimsai khowk khe dow nami chakkham naiung cha büah bowt kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami dow amatni kowh chakbak chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 22:8" />Tawncher kowng nga ün, kaurawng uaramchak makta mih asadua nga ün nacha büah kown nadowi. Amatni che cha hanow natasür talawk büah kown. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 22:9" />“Uamowuüa kowi kowh ang peah mih ana maten dow nachün büah kown takla. Nadowi now amatni luk kowi aprek nauowi kown, now chün lai dowi mih rakowi amatni dow nakowng kown chekhai. Ang matia vüi amatni kowi lang kraah mih dow ang CHAKRAMANG chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iawngpa mih maru-uüa kowh rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 22:10" />“Uamow kimchak klen kowi dow ap-ah mih chakkham chimsaima mih miapaw naiung cha kown nadowi. Uamowuüa kowh pinsüa hai sukkri kowi miuüa paw nami chakkham dow natawi ia cha kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 22:11" />Nachenganchepaw uamow hawt ranah mih nar hai uamow kim kowi kowh uang dia mih naruüa dow nami chakkham natawi ia cha kown taih. <verse eid="LEV 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 22:12" />Uamowuüa kowh chama che uamow chenchap nadowi kowi akeng chenchap tut-e cham mang khai hanow nami masiuüa dow ap-ah mih chakkham chimsaima mih natawi ia cha kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="LEV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 22:13" />Nachenganchepaw uamowuüa kowh chamauüa pungmadawng kowi mamaimow hai ahua khuata mih dow kala chah dowi kowi a-pa kim kowi uang plan uowi khai hanow nami chakkham natawi ia cha kown taih. Tawkche uamow kimchak nadowi mih dow miapaw nami chakkham natawi ia cha kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 22:14" />Ap-ah mih chakkham chimsaima mih tawita mata kowh chata khai hanow chata mih maru dow uamow kowi napeah aiawk kown takla. Aia chata khowk mih uanh sung kowi changah tanga bak kowi pabak sung nachüt pela kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 22:14" /><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="LEV 22:15-16" />CHAKRAMANG vüi Israeluüa uang ap-ah mih uanh srui dow chimsaima chekhai. Naiawng rakowi naiawngün uanh dow iawngpa mih maru-uüa kowi uamowuüa naia pe chaah kown nadowi. Pe chaah khai hanow nami uanap dow natasürlawk kown chekhai, now cha mih maru dow naka ripra kown. Naiawngün uanap dow ang CHAKRAMANG chimsaiah mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 22:15-16" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG awmrawmah dowi mih uanap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 22:17" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="LEV 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 22:18" />“Arawn hai achapauüa hown Israeluüa maten kowi mami laiklow kowtek pe diah: Mami rirow dow enni Israeluüa hai enni tut-e kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa vüi katsang chekhai. Takhamta mih rakowi chepaw, kowmatia sak nau hown kowh chepaw CHAKRAMANG vüi tikah mih uanap che enni uang ap kown nau khai hanow <verse eid="LEV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 22:19" />chiala chepaw, ruapur chepaw, rua chepaw aser auowk uowi dowi mih nauang pawla kown takla. Naiawng nadowi now nami uanap dow CHAKRAMANG napaw enni kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 22:20" />Aser auowk uowi mih tawncher dow hauang ap büa diah. Naiawng mih tawncher dow enni uang ap chepaw CHAKRAMANG nahawt awmrawm enni kown nadowi.<verse eid="LEV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 22:21" />“Takhamta mih rakowi chepaw, kowmatia sak nau hown kowh chang mih chepaw CHAKRAMANG hown taking tasangra nauowila kownkow taking tasangra uanap che enni uang ap kown nau khai hanow chiala chepaw, ruala chepaw, ruapurla chepaw aser auowk uowi dowi mih nauang pawla kown takla. Aser auowk uowi khai hanow nami uanap dow CHAKRAMANG nahawt awmrawm enni kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 22:22" />Tawncher kowi kowh mik duma mih chepaw, hut klowkma mih chepaw, buk kowi ama uowi mih chepaw, rak barlar mih rawka uowi mih chepaw, prak uowi mih chepaw CHAKRAMANG kowi naphuchuala kownkow enni nauang ia pawla kown nadowi. Naiawng mih tawncher dow tawng mih paw phuchuara luk kowi enni naia tang kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 22:23" />Nachenganchepaw enni sak nau hown kowh uanap kowi dow klowng towmma mih chiala hai ruapur chepaw enni naia ap kown taih. Tawkchedow takhamta mih rakowi enni ap kown hanow naiawng mih tawncher enni naia ap kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 22:24" />Tawncher kowi kowh kletah mih chepaw, hangdui plima chepaw, hangdui tuama chepaw, hangdui piakma chepaw CHAKRAMANG vüi enni naia ap kown nadowi. Enni kowuowiah kown mih pren kowi enni kowting khe paw naiawng mih tawncher dow enni naia ap kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 22:25" />Akeng chenchap hownia kowh enni pawah mih paw naiawng mih tawncher dow CHAKRAMANG vüi ap-ah mih chakkham iawng hai enni naia tawngah kown nadowi. Naiawngün kowi dow aser auowk uowi rakowi CHAKRAMANG naawmrawm kown nadowi,” pape khai.<verse eid="LEV 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 22:26" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="LEV 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 22:27" />“Chia chepaw, ruapur chepaw, rua chepaw — uang pen kung kowi ranit ni mowr mih a-u hown katsang enni natowah kown takla. Raiat ni mih ni hownia now naiawngün mih phuchua müa kowi naia tawngah kown. <verse eid="LEV 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 22:28" />Chia chepaw, ruapur chepaw a-u achah pani sang enni nangen kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 22:29" />CHAKRAMANG kowi tekla awmrawm lai kown mih uanap che enni ap kown nau khai hanow CHAKRAMANG napaw enni kownkow ari kowi uowi iawng enni naap-ah kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 22:30" />Enni phuchuala Thurai mih ngar dow enni ap-ah mih ni khe enni nachata bowk kown takla; auai rau mowr tawngpaw enni natowah kown nadowi. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 22:31" />“Ang kowh ana pek enni nachün kown takla, now nami iawng enni namang kown takla. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 22:32" />Ang kowh ming chimsaima mih enni naia piak kown nadowi. Ang dow chimsaima pami enni nachünah kown takla. Ang CHAKRAMANG ang matia vüi ang lang kra enni mih chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 22:33" />Enni kowh Thurai nachowng kownkow Aigupta pren hownia ang uang lawtla enni mih chekhai. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 22:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LEV 23" />
  <para style="ms">Israeluüa kowh kawngmu pawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="LEV 23:1-2" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Israeluüa kowi maiawng kowtek pe diah: Enni nasunah kownkow tawngpawi ngai chow uowi kown mih ang khowm bowkta enni khowk. Naiawngün pawi maten kowi nauang takua kownkow arasang enni nauang kown.<verse eid="LEV 23:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tanai ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 23:3" />“Pasapta kowi taruk ni mowr dow enni naia chang lup kown. Tawkche ranit ni mih ni dow Tanai Ni chekhai. Nami Tanai Ni kowi dow arasang enni natakua kown. Nami ni kowi dow tawng lup paw enni nachang kown nadowi; lowra kowi enni cham uowi chepaw nami ni dow CHAKRAMANG vüi Tanai Ni chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Takat Pawi hai The pe tuah dowi mih kawm Pawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 23:4" />“CHAKRAMANG khowmta bowkta mih pawi maten dow khowmta bowkta mih ni khe enni nasunah reng kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 23:5" />Ning towng kowh la uown kowi lacher laitali ni khe sat kup khowk now CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi kowh Takat Pawi natarowng kown. <verse eid="LEV 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 23:6" />Now nami la lacher laitanga ni hownia dow CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi kowh The pe tuah dowi mih kawm Pawi natarowng kown. Nakhowk khe dow ranit ni mowr mih the pe tuah mih kawm enni naia cha kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 23:6" /><verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="LEV 23:7-8" />Nami ranit ni kowi auown ni hai achur ni khe dow arasang enni natakua kown; nami pre ni mih dow tawng lup paw enni nachang kown nadowi. Nami ranit ni mowr ni towng CHAKRAMANG vüi chakkham uanap enni nachang kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 23:7-8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chamüng Pawk Pawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="LEV 23:9-10" />CHAKRAMANG plan tek pe Mosi mih, “Mami laiklow Israeluüa kowi kowtek pe diah: Ang nape enni kown mih pren kowi enni kowuowi mih khin khe üa hai laih hownia enni ngen luprak towng enni rik ngenah mih hownia pacheng chi uamow tut-e enni nauang pawla reng kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 23:9-10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 23:11" />Nami luprak cheng dow Tanai Ni kung kowi kowh ni khe CHAKRAMANG pur kowi uamow nakrowngah kown. Nahanow CHAKRAMANG napaw enni kown towbowt. <verse eid="LEV 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 23:12" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG vüi tikah mih uanap chang müa aser auowk uowi dowi mih ruapur chah paningchow mih paw enni nauang apla apum kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 23:13" />Nami klen kowi kawmdi lang iung mih kowi kowh lawk pe kanrawn sau mih kawmdi paw pre set hown 800 gram uang pawla now enni naap-ah kown. Nami dow kawmdi uanap chekhai. Nami dow CHAKRAMANG vüi chakkham uanap chekhai. Nami uanap nam hown dow CHAKRAMANG awmrawm reng chekhai. Nami klen kowi khamah mih uanap chang müa iawng hai grep tui paw enni nauang pawla aset kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 23:14" />Naiawngün uanap CHAKRAMANG tut-e enni ki ap dowi mowr dow enni kowh luprak mih enni nacha kown nadowi tak. Naiawngün hown dow thawpla kawm chepaw, haiah chepaw, asing chepaw enni nacha kown nadowi tak. Lowra kowi enni cham uowi chepaw nami rirow dow chowngchowng saksakma enni nachünah kown mih chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bowthowk Pawi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 23:16">Uown Lawt 23:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 23:15" />“Enni uang pawla luprak cheng mih ni hownia ranit sapta mowr enni narüaah kown. <verse eid="LEV 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 23:16" />Now ranit sapta chur kowi kowh Tanai Ni kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG vüi luprak sar apra pawi enni nachang kown. Nami dow amülüngma mih uanap chang müa enni uang pawla luprak cheng mih ni hownia klowkah now 50 ni chih mih ni khe chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 23:17" />Nami ni khe dow amülüngma mih uanap chang müa kim towng hownia enni nauang pawla kawm pre pa chi kown takla. Nami kawmpah dow kawmdi lang iung mih pre set ngia mih hown kowh thawpah mih naown kown takla, now tuah paw nathela pe kown takla. Nami dow enni rik ngenah mih luprak sar hownia kowh CHAKRAMANG vüi amülüngma mih uanap chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 23:18" />Uang ap kawm mih khin khe paningchow mih ruapur chah ranit pum, chiala apum, now ruapurla pre pum enni nauang apla kown takla. Naiawngün tawncher kowi dow aser auowk naia uowi kown nadowi. Naiawngün tawncher hown dow CHAKRAMANG vüi tikah mih uanap pawi enni nachang kown takla, now nami tikah mih uanap hown dow kawmdi uanap hai khamah mih uanap paw enni uang apla kown. Naiawngün dow chakkham uanap chekhai; nami uanap nam hown dow CHAKRAMANG awmrawm reng chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 23:19" />“Nami klen kowi paw nachangla angak lawt lük müa uanap kownkow ruala apum, now nachangla taking tasangra uanap kownkow paningchow mih ruapur chah pre pum enni nauang apla kown. <verse eid="LEV 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 23:20" />Nami ruapur chah pre pum hai rik ngenah mih luprak hown kowh thawpah mih kawm dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi uamow nakrowngah kown. Nami dow amülüngma mih uanap chekhai. Naiawngün dow CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi kowh ap-ah mih chimsaima mih uanh chekhai. Naiawngün uanh dow uamowuüa kowh vüi bak naown kown. <verse eid="LEV 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 23:21" />Nami ni khe dow arasang takua kown mih khin enni nasunah kown. Nami ni khe dow tawng lup paw enni nachang kown nadowi. Lowra kowi enni cham uowi chepaw nami rirow dow chowngchowng saksakma enni nachünah kown mih chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 23:22" />“Üa kowi hai laih kowi enni kua luprak mih khin khe aria aret kowi kowh luprak dow enni nakuala kown nadowi, now dowh mih hai tim mih paw enni nalümla kown nadowi. Naiawngün dow pren kowi kowh ngarai miuüa hai akeng chenchapuüa vüi enni nata towla kown takla. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baw tün pawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="LEV 23:23-24" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Israeluüa kowi maiawng kowtek pe diah: Ning towng ranit la kowi kowh ni uown dow tawng lup paw nachang dowi kownkow enni naphuangah kown. Nami ni dow enni natum pe <char style="w">baw</char> hanow arasang takua kown mih khin enni nasunah kown. <verse eid="LEV 23:23-24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 23:25" />Nami ni khe dow tawng lup paw enni nachang kown nadowi. Nami ni kowi dow CHAKRAMANG vüi chakkham uanap pawi enni nachang kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Angak lawt lük müa pawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 23:26" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="LEV 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 23:27" />“Ranit la kowi kowh lacher hamüt ni khe dow angak lawt lük müa pawi enni nachang kown. Nami ni kowi dow achimsaima mih takuara khin enni nasunah kown, now angak hownia tarip mih krang natüngla kownkow enni nakhang hawm kown. Nami ni kowi dow CHAKRAMANG vüi chakkham uanap pawi paw enni nachangla kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 23:28" />Nami ni dow enni kowh angak lawt lük müa pawi chekhai rakowi tawng lup paw enni nachang kown nadowi. Nami ni dow enni kowh angak maten nalawtta enni kownkow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pur kowi uamow nachang enni uanap kown. <verse eid="LEV 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 23:29" />Nami ni kowi kowh <char style="w">khang hawm</char> dowi miuüa kowi dow amatni kowh chenchap hownia ang nabatta kown. <verse eid="LEV 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 23:30" />Now nami ni kowi kowh chang lup miuüa kowi paw amatni kowh chenchap pungmadawng hownia ang napiakta kown. <verse eid="LEV 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 23:31" />Nami ni khe dow tawng lup paw enni nachang kown nadowi. Lowra kowi enni cham uowi chepaw nami rirow dow chowngchowng saksakma enni nachünah kown mih chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 23:32" />Nami ni dow enni vüi Tanai Ni chekhai. Now nami ni khe dow khang pe hawm se enni nakham ngare kown takla. Nami Tanai Ni dow ranit la kowi kowh lacher taku ni khe sat kup hownia auai ni lacher hamüt ni sat kup iüp mowr enni nasunah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Pawi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:33-34 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Te Pawi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow Bowthowk Pawi chekhai.</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33-34" style="v" sid="LEV 23:33-34" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Mami laiklow Israeluüa kowi kowtek pe diah: Ranit la kowi kowh lacher laitanga ni khe dow CHAKRAMANG vüi <char style="w">Te Pawi</char> enni nachang kown. Nami Te Pawi dow ranit ni mowr enni nasunah kown. <verse eid="LEV 23:33-34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 23:35" />Nami pawi uown ni kowi dow arasang takua kown mih khin enni nasunah kown. Nami ni khe dow tawng lup paw enni nachang kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 23:36" />Nami ranit ni mih pawi ni chur dowi mowr dow ni towng CHAKRAMANG vüi chakkham uanap pawi enni nachang kown takla. Nami pawi chur mih auai ni khe paw arasang takua kown mih khin enni naplan sun iawk kown, now nami ni paw CHAKRAMANG vüi chakkham uanap pawi enni nachangla iawk kown takla. Naiawng rakowi nami ni paw tawng lup paw enni nachang kown nadowi tak.<verse eid="LEV 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 23:37" />“Naiawngün pawi maten dow CHAKRAMANG khowm bowk enni mih chekhai. Nami pawi ni khe chakkham uanap enni naia changla kownkow arasang takua kown mih khin enni nasunah kown. Nami uanap kowi kowh enni naap-ah kown mih dow chakkham uanap, tikah mih uanap, kawmdi uanap, tawncher uanap hai khamah mih uanap chekhai. Naiawngün uanap maten dow CHAKRAMANG khowmta bowkta enni mih akhin kowi enni nachangah kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 23:38" />Nami klen kowi Tanai Ni kowi kowh uanap, CHAKRAMANG vüi akeng mih uanap maten, takhamta mih rakowi kowh uanap hai kowmatia sak nau hown kowh uanap paw enni naia ap kown.<verse eid="LEV 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 23:39" />“Üa hai laih kowi kowh luprak enni ki tawnta prowng khe ranit la kowi kowh lacher laitanga ni khe CHAKRAMANG vüi te pawi enni nasun kown. Nami te pawi dow ranit ni mowr enni nasunah kown takla. Nami pawi auown ni hai raiat ni mih ni dow enni vüi Tanai Ni naown kown. <verse eid="LEV 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 23:40" />Pawi uown ni kowi dow singh hownia kowh uih-ak lang iung mih ün, chekmarawng ram ün, uaklung kawng hai aw pang kowi kowh aram chakma mih singh mia ün enni nacham krawi paw kown. Now CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pur kowi ranit ni mowr enni napiaw kown. <verse eid="LEV 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 23:41" />CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi kowh nami pawi dow ning towng ranit ni mowr chi enni nasunah kown. Nami pawi dow ning towng kowh ranit la khe enni nachang kown takla. Nami dow chowngchowng saksakma enni nachünah kown mih rirow chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 23:42" />Nami pawi sun khe dow enni Israeluüa maten ranit ni mowr te kowi nauowi kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 23:43" />Aigupta pren hownia ang uang lawtla enni khe te kowi ang pe uowi enni khai, now nami lawnguan dow nami pawi sunra hownia enni kowh krungchakuüa natuk kown towbowt. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 23:44" />Nami kung kowi dow Mosi kowkowiah now CHAKRAMANG khowmta bowkta pe mih pawi lawnguan maten Israeluüa kowi kowtek pe khai.<verse eid="LEV 23:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LEV 24" />
  <para style="s">Mingkhet maibu towngh kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 24:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="LEV 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 24:2" />“Mami ang kowh ana pek Israeluüa kowi kowtek pe diah: <char style="w">Maibu towngh</char> kowi kowh maibu atungma naia towkla reng kownkow küaah now achangma mih kanrawn sau en tut-e pacham uang pawla büa lah. <verse eid="LEV 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 24:3" />Nami maibu towngh dow taklowp taklangra te lak kowi kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kra müa uaniang uat kowi chekhai. Nami maibu dow sat kup hownia sat lawt mowr chi atungma CHAKRAMANG pur kowi Arawn natowkah kown takla. Nami dow chowngchowng saksakma nachünah kown mih rirow chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 24:4" />CHAKRAMANG pur kowi towah mih achangma mih kuh hown kowh maibu towngh uowi. Nami luk kowi kowh maibu maten dow atungma natatowk reng kownkow Arawn namingah kown.<verse eid="LEV 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG pur kowi kowh towah mih chimsaima mih kawm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 24:5" />“Uamowuüa kowi kawmdi aiungma mih hown en nape thawpah kawm laipre pah hanow nape awpah kown. Nami kawm apah kowi kawmdi pre set ngia en nape thawpah kown. <verse eid="LEV 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 24:6" />Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi kowh towah mih achangma mih kuh hown kowh sowah mih <char style="w">pawitang</char> luk kowi nami kawmpah mih natowah pre tan kown. Nami kawm dow patan kowi taruk pa chi natowah kown. <verse eid="LEV 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 24:7" />Nami pre tan mih kawmpah re-e dow anam iungma mih maikhük towk müa achangma mih than natowah kown takla. CHAKRAMANG vüi chakkham uanap iawng hai kawmpah takcha nami than mih uamow natikah kown. <verse eid="LEV 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 24:8" />Israeluüa hownia kowh nami kawmpah dow Tanai Ni towng CHAKRAMANG pur kowi Arawn natowah kown. Nami dow Israel krungchakuüa kowh chowngchowng saksakma mih rirow chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 24:9" />Nami kawm dow Arawn hai achapauüa mih arah chimsaima mih re-e nachaah büah kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami dow CHAKRAMANG vüi chakkham uanap kowi kowh lang chimsai mih uanh chekhai. Nami kawm dow chowngchowng saksakma amatni kowh vüi bak chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG ming kowi tek naklak mih maru kowh ripra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="LEV 24:10-11" />Akat khe Israel chenchap Dan krungchak kowi kowh Dibri chama Selawmit pami dow Aigupta maru hown <char style="w">tachawng</char> khai. Amatchi dow Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi tawi uowi khai. Amatchi kowh dow chapa uowi lowk ia chekhai. Akat khe amatchi kowh chapa mih Israel chenchap maru lowk ia hown tangbung khup rah kowi takhüm khai. Nami khin khe kowiüah kowh chapa dow CHAKRAMANG ming kowi tek naklak khai. Naiawng tek naklak mih ta hanow maru kawmuüa mih nami maru kowi Mosi tut-e kowpawla khai. <verse eid="LEV 24:10-11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 24:12" />Now tawng chow nachangah kown mih CHAKRAMANG hownia ka ana büah dowi mowr nami maru kowi klungta hüah hanow chawngah büah khai.<verse eid="LEV 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 24:13" />Now CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="LEV 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 24:14" />“Ang ming kowi tek naklak mih maru kowi dow tangbung khup rah uat kowi kowpawla büa diah. Nami maru tek naklak khe kowh tawi ta mih maten nami maru lu kowi tang pe rut hanow pacham thuak saksi lah. Nami kung kowi Israeluüa maten mih nami maru kowi hua hown kowng pat pacham kuakah lah. <verse eid="LEV 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 24:15" />Israeluüa kowi kowtek pe diah: CHAKRAMANG ming kowi tek naklak mih maru dow aia kowh angak sung aia naka ripra kown <verse eid="LEV 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 24:16" />CHAKRAMANG ming kowi tek naklak mih maru kowi dow nakowngta ngengche kown takla. Israeluüa chepaw, Israeluüa tut-e kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa chepaw CHAKRAMANG ming kowi tek naklak mih maru kowi dow nakowngta ngengche kown takla. Naiawng mih maru kowi dow kowng pat huaklu hown Israeluüa nakuakah kown takla.<verse eid="LEV 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 24:17" />“Sai maru mih kowi dow aia kowi paw nasaita kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 24:18" />Maru kowh tawncher krawi saita mih klai dow tawncher kowh tawncher klai naiaw kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 24:19" />Krawi bawp maru kowh piakta pe maru buk kow khai hanow abawp miia kowi paw bawp kowh bawp klai nabawpah kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 24:20" />Aia kowi dow hut kowh hut klai, mik kowh mik klai, iüng kowh iüng klai napaw pe kown. Aia krawi chang mih iawng aia kowi paw nachangah kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 24:21" />Saita tawncher mih maru dow tawncher kowh tawncher klai nape kown takla. Tawkche saita maru mih dow aia kowi paw nasaita kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 24:22" />Nami rirow dow enni Israeluüa vüi hai enni tut-e kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa vüi hown arisang nachangah kown. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 24:23" />Naiawngün laiklow dow Israeluüa kowi Mosi kowtek pe khai. Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowi pe piati mih maru kowi tangbung khup rah uat kowi cham pawla hanow huaklu hown kowng pat maru kawmuüa kuakah khai. Israeluüa mih Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah ana iawng rowprowp changah khai.<verse eid="LEV 24:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="LEV 25" />
  <para style="s">Tanai ning</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="LEV 25:1-2" />Sinai hungh kowi uowi khe Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Mami laiklow Israeluüa kowi kowtek pe diah: Ang nape enni kown mih pren kowi enni kowuowi mih khin khe enni kowh üa hai laih kowi ranit ning kowi paning chi CHAKRAMANG vüi enni nape tanaiah kown. <verse eid="LEV 25:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 25:3" />Taruk ning mowr dow enni kowh üa hai laih kowi enni nasawt liu kown, grep ruih prek paw enni nakrawi plet kown, now luprak paw enni napaw kown. <verse eid="LEV 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 25:4" />Tawkche ranit ning mih ning khe dow enni kowh üa hai laih kowi enni nape tanaiah kown takla. Nakhowk khe dow liu paw enni nasawt kown nadowi, now grep ruih prek paw enni naplet kown nadowi. Nami dow CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi kowh tanai ning chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 25:5" />Enni changah mih hownia nami ning kowi kowh awr ta phaw mih srui dow enni nakrawi ia paw kown nadowi bowt, now plet pe amia prek dowi kowi awr ta uih mih grep paw enni nakrawi ia paw kown nadowi. Nami paning mih dow üa hai laih kowi enni nape tanaiah phülü kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 25:5" /><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="LEV 25:6-7" />Nachenganchepaw nami paning mih dow enni ienah mih nadowi kowi iawngpa awr ta phaw mih towbowt enni nacha kown. Naiawngün dow enni matia vüi, enni kowh narma narlauüa vüi, akeng mih chenchap hownia kowh enni tut-e uang tawi kowi sukkri miuüa vüi, akeng mih prenlang maru-uüa vüi, tawncher hawmh vüi hai kaurawng uaramchak hawmh vüi chakkham naown kown.<verse eid="LEV 25:6-7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jubili ning rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 25:8" />“Ranit ning kowi akat chi tanai ning enni klowkah now tanai ning ranit kat chih khe dow 49 ning chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 25:9" />Nami 49 ning chur kowh 50 ning uang ting khe dow ranit la kowi kowh lacher hamüt ni khe enni kowh pren paprenma kowi enni natum baw kown. Nami ni dow Angak Lawt Lük Ni chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 25:10" />Nami 50 ning mih ning kowi dow CHAKRAMANG vüi chimsaima enni nasunah kown. Nami ning khe dow pren kowi kowh maru maten tut-e thaulangra laiklow enni naphuang kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami ning kowi dow enni sumta mih kim ün, krawng bawn ün enni plan kata iawk kown, now cham uowi nar miuüa paw nakhalat bowt kown. Nami ning kowi dow ‘Jubili ning<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jubili ning </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dow sumta khowk mih dawngthawnguan plan kata iawk kown mih hai nar hownia ka lawt kown mih ning chekhai.</char></note>’ pahai enni narük pe kown. <verse eid="LEV 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 25:11" />50 ning chih towng enni vüi <char style="w">Jubili</char> ning naown kown. Nami ning kowi dow üa hai laih kowi paw enni nasawt liu kown nadowi, now awr ta phaw mih srui paw enni nakrawi paw kown nadowi. Nami klen kowi plet pe amia prek dowi kowi awr ta uih mih grep paw enni nakrawi klek kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 25:12" />Nami ning dow Jubili ning chekhai. Naiawng rakowi nami ning dow chimsaima pahai enni nachünah kown takla. Nami ning kowi dow üa hai laih kowi kowh iawngpa awr phaw mih towbowt enni nacha kown.<verse eid="LEV 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 25:13" />“Nami Jubili ning khe dow kowmatia sumta khowk mih dawngthawnguan naplan kata iawk kown. <verse eid="LEV 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 25:14" />Enni matia pungmadawng kowi tasum taran krawng bawn khai hanow lowkkowlowk hang takuan büa diah. <verse eid="LEV 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 25:15" />Enni tasum taran krawng bawn khai hanow asum mih hai aran mih amatchi pre ia trui nachangah ingsap kown. Jubili ning uang ting kown mih takra kowi mün ning tak chow naka lup kown mih nachangah ingsap iüah now nami iawng asung natapaw tape iüah kown. <verse eid="LEV 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 25:16" />Jubili ning uang ting kown mih che akrama tak hanow nami krawng bawn sung paw enni nakhakah kown takla. Tawkche nami Jubili ning uang ting kown mih che tawn iawlaw khowk hanow nami krawng bawn sung paw enni natanta kown takla. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nalupah kown mih ning chowtaih enni natasum taran kown. <verse eid="LEV 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 25:17" />Lowkkowlowk hang takuan büa diah. Enni bowkbowk Thurai kowi ringkawma hown enni nakramah kown takla. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 25:18" />“Ang kowh rirow hai ang kowh ari aiang enni nachün kown takla. Nami che enni chün hanow enni kowh pren kowi thaulangma enni naia uowi kown. <verse eid="LEV 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 25:19" />Nami klen kowi luprak paw ahuma enni naka kown; mu duma hown thaulangma enni naia uowi bowt kown. <verse eid="LEV 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 25:20" />Maiawng enni ka tuak chepaw naia, ‘Ranit ning mih ning kowi che lup üa lup laih dowi hanow tawng chow a-i nacha kown,’ napa kown. <verse eid="LEV 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 25:21" />Tawngpaw hangkow tuak krat büah. Taruk ning mih ning khe lainowmma ang nape enni prasi kown. Nami ning kowi dow sum ning chak vüi enni naka luprak kown. <verse eid="LEV 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 25:22" />Naiawng rakowi raiat ning mih ning kowi enni sawt liu khe paw nami luprak prim enni nacha kown, now taku ning mih ning kowi paw enni ngen luprak dowi mowr nami luprak prim enni naka cha kown.<verse eid="LEV 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dawngthawnguan klan rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 25:23" />“Chowngchowng saksakma vüi miapaw enni naia sumta krawng bawn kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow krawng bawn dow ang kowh chowtaih. Nami dow prenlang maru kowi iawng ang pe tawng enni mih krowngchow taih chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 25:24" />Enni sum krawng bawn chepaw naia klanla iawk kown mih alow enni natowla reng kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 25:25" />Enni pungmadawng kowi ngarai lai kowh kowmatia kimchakuüa kowh krawng bawn sumta khai ne hanow sum mih maru kowh lang tasin taken mih tainau nami krawng bawn nakrawi klan kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 25:26" />Now naiawng nakrawi klan pe kown mih maru miapaw uowi dowi hanow akung kowi aia kowh aklan müa uowi khe aia matia chepaw naia klan kown. <verse eid="LEV 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 25:27" />Tawkche aia naklanta kown mih ning hownia Jubili ning nauang ting kown mih nachang ingsap hanow lahawm taka iawng naplanta pe asung kown takla. Nami kung kowi dow aia kowh krawng bawn aia naplan ka iawk kown towbowt. <verse eid="LEV 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 25:28" />Nachenganchepaw naplan klanla krawng bawn kown mih pawisa tangka che aia ia kram dowi hanow aia kowh krawng bawn mih Jubili ning uang talen dowi mowr aran mih tut-e nauowi kown. Now Jubili ning uang ting khe dow aia kowh krawng bawn aia naplan ka iawk kown taih.<verse eid="LEV 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 25:29" />“Tap uowi mih marow kowi kowh kim che sumta khai hanow sumta mih ning paning mowr dow asum miia naia klan kown mih alow nauowi kown. Nami paning lak kowi dow aia sumta mih kim aia naia klan kown. <verse eid="LEV 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 25:30" />Tawkche sumta mih ning paning lak kowi che nami kim aia ia klan dowi hanow naka klan kown nadowi bowt. Nami klen kowi Jubili ning khe paw nami dow naplan ka iawk kown nadowi bowt. Nami kim dow achowngma aran miia hai aran miia kowh krungchakuüa vüi nachowng kown towbowt. <verse eid="LEV 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 25:31" />Nachenganchepaw <char style="w">tap</char> uowi dowi mih kua kowi kowh kim dow akuangma mih krawng bawn iawng nadowkah kown takla. Naiawng mih kua kowi kowh kim dow sumta chepaw lowra mih khin khe naia klan kown, now klanah dowi chepaw Jubili ning khe dow naplan kata iawk kown.<verse eid="LEV 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 25:32" />“Leviuüa tarapdow nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow amatni vüi kowi peah mih marow lak kowi kowh kim sumta khai chepaw lowra mih khin khe naia klan büah kown. <verse eid="LEV 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 25:33" />Now ia klan dowi chepaw Jubili ning khe dow naplan ka büah iawk kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün kim dow nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia amatni kaah mih chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 25:34" />Tawkchedow amatni kowh marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng dow mapaw naia sum büah kown nadowi; nami dow amatni kowh chowngchowng saksakma vüi dawngthawnguan chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 25:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngarai miuüa kowi khowngah kown mih rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 25:35" />“Enni Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kimping namkhetuüa ngarai lai kowh kowmatia chakkham hai khupdip tawngklai ia takram dowi mih maru uowi chepaw naia kown. Naiawng mih maru kowi dow enni nakhowngah reng kown takla. Naiawng mih maru dow enni tut-e natawi ia uowila kownkow prenlang maru-uüa kowi enni khowngah iawng enni nakhowngah reng kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 25:35" /><verse number="36-37" style="v" sid="LEV 25:36-37" />Ngaraima mih maru-uüa paw enni tut-e natawi ia uowila reng kownkow enni peah tangka khawi chepaw, enni sum pe chakkham chepaw enni napaw pe marat kown nadowi. Enni kowh Thurai kowi ringkawma hown enni nakramah kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 25:36-37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 25:38" />Ang dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai chekhai. Aigupta pren hownia ang uang lawtla enni mih dow nape enni Kanan pren kownkow hai enni kowh Thurai ang nachowngla kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 25:39" />“Enni Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi che ngarai lai kowh kowmatia sak nau hown cham tasum mih uowi khai hanow nami maru kowi dow nar iawng enni natawngah kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 25:40" />Naiawng mih maru kowi dow akeng prenchak uang kowi sukkri miuüa hai akeng prenchakuüa kowi enni tawngah kengah iawng enni natawngah kown takla. Naiawng mih maru dow Jubili ning uang ting dowi mowr nachang enni lup kown. <verse eid="LEV 25:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 25:41" />Jubili ning uang ting khe dow amasi chauüa hailawm aia kowi enni nalawtta kown takla. Nahanow nami maru mih aia kimchakuüa tut-e, aia pipu-uüa kowh dawngthawnguan kowi naplan bowt kown. <verse eid="LEV 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 25:42" />Enni Israeluüa dow ang kowh nar chowtaih. Aigupta pren hownia uang lawtla enni mih dow ang chekhai. Naiawng rakowi maru nachangla enni nar kownkow miapaw enni cham ia tasum kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 25:43" />Lowkkowlowk enni natachang nowng kown nadowi. Naiawng hai enni kowh Thurai kowi ringkawma hown enni kramah mih enni natüngah kown.<verse eid="LEV 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 25:44" />“Enni tawn nar kown nau hanow enni riaret kowi kowh prenchakuüa kowi enni naia ran kown taih. <verse eid="LEV 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 25:45" />Enni tut-e kowh uang tawi uowi mih akeng prenchakuüa kowi hai enni pren kowi kowh dia mih akeng prenchakuüa kowi dow nachangla nar kownkow enni naia ran kown. Naiawngünuüa dow enni kowh dawngthawnguan nachowng kown. <verse eid="LEV 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 25:46" />Naiawngün nar dow kowmatia kowh dawngthawnguan iawng hai akung kowi kowmatia chauüa kowi enni naia towla pe kown. Naiawngünuüa kowi dow achowngma enni naia changla nar kown. Nachenganchepaw enni matia chenchapuüa hown dow enni naia tachang nowng kown nadowi.<verse eid="LEV 25:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngaraima miuüa kowi klan kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 25:47" />“Enni pungmadawng kowi kowh uang tawi uowi mih akeng prenchak maru paw naia kureng kown, now enni Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh maru paw naia ngarai kown. Nami khin khe nami ngaraima mih maru natawi chang nar lup kownkow nami prenlang maru tut-e chepaw, aia krungchakuüa tut-e chepaw kowtasum khai hanow <verse eid="LEV 25:47" /><verse number="48-49" style="v" sid="LEV 25:48-49" />aia kowh dow naia taklanla kown mih alow nauowi reng kown. Aia kowi dow atainau-uüa chepaw, aia pahi pamauüa chepaw, pahi pama chauüa chepaw, aia kowh akeng mih tasin taken miuüa chepaw nakrawi ia klanah kown. Now aia matia paw naia taklanla kown mih kür che uowi khowk hanow naia taklan kown. <verse eid="LEV 25:48-49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 25:50" />Aia che taklan kown nau hanow aia taklan kown mih ning hownia klowkah kowh Jubili ning nauang ting kown mih mün ning tak chow uowi mih nachangah ingsap kown, now asung plan takla mowr mih aia kowi kowh ranah miia kowi napela kown. <verse eid="LEV 25:50" /><verse number="51-52" style="v" sid="LEV 25:51-52" />Jubili ning nauang ting kown mih khin akrama tak hanow asung huma aplan takla tak, now Jubili ning nauang ting kown mih kra dowk hanow asung a-echow towbowt aplan takla kown. Naiawng hai aia matia naia taklan kown. <verse eid="LEV 25:51-52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 25:53" />Aia kowi dow cham uowi ningphawng mih maru kowi iawng aran miia natuakah kown takla, now nami maru kowi hawt ran miia changah anowng apowng dowi pat enni Israeluüa nakhetla kaneu kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 25:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 25:54" />Naiawng hai aia kowi ia klanah dowi chepaw aia hai aia chauüa mih dow Jubili ning khe naia lawt kown. Jubili ning khe dow aia kowi mih kim iah nalawtta ngengche kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 25:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 25:55" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow Israeluüa dow ang kowh nar chowtaih. Amatni kowi Aigupta pren hownia ang uang lawtla mih dow ang nachangla ang nar kownkow chekhai. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 25:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="LEV 26" />
  <para style="s">Thurai ana pek chün mih prasira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 26:1" />“Tawng iawng mih arup aren paw enni nathawp kown nadowi. Singh hown chepaw, hua hown chepaw enni nathawp arup kown nadowi. Nachup naiiaah kownkow enni thawp pe arup mih hua dow enni pren kowi enni naia tow kown nadowi. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 26:2" />Ang kowh Tanai Ni maten enni nasunah reng kown takla; ang kowh taklowp taklangra te chimsaima mih kowi enni naring nakawah kown takla. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="LEV 26:3-4" />“Enni che ang kowh ari arow hai ang kowh ana pek chün khai hanow akhin khe ang nape enni uang kown. Nahanow enni kowh üa hai laih kowi luprak ahuma naphaw kown, now uih-ien pantawn paw ahuma nauih napau kown. <verse eid="LEV 26:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 26:5" />Nami khin khe dow luprak phaw lai rakowi grep uih klek khin mowr enni nathua püm kown, now grep paw uih lai rakowi püm sawt khin mowr enni naka klek kown. Nakhowk khe dow mu duma enni naka cha kown, now pren kowi mih thaulangma enni nauowi kown.<verse eid="LEV 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 26:6" />“Pren kowi mih thaulangma ang natowah kown. Nahanow thaulangma hown enni naka müi bowt kown, now amia iawng mih maru paw natüng enni kramra kown nadowi bowt. Arangpranma mih kaurawng uaramchak kowi paw enni pren hownia alakma kowi ang nacham prütta kown. Enni pren kowi tawng iawng mih ransu-uüa paw nauang sen enni kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="LEV 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 26:7" />Tawkche enni mih ransu-uüa kowi nakawikrawiah kown, now amatni kowi dow saidawng hown enni nakrawi saita bowk kown. <verse eid="LEV 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 26:8" />Akawm ia ransu-uüa kowi dow tanga iachow hown enni nakrawiah kown, now hamüt thawng ransu-uüa kowi dow akawm iachow hown enni nakrawiah kown. Amatni kowi dow saidawng hown enni nasaita bowk kown. <verse eid="LEV 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 26:9" />Nakhowk khe dow ang nasaksing sana enni kown, now maru iun paw ahuma ang nape prung enni kown. Enni hown kowh ang kowh sangbowk laitawm mih anikma ang natowah bowt kown. <verse eid="LEV 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 26:10" />Enni kaah mih luprak hu lai rakowi ning sar kowi kowh luprak enni nanungah kownkow anungra kowi kowh luprak prim enni nakuakta kown. <verse eid="LEV 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 26:11" />Enni tut-e ang natawi uowi reng kown; ang nasui enni kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="LEV 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 26:12" />Enni hown ang natawi taiua mang reng kown; enni kowh Thurai ang nachowng kown. Now enni dow ang kowh maru nachowng kown. <verse eid="LEV 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 26:13" />Ang dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai chekhai. Aigupta pren hownia ang uang lawtla enni mih dow Aigupta nar lup chang hownia enni pacham khalat lah pakowh chekhai. Enni pangkawt kowi kowh namuai ang klüpta enni hanow thaulangma hown ang pe mang enni khai.<verse eid="LEV 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai ana pek chün dowi mih ripra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 26:14" />“Nachenganchepaw enni che ang laiklow sünta dowi, ang kowh ana pek maten chün dowi, <verse eid="LEV 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 26:15" />ang kowh ari arow ün nuata khai, ang kowh ari aiang sui khai, now ang kowh sangbowk laitawm enni piakta khai hanow <verse eid="LEV 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 26:16" />maiawng ang nachang enni kown: Enni luk kowi kramra uowima mih rawka hai krau ang nauang pawla enni kown. Naiawngün rawka hown enni kowh mik napiak kown, now enni kowh kür paw na-e rürü kown. Nami khin khe dow enni sawt liu chepaw mrawkra nauowi kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni kowh luprak dow ransu-uüa chowtaih nacha enni kown. <verse eid="LEV 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 26:17" />Enni kowi dow ang nakingküa enni kown. Naiawng rakowi enni dow ransu-uüa tut-e nasum kown. Enni suiah mih maru-uüa mih enni luk kowi nachang alow kown, now maru krawi enni dowi chepaw enni napowt kown.<verse eid="LEV 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 26:18" />“Naiawng phaw kung kowi paw enni che ang laiklow chün dowi hanow enni kowh angak ripra ang nalang chüt enni ranit phow kown. <verse eid="LEV 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 26:19" />Enni kowh kür hown enni chang bawri khai. Nami bawrira dow ang napiakta enni kown. Mukuang dow lawngha iawng, now krawng dow kri iawng akhawtma ang nachangta enni kown. Mapaw ang nape enni uang kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 26:20" />Nakhowk khe dow enni kowh üa hai laih kowi mapaw luprak naphaw kown nadowi, now uih-ien pantawn paw naphaw kown nadowi. Nakhowk khe dow kawmkratma hown enni chang lup chepaw tawngpaw mrawkra nauowi kown nadowi.<verse eid="LEV 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 26:21" />“Naiawng ang chang enni kung kowi paw enni che <char style="w">kingküa</char> ang hai ang laiklow chün kown nau dowi hanow enni kowh angak ripra mih ang nalang chüt enni ranit phow iawk kown. <verse eid="LEV 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 26:22" />Enni pungmadawng kowi arangpranma mih kaurawng uaramchak ang nauang chin enni kown. Naiawngün kaurawng uaramchak dow enni kowh chauüa kowi nakowngta kown, now enni kowh tawncher maten kowi paw nakowngta bowk kown. Nakhowk khe dow enni kowh maru iun na-e kown towbowt. Naiawng hai enni kowh tiama ün akhaw aklaima nauowi kown.<verse eid="LEV 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 26:23" />“Naiawng phaw kung kowi paw enni che ang tek iawng chün dowi kowi kingküa ang reng tak hanow <verse eid="LEV 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 26:24" />ang matia ngengche nachowng enni kowh ransu hanow enni kowh angak ripra ang nalang chüt enni ranit phow iawk kown. <verse eid="LEV 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 26:25" />Now ang kowh sangbowk laitawm chün dowi rakowi enni luk kowi ang nauang pawla enni tasenra kown. Enni khita ransu-uüa now marow lak kowi enni nakup kown. Nakhowk khe dow enni luk kowi makowng hawi ang nauang chin enni kown, now ransu-uüa rut kowi ang naap enni kown. <verse eid="LEV 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 26:26" />Chakkham kramra tia ang napitta enni hanow akhawr hown enni nauowi kown. Nakhowk khe dow kawmdi e lai rakowi lowkchow mih taping kowi masiuüa hamüt ia naia awp kawm kown. Now chak khin khe dow nowkah khaiah rak hown enni nachaah kown. Mu du pat enni naka cha kown nadowi.<verse eid="LEV 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 26:27" />“Naiawng phaw kung kowi paw enni che ang laiklow chün dowi kowi kingküa ang reng tak hanow <verse eid="LEV 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 26:28" />ang paw kunmarauma hown nakingküa enni kown, now enni kowh angak ripra ang nalang chüt enni ranit phow iawk kown. <verse eid="LEV 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 26:29" />Nakhowk khe dow sakkrai lai bowt rakowi enni matia kowh chauüa nga enni nacha kown. <verse eid="LEV 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 26:30" />Arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara maten ang napiakta enni kown, enni kowh maikhük towk müa phuchuara paw ang napiakta enni kown. Enni kowh uak dow asung uowi dowi mih arup aren luk kowi mawngchawng iawng ang nakuakta enni pan kown. Now lainowmma ang nasui enni bowt kown. <verse eid="LEV 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 26:31" />Enni kowh marow maten ang napiakta enni kown, now enni kowh arah chimsai mih maten paw ang napiakta enni kown. Enni kowh uanap nam ang naawmrawm enni kown nadowi. <verse eid="LEV 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 26:32" />Enni kowh pren dow ang napiakta enni kown. Nami khi hanow enni kowh ransu-uüa mih natakrow kown. <verse eid="LEV 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 26:33" />Akeng chenchapuüa pungmadawng kowi ang nauet enni kown, now saidawng hown ang nasaita enni kown. Enni pren kowi kowh laih hai marow maten dow napiak bowk kown towbowt.<verse eid="LEV 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 26:34" />“Enni kowh pren kowi ari kowi uowi iawng tanai ning towng enni pe tanaiah dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi ransu-uüa pren kowi enni cham uowi mih khin khe enni kowh piaknama mih pren naka tanai bowt kown. <verse eid="LEV 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 26:35" />Enni matia pren kowi enni uowi mih khin khe enni kowh krawng bawn tanai mih ning kowi ün ka tanai dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi pren piak mih khin khe dow enni kowh krawng bawn naka tanai bowt kown. <verse eid="LEV 26:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 26:36" />Enni pungmadawng kowi kowh ta sing uowi miuüa kowi dow ransu-uüa pren kowi cham uowi khe amatni sak kowi ang napeah kramra kown. Nakhowk khe amatni dow li hut khe kowh singh ram chü mih tün kowi paw napowt büah kown. Tasenra kowi kram kowng kowh powt mih maru iawng amatni dow napowt kown. Now kung hownia amiapaw krawiah dowi chepaw amatni dow tingling townglowngma napowt hanow natatheu büah kown. <verse eid="LEV 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 26:37" />Kung hownia amiapaw kawikrawiah dowi chepaw amatni dow tasenra hownia naplaila kownkow powt mih maru iawng napowt hanow lowkkowlowk natachawn büah kown. Ransu-uüa kowi nakingküala kown mih kür enni kowh nauowi kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="LEV 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 26:38" />Akeng chenchapuüa pren kowi enni nacham tauet hanow enni nacham kowng kown. <verse eid="LEV 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 26:39" />Nami kung kowi paw enni pungmadawng kowi ta sing ne chepaw amatni dow amatni kowh angak hai amatni pipu-uüa kowh angak rakowi kow napiak rürü now nakowng büah kown.<verse eid="LEV 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pur prakowi kowh sakowmra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40-41" style="v" sid="LEV 26:40-41" />“Kingküa ang hai ang kaah sakowm iawng uowi büah dowi rakowi amatni kowi dow ang nakingküaah kown, now amatni kowi dow ransu-uüa pren kowi ang pawla kown. Tawkchedow nami ransu-uüa pren kowi che amatni kowh angak hai amatni pipu-uüa kowh angak rakowi lü lawt khai, amatni kowh saktuak paw khawtah dowi bowt, amatni kowh angak ripra kham kown mih nau khai bowt hanow <verse eid="LEV 26:40-41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 26:42" />Jakawb hai Isak hown Abraham büah hown kowh ang kowh sangbowk laitawm laiklow hai amatni kowh pren lawnguan ang naka tuakah kown. <verse eid="LEV 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 26:43" />Amatni dow pren hownia napowt takla ngengche kown, now pren dow nata piak kown. Nami khin khe dow akhaw aklaima mih pren aia kowh Tanai Ni naka sun bowt kown. Ang kowh ari aiang chün dowi mih hai ang kowh rirow sui mih rakowi amatni dow naka angak ripra ngengche kown.<verse eid="LEV 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 26:44" />“Nachenganchepaw ransu-uüa pren kowi amatni cham uowi khe paw chum pat dow ang nachumta kown nadowi. Amatni hown kowh ang kowh sangbowk laitawm dow ang napiakah kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 26:45" />Amatni vüi amatni pipu-uüa hown kowh ang kowh sangbowk laitawm laiklow dow ang naka tuakah kown. Amatni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai nachowngla kownkow amatni kowi dow akeng chenchapuüa pur iawng Aigupta pren hownia ang uang lawtla mih chekhai. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 26:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 26:46" />Naiawngün ana pek, ari aiang hai rirow dow Israeluüa vüi Sinai hungh kowi Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG peah mih chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 26:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="LEV 27" />
  <para style="s">Maru klan rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="LEV 27:1-2" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Mami laiklow Israeluüa kowi kowtek pe diah: Nape changah CHAKRAMANG lup kownkow CHAKRAMANG tut-e naap maru kown mih enni takhamta chepaw naia kown. Naiawng enni takhamta khai hanow enni naap ngengche kown takla. Nami maru kowi che enni kutplan klanta kown nau khai hanow uamow khowmta bowkta mih sung khowt napela kown takla. Nape kown mih dow maiawng. <verse eid="LEV 27:1-2" /><verse number="3-7" style="v" sid="LEV 27:3-7" />Pirmi ning luk hownia 60 ning mowr mih kachakuüa vüi dow tai 50 iun, now nami ning kowi kowh masiuüa vüi dow tai 30 iun chekhai. Tanga ning luk hownia pirmi ning mowr mih kachakuüa vüi dow tai 20 iun, now nami ning kowi kowh masiuüa vüi dow tai 10 iun chekhai. Palachow hownia tanga ning mowr mih kachakuüa vüi dow tai 5 iun, now nami ning kowi kowh masiuüa vüi dow tai 3 iun chekhai. Taruk kawm ning luk kowi kowh kachakuüa vüi dow tai 15 iun, now nami ning kowi kowh masiuüa vüi dow tai 10 iun chekhai. Naiawngün tai dow taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh akhai müa hown kowh khaiah mih chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 27:3-7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 27:8" />“Takhamta mih maru che ngarai lai kowh khowmta bowkta mih iawng ia pe dowi hanow naap-ah kown mih maru kowi uamow tut-e aia nakowpawla kown. Nahanow takhamta mih maru nowng pe mowr uamow nakhowm bowk pe kown.<verse eid="LEV 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tawncher klan rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 27:9" />“CHAKRAMANG vüi naap tawncher kownkow enni takham khai hanow nami tawncher dow chimsaima pahai enni nadowkah kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 27:10" />Nami tawncher takcha kowi akeng mih tawncher enni nape kown nadowi. Aiungma chepaw, angakma chepaw takhamta khowk mih tawncher takcha kowi akeng mih tawncher enni nape kown nadowi. Nami takcha kowi akeng mih tawncher che enni uang pe khai hanow pre pum trui CHAKRAMANG vüi achimsaima pahai enni nadowkah kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 27:11" />Sürlawkma mih tawncher che CHAKRAMANG tut-e naap kownkow enni takham khai hanow nami tawncher dow uamow tut-e enni nakowpawla kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 27:12" />Nami tawncher mih iung chepaw, nga chepaw uamow nahawt müah hanow nakhowm bowk pe asung kown, now nami tawncher sung dow uamow khowmta bowkta iawng towbowt nauowi kown. <verse eid="LEV 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 27:13" />Takhamta mih maru che nami tawncher naklanta kown nau khai hanow uamow khowmta mih asung klen kowi changah tanga bak kowi pabak sung nachüt pela kown takla.<verse eid="LEV 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kim klan rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 27:14" />“CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi enni pe kim khai hanow nami kim dow iung chepaw, nga chepaw uamow namüah now nakhowm nabowk pe asung kown, nahanow nami kim sung dow uamow khowmta bowkta iawng towbowt nauowi kown. <verse eid="LEV 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 27:15" />Nami kim che kim iah kutplan klanta kown nau khai hanow uamow khowmta bowkta mih asung klen kowi changah tanga bak kowi pabak sung nachüt pela kown takla.<verse eid="LEV 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Krawng bawn klan rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 27:16" />“Kowmatia kimchakuüa kowh krawng bawn che CHAKRAMANG kowi apta ne kown nau khai hanow mün khowt chow naia sawt liu kown mih changah ingsap now nami iawng asung enni nadowkah kown. Püm 180 set rawng krawng kowi tai 50 iun chi asung enni nadowkah kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 27:17" />Jubili ning kowi che CHAKRAMANG vüi enni pe krawng bawn khai hanow nami krawng bawn sung dow uamow khowm bowkta iawng achima nauowi kown. <verse eid="LEV 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 27:18" />Tawkche Jubili ning kung kowi che enni ap krawng bawn khai hanow auai kowh Jubili ning uang ting kown mih mün ning tak chow kra mih uamow nachangah ingsap kaneu kown. Now nami ning klowk uowi iawng uamow nakhowm enni asung kown. Naiawng chang hanow asung paw nalang e kown towbowt. <verse eid="LEV 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 27:19" />CHAKRAMANG kowi enni peta mih krawng bawn che enni naklanta kown nau khai hanow nami krawng bawn sung uamow khowmta bowkta mih klen kowi changah tanga bak kowi pabak sung enni nachüt pela kown takla. Nahanow nami krawng bawn dow enni naplan kata iawk kown towbowt.<verse eid="LEV 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 27:20" />“Nachenganchepaw nami krawng bawn che enni klanah dowi kowi akeng mih maru tut-e cham sumta khai hanow enni nau chepaw enni naka klan kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="LEV 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 27:21" />Jubili ning uang ting khe paw nami krawng bawn mih enni naplan ka kown nadowi bowt; nami dow chowngchowng saksakma CHAKRAMANG vüi lang krata mih nachowng kown towbowt. Nami krawng bawn dow uamow kowh dawngthawnguan nachowng bowt kown.<verse eid="LEV 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 27:22" />“Kowmatia kimchakuüa kowh krawng bawn nadowi kowi cham ranah mih krawng bawn che CHAKRAMANG vüi enni ap khai hanow <verse eid="LEV 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 27:23" />auai kowh Jubili ning uang ting mowr e mün ning chow uowi tak mih uamow nachangah ingsap kaneu kown. Nami ning klowk iawng uamow nakhowm enni asung kown. Tawkchedow nami krawng bawn sung mih nami ni kowi CHAKRAMANG vüi chimsaima mih uanh iawng enni napeta kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 27:24" />Nachenganchepaw Jubili ning uang ting khe dow enni ran pe krawng bawn mih maru tut-e chepaw, aia krungchakuüa tut-e chepaw enni nakowplanta pe iawk kown takla.<verse eid="LEV 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 27:25" />“Naiawngün sung maten dow taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh akhai müa hown enni nakhai kown. Taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh akhai müa <char style="w">sekel</char> hown pasekel now tai aiun dik chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tawncher kowi kowh rik pen mih klan rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 27:26" />“Chia chah chepaw, ruapur chah chepaw tawncher kowi kowh rik pen mih ala dow CHAKRAMANG vüi enni naap-ah kown nadowi bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow tawncher kowi kowh uang rik pen mih ala maten dow CHAKRAMANG kowh chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 27:27" />Now tawncher sürlawkma mih kowi kowh rik pen mih ala chah CHAKRAMANG vüi ap kown mih enni takhamta chepaw naia kown. Naiawng enni takham khai hanow uamow khowm bowk enni mih asung klen kowi changah tanga bak kowi pabak sung nachüt pela now tawncher mih enni naia klan kown. Now klan kown che enni nau dowi hanow uamow khowmta bowkta mih sung khowt nacham sumah kown takla.<verse eid="LEV 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 27:28" />“Kimchakuüa kowh krawng bawn chepaw, maru chepaw, tawncher chepaw CHAKRAMANG vüi enni lang krata khowk hanow nami dow naia sumah kown nadowi bowt, now klan paw enni naia klan kown nadowi bowt. Naiawngün dow CHAKRAMANG vüi lang chimsai mih uanh pahai enni nadowkah kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 27:29" />Now lowra mih maru kowi nakowngta kownkow khowm bowkta khai bowt hanow nami maru kowi dow enni naia klan kown nadowi bowt. Nami maru kowi dow nakowngta ngengche kown takla.<verse eid="LEV 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hamüt bak kowi pabak mih uanh klan rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 27:30" />“Üa hai laih hownia kowh kaah mih luprak srui dow hamüt bak kowi pabak mih CHAKRAMANG vüi chekhai. Uih-ak chepaw, luprak chepaw hamüt bak kowi pabak dow CHAKRAMANG vüi lang krata mih chekhai. <verse eid="LEV 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 27:31" />Nami hamüt bak kowi pabak mih uanh che enni klan kown nau khai hanow nami uanh sung klen kowi changah tanga bak kowi pabak sung enni nachüt pela kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 27:32" />Tawncher hawmh pungmadawng kowi paw rüaah hanow hamüt kowi kowh tatawng mih dow CHAKRAMANG vüi enni nalang krata papum chi kown takla. <verse eid="LEV 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 27:33" />Rüaah khe kowh CHAKRAMANG vüi bak tatawng mih tawncher dow iung chepaw, nga chepaw enni naia klingklai kown nadowi. Nami tawncher takcha akeng mih hown che enni klingklaiah khai hanow nami pre pum trui CHAKRAMANG vüi lang krata mih nachowng kown towbowt; nami dow naia klan kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="LEV 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 27:34" />Naiawngün ana maten dow Israeluüa vüi Sinai hungh kowi Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG peah mih chekhai.<verse eid="LEV 27:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 27" />
</usx>